(def copy
  {:ar {" and " " و ", "(no label)" "(بلا تسمية)", ". The full guide is at " ". الدليل الكامل متوفر على ", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." ". يتم إلغاء الرموز واحدًا تلو الآخر من القائمة أعلاه؛ ومنذ تلك اللحظة تستجيب API بالرمز 401 token-revoked.", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "يلزم وجود خطة Team أو Enterprise.", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "انتهت صلاحية فحص AML/CTF. يلزم إعادة المراجعة.", "About charges" "حول الرسوم", "Account" "الحساب", "Add or resume card" "إضافة بطاقة أو استئناف", "All legacy tokens revoked." "تم إلغاء جميع الرموز القديمة.", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "تُصدَر المؤسسة كمعرّف did:webvh DID، وتُدار العضوية باستخدام بيانات اعتماد قابلة للتحقق (VC). يحصل المُنشئ على دور المالك (owner).", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "تتم الموافقة تلقائيًا عند اكتمال العملية في Stripe. حدّث هذه الصفحة لرؤية التغيير. إذا غادرت عملية إدخال البطاقة في منتصفها، يمكنك استئنافها أدناه.", "Approved scopes" "النطاقات المعتمدة", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "المصادقة عبر مزود الهوية (IdP) للمؤسسة", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "متوفر للمؤسسات على خطط Team / Enterprise. لا يتم دعم SAML حتى الآن.", "Billing and credits" "الفوترة والأرصدة", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "الفوترة قيد التحقق. لا تتوفر عمليات الشراء حتى الآن.", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "تحتاج الفوترة إلى تسوية. تواصل مع الدعم.", "Billing service unavailable." "خدمة الفوترة غير متوفرة.", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "تم إلغاء إدخال البطاقة. يمكنك الاستئناف أدناه.", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "تم استلام البطاقة. تتم الموافقة بعد إشعار من Stripe، ويستغرق ذلك ثوانٍ عادةً. استخدم 状態を更新 لإعادة التحقق.", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "التحقق من البطاقة: سجّل بطاقة ائتمان أو خصم لإتمام العملية (checkout.stripe.com). لا تُقبل البطاقات مسبقة الدفع أو الافتراضية.", "Checking sign-in state…" "جارٍ التحقق من حالة تسجيل الدخول…", "Checking the identity provider…" "جارٍ التحقق من مزود الهوية…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "جارٍ التحقق من حالة تسجيل دخولك…", "Configured" "مُهيَّأ", "Connection token (shown once)" "رمز الاتصال (يُعرض مرة واحدة)", "Continue with GitHub" "الاستمرار باستخدام GitHub", "Continue with Google" "الاستمرار باستخدام Google", "Copied." "تم النسخ.", "Copy" "نسخ", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "انسخ الرمز واحفظه الآن. لن يُعرض مرة أخرى.", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "تعذّر التحقق من حالة تسجيل الدخول. حدّث الصفحة.", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "تعذّر الإنشاء. حدّث الصفحة وأعد المحاولة.", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "تعذّر الإصدار. حدّث الصفحة وأعد المحاولة.", "Could not load." "تعذّر التحميل.", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "تعذّر الاتصال بـ Stripe. حاول مرة أخرى بعد قليل؛ وإذا استمرت المشكلة، تواصل مع support@kotoba.cloud.", "Could not read linked accounts." "تعذّرت قراءة الحسابات المرتبطة.", "Could not remove." "تعذّر الحذف.", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "تعذّر الإلغاء. حدّث الصفحة وأعد المحاولة.", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "تعذّر البدء. حدِّث الصفحة وأعد المحاولة.", "Could not unlink." "تعذّر فصل الربط.", "Create an organization first." "أنشئ مؤسسة أولاً.", "Create organization" "إنشاء مؤسسة", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "جارٍ إنشاء جلسة التحقق في Stripe…", "Creating the organization…" "جارٍ إنشاء المؤسسة…", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "يمكن إضافة التحقق من الوثائق (Stripe Identity، verify.stripe.com). تُرسَل تفاصيل البطاقة والوثائق إلى Stripe فقط؛ ويحتفظ kotoba.cloud بالحالة وتاريخ الانتهاء ومرجع الإثبات فقط. تنتهي صلاحية التحقق بعد 365 يومًا.", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "يُعتمد كل نطاق بحثي بشكل مستقل. لا يمكن للنطاق المنتهي الصلاحية أو المعلَّق تشغيل الاستدلال.", "Eligible" "مؤهَّل", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "مؤهَّل. حصتك المجانية متاحة.", "Email domains" "نطاقات البريد الإلكتروني", "Environment variables" "متغيرات البيئة", "Free allowance" "الحصة المجانية", "Go to billing" "الانتقال إلى الفواتير", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "ربط Google / GitHub غير مفعّل في هذه البيئة حتى الآن.", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "تُستخدم Google / GitHub فقط لتحديد الحساب. أما تسجيل الدخول نفسه فيتم باستخدام مفتاح مرور أو محفظة — وليس بكلمة مرور أبدًا.", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "تُعرض قواعد الحواجز الأمنية وجدار الحماية والامتثال وإصداراتها ضمن ضوابط الأمان.", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "يجب أن يكون المُعرِّف بالصيغة com-<name>.kotoba.cloud.", "How verification works" "كيف يعمل التحقق", "IdP assertion confirmed" "تم تأكيد تصريح مزوّد الهوية", "IdP assertion required" "مطلوب تصريح من مزوّد الهوية", "IdP re-assertion required" "مطلوب إعادة تصريح من مزوّد الهوية", "Identity verification" "التحقق من الهوية", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "انتهت صلاحية التحقق من الهوية. أعد التحقق.", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "التحقق من الهوية غير مكتمل. ابدأه من «本人確認» أعلاه.", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "يشارك الأعضاء المدعوون رموز API والنطاقات والفواتير. الأدوار هي owner / admin / member / billing.", "Issue a connection token" "إصدار رمز اتصال", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "أصدِر رمز اتصال لعميل CLI / IDE محلي. يُعرض مرة واحدة فقط.", "Issue it from this page." "أصدره من هذه الصفحة.", "Issued tokens" "الرموز المُصدَرة", "Link GitHub" "ربط GitHub", "Link Google" "ربط Google", "Linked accounts" "الحسابات المرتبطة", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "ربط حساب Google أو GitHub يجعل خيار \"الاستمرار باستخدام Google\" يقترح مفتاح المرور الخاص بهذا الحساب في المرة القادمة. الحساب المرتبط هو مجرد اسم للحساب، ولا يُستخدم كوسيلة لتسجيل الدخول.", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "العملاء الداعمون لـ MCP مثل Claude Code يقرؤون ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "تُفتح دعوات الأعضاء بعد إنشاء المؤسسة.", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "يُدار الأعضاء عبر مزوّد الهوية الخاص بالمؤسسة (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace وMicrosoft Entra ID وOkta وغيرها). العضو الذي يُزال من مزوّد الهوية يفقد الوصول إلى المؤسسة عند فترة إعادة المصادقة التالية.", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "لا توجد نطاقات معتمدة حتى الآن. قدّم الطلب بعد تسجيل الباحث.", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "لا يوجد مسار ثقة حالي. أعد بدء التحقق.", "No linked accounts." "لا توجد حسابات مرتبطة.", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "لا توجد مؤسسات حتى الآن. أدخل معرّفًا (handle) لإنشاء واحدة.", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "لا يوجد فريق حتى الآن. أنشئ مؤسسة لتصبح المالك (owner) وتدعو الأعضاء.", "No tokens issued" "لا توجد رموز صادرة", "Not signed in." "لم يتم تسجيل الدخول.", "Not verified" "غير موثّق", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "يمكن فقط للمالك (owner) أو المسؤول (admin) تهيئة هذا.", "Open security controls" "فتح ضوابط الأمان", "Open the guide" "فتح الدليل", "Organization" "المؤسسة", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "تسجيل الدخول الموحّد للمؤسسة (SSO) (Team / Enterprise)", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "لم يتم تفعيل تسجيل الدخول الموحّد (SSO) للمؤسسة في هذه البيئة بعد.", "Organization handle" "معرّف المؤسسة", "Organizations and teams" "المؤسسات والفرق", "Pending" "قيد المعالجة", "Policy re-acceptance required." "يلزم إعادة الموافقة على السياسة.", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "لا يمكن استخدام البطاقات مسبقة الدفع أو الافتراضية للتحقق. أضف بطاقة ائتمان أو خصم عادية.", "Principal" "المُخوَّل (Principal)", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "عدم تطابق في المُخوَّل (Principal). تواصل مع الدعم.", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "فترة إعادة المصادقة (بالساعات)", "Refresh" "تحديث", "Remove SSO" "إزالة SSO", "Removed." "تمت الإزالة.", "Require IdP authentication" "طلب المصادقة عبر موفر الهوية (IdP)", "Research access" "الوصول إلى بيئة البحث", "Revoke" "إلغاء", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "إلغاء جميع الرموز الصادرة قبل التسجيل", "Role mapping (group=role)" "تخطيط الأدوار (group=role)", "Save SSO" "حفظ SSO", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "تم الحفظ. يمكن للأعضاء الآن المصادقة باستخدام موفر الهوية (IdP) الخاص بالمؤسسة.", "Security controls" "ضوابط الأمان", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "يلزم إعادة التحقق من الجلسة. أعد تحميل هذه الصفحة.", "Sign in" "تسجيل الدخول", "Sign in again before unlinking." "سجّل الدخول مرة أخرى قبل إلغاء الربط.", "Sign in first." "سجّل الدخول أولاً.", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "سجّل الدخول لإدارة التحقق من الهوية والوصول إلى بيئة البحث والمؤسسات والفواتير ورموز الاتصال من هنا.", "Start verification" "بدء التحقق", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "يؤدي بدء العملية إلى نقلك إلى فحص Stripe (إعداد البطاقة على checkout.stripe.com إذا لم تكن هناك بطاقة مسجّلة، والوثائق على verify.stripe.com).", "Status" "الحالة", "Team" "الفريق", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "حساب Google/GitHub هذا مرتبط بالفعل بحساب Kotoba آخر.", "That handle is already taken." "هذا المعرّف (handle) مستخدَم بالفعل.", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "مزوّد الهوية (IdP) ليس وسيلة لتسجيل الدخول. يسجّل الأعضاء الدخول أولًا بمفتاح مرور أو محفظة، ثم يوثّقون هويتهم عبر مزوّد هوية المؤسسة (IdP) للحصول على العضوية. الأدوار هي admin / member / billing؛ ولا يُمنح دور owner أبدًا عبر IdP.", "The organization service is not connected yet." "خدمة المؤسسة غير متصلة بعد.", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "المعرّف الرئيسي (principal) هو الهوية الثابتة التي يتعرّف بها Kotoba Cloud عليك. لا يتغير عند استبدال مفتاح المرور أو المحفظة.", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "حصة البحث المجانية المُحقَّقة لا تُفرض عليها رسوم أبدًا. تُشترى السعة المدفوعة دون شحن تلقائي.", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "إصدار الرموز غير مفعّل بعد. حاول مرة أخرى لاحقًا.", "Unavailable" "غير متاح", "Under review or additional checks required." "قيد المراجعة، أو مطلوب فحوصات إضافية.", "Unlink" "إلغاء الربط", "Unlinked." "تم إلغاء الربط.", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "إلغاء الربط لا يؤثر على تسجيل الدخول بمفتاح مرور أو محفظة.", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "الاستخدام من CLI / IDE", "Use from an agent" "الاستخدام من وكيل (Agent)", "Username" "اسم المستخدم", "Verification is complete." "التحقق من الهوية مكتمل.", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "التحقق من الهوية غير متاح مؤقتًا. حاول مرة أخرى لاحقًا.", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "خدمة التحقق من الهوية غير متاحة. أعد التحديث لاحقًا.", "Verified" "تم التحقق", "What is a linked account?" "ما هو الحساب المرتبط؟", "What is a principal?" "ما هو المعرّف الرئيسي (Principal)؟", "What is a scope?" "ما هو النطاق (Scope)؟", "What is organization SSO?" "ما هو تسجيل الدخول الموحّد (SSO) للمؤسسة؟", "asserted" "مصادَق عليه", "enforced" "إلزامي", "not required" "غير مطلوب", "optional" "اختياري", "revoked " "أُلغي "}, :ar-MA {" and " " و ", "(no label)" "(بلا label)", ". The full guide is at " ". الدليل الكامل كاين ف", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." ". التوكنات كتلغى واحد واحد من اللائحة فالفوق؛ من هاداك اللحظة الـ API كيجاوب 401 token-revoked.", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "خاص خطة Team ولا Enterprise.", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "صلاحية فحص AML/CTF سالات. خاصها مراجعة جديدة.", "About charges" "على المصاريف", "Account" "الحساب", "Add or resume card" "زيد ولا كمّل البطاقة", "All legacy tokens revoked." "جميع التوكنات القديمة تلغاو.", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "المنظمة كتصدر كـ did:webvh DID؛ العضوية كتدار بواسطة verifiable credentials (VC). الشخص لي صايفها كيتوصل بدور owner.", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "الموافقة كتوقع بشكل تلقائي ملي Stripe كيسالي. حدّث هاد الصفحة باش تشوف التغيير. إلا خرجتي من تسجيل البطاقة فالنص، كمّل من تحت.", "Approved scopes" "الصلاحيات الموافق عليها", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "تحقق بواسطة IdP ديال المنظمة", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "متوفرة للمنظمات فخطط Team / Enterprise. SAML ماشي معتمد بعد.", "Billing and credits" "الفوترة والكريديت", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "الفوترة فطور التحقق. الشراء ماشي متوفر بعد.", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "الفوترة خاصها مطابقة. تواصل مع الدعم.", "Billing service unavailable." "خدمة الفوترة ماشي متوفرة.", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "تسجيل البطاقة تلغى. كمّل من تحت.", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "تم استقبال البطاقة. الموافقة كتجي مع إشعار Stripe، عادة فبعض الثواني. استخدم «状態を更新» باش تعاود تتحقق.", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "تحقق البطاقة: سجل بطاقة credit ولا debit باش تكمّلها (checkout.stripe.com). البطاقات prepaid و virtual ماشي مقبولة.", "Checking sign-in state…" "كنتحقق من حالة تسجيل الدخول…", "Checking the identity provider…" "كنتحقق من IdP…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "كنتحقق من حالة تسجيل الدخول ديالك…", "Configured" "مهيأ", "Connection token (shown once)" "توكن الاتصال (كيبان مرة وحدة)", "Continue with GitHub" "كمّل مع GitHub", "Continue with Google" "كمّل مع Google", "Copied." "تم النسخ.", "Copy" "نسخ", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "نسخ وحافظ على التوكن دابا. ماغادي يبان مرة أخرى.", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "ما تقدرش يتحقق من حالة تسجيل الدخول. حدّث.", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "ما تقدرش يتصايفة. حدّث وعاود حاول.", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "ما تقدرش يتصدر. حدّث وعاود حاول.", "Could not load." "ما تقدرش يتحمّل.", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "ما تقدرنا نتواصلو مع Stripe. عاود حاول من بعد؛ إلا بقا المشكل، تواصل مع support@kotoba.cloud.", "Could not read linked accounts." "ما تقدرش يقرا الحسابات المرتبطة.", "Could not remove." "ما تقدرش يتحيد.", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "ما تقدرش يتلغى. حدّث وعاود حاول.", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "ما قدرناش نبداو. حدّث الصفحة وعاود المحاولة.", "Could not unlink." "ما قدرناش نفصلو.", "Create an organization first." "صنع منظمة أول.", "Create organization" "صنع منظمة", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "كايتصنع session ديال التحقق ديال Stripe…", "Creating the organization…" "كايتصنع المنظمة…", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) يمكن يتزاد. معلومات البطاقة والوثائق كايمشيو لـ Stripe فقط؛ kotoba.cloud كايحافظ غير على الحالة، تاريخ الصلاحية، ومرجع الدليل. التحقق كايسالي الصلاحية من بعد 365 يوم.", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "كل scope كيتوافق عليه بحال حالة وحدة يستافد منها فالبحث. الـ scope الفايت الصلاحية أو المعلّق ما يقدرش يشغّل الاستدلال.", "Eligible" "مؤهل", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "مؤهل. الحصة المجانية ديالك متوفرة.", "Email domains" "دومينات البريد الإلكتروني", "Environment variables" "متغيرات البيئة", "Free allowance" "الحصة المجانية", "Go to billing" "سير للفوترة", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "ربط Google / GitHub مازال ماشي مفعّل فهاد البيئة.", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "Google / GitHub غير كايعرفو الحساب. التسجيل الدخول فنفسو كيستعمل passkey أو wallet — عمرو ماكيستعمل password.", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "القواعد ديال guardrail و firewall و compliance والنسخ ديالهم كايبانو تحت Security controls.", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "الـ handle خاصو يكون بشكل com-<name>.kotoba.cloud.", "How verification works" "كيفاش كايخدم التحقق", "IdP assertion confirmed" "تأكيد IdP توصل", "IdP assertion required" "خاص تأكيد IdP", "IdP re-assertion required" "خاص إعادة تأكيد IdP", "Identity verification" "التحقق من الهوية", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "صلاحية التحقق من الهوية سالت. عاود التحقق.", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "التحقق من الهوية ماشي مكمّل. بداه من «التحقق من الهوية» لفوق.", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "الأعضاء المدعوين كايشاركو API tokens و scopes والفوترة. الأدوار هوما owner / admin / member / billing.", "Issue a connection token" "أصدر رمز الاتصال", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "أصدر رمز اتصال لـ CLI / IDE agent لوكال. كايبان مرة وحدة فقط.", "Issue it from this page." "أصدرو من هاد الصفحة.", "Issued tokens" "التوكنات المصدرة", "Link GitHub" "ربط GitHub", "Link Google" "ربط Google", "Linked accounts" "الحسابات المربوطة", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "ربط حساب Google اولا GitHub كايخلي \"Continue with Google\" يعرض passkey ديال هاد الحساب المرة الجاية. الحساب المربوط كيسمي الحساب فقط؛ ماشي طريقة للتسجيل الدخول.", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "الوكلاء لي كايدعمو MCP بحال Claude Code كايقراو ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "دعوات الأعضاء كايتفتحو مع ما تتصنع المنظمة.", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "الأعضاء كايتدبرو من طرف identity provider ديال المنظمة (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta وخرين). العضو لي كايتحيد من IdP كايخسر الوصول للمنظمة فالفترة الجاية ديال إعادة التحقق.", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "مازال ماكاين scopes موافق عليها. قدم الطلب من بعد التسجيل كباحث.", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "ماكاين حتى trust route حالي. عاود التحقق من جديد.", "No linked accounts." "ماكاينين حسابات مربوطة.", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "مازال ماكاينة حتى منظمة. دخل handle باش تصاوب واحدة.", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "مازال ماكاين حتى فريق. صاوب منظمة باش تكون owner وتدعو الأعضاء.", "No tokens issued" "ماكاين حتى توكن صادر", "Not signed in." "ماشي داخل.", "Not verified" "ماشي متحقق منه", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "غير owner أو admin يقدر يهيأ هادشي.", "Open security controls" "حل إعدادات الأمان", "Open the guide" "حل الدليل", "Organization" "المنظمة", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "SSO ديال المنظمة (Team / Enterprise)", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "SSO ديال المنظمة مازال ماشي مفعّل فهاد البيئة.", "Organization handle" "Handle ديال المنظمة", "Organizations and teams" "المنظمات والفرق", "Pending" "جاري التحقق", "Policy re-acceptance required." "خاصك تعاود توافق على السياسة.", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "البطايق المسبقة الدفع والفيرتشوال ما يمكن ستخدامهم فالتحقق. زيد بطاقة كريدي أو ديبي عادية.", "Principal" "Principal", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "الـ Principal ماكيتطابقش. تواصل مع الدعم.", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "فترة إعادة التوثيق (ساعات)", "Refresh" "تحديث", "Remove SSO" "حيد SSO", "Removed." "تحيدت.", "Require IdP authentication" "تطلب التوثيق عبر IdP", "Research access" "الوصول لبيئة البحث", "Revoke" "بطل", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "بطل كل التوكنات لي صدرو قبل التسجيل", "Role mapping (group=role)" "تخصيص الأدوار (group=role)", "Save SSO" "سجل SSO", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "تسجلت. دابا الأعضاء يقدرو يتوثقو عبر IdP ديال المنظمة.", "Security controls" "إعدادات الأمان", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "خاص تعاود تأكيد الجلسة. عاود شارج هاد الصفحة.", "Sign in" "سجل الدخول", "Sign in again before unlinking." "عاود سجل الدخول قبل ما تفصل الربط.", "Sign in first." "سجل الدخول أولا.", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "سجل الدخول باش تدير التحقق من الهوية، الوصول لبيئة البحث، المنظمات، الفوترة، وتوكنات الاتصال من هنا.", "Start verification" "بدا التحقق", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "كي تبدا غادي توديك لصفحة التحقق ديال Stripe (تسجيل البطاقة فـ checkout.stripe.com إلا ماكانت حتى بطاقة مسجلة، والوثائق فـ verify.stripe.com).", "Status" "الحالة", "Team" "الفريق", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "هاد الحساب ديال Google/GitHub مرتبط ديجا بحساب Kotoba آخر.", "That handle is already taken." "هاد الهاندل مستعمل من قبل.", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "الـ IdP ماشي وسيلة لتسجيل الدخول. الأعضاء كيسجلو الدخول أولا بـ passkey ولا wallet، من بعد كيتحققو من IdP ديال المنظمة باش يحصلو على العضوية. الأدوار هوما admin / member / billing؛ owner عمرها ما كتعطى من طرف IdP.", "The organization service is not connected yet." "خدمة المنظمة ماشي مربوطة بعد.", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "الـ principal هو المعرّف الثابت اللي Kotoba Cloud كيعرفك به. ما كيتبدلش منين تبدل passkey ولا wallet.", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "الحصة المجانية للبحث المتحقق منها ما كتخصمش. الحصة المدفوعة كتشرى بلا تعمير أوتوماتيكي.", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "إصدار التوكن ماشي مفعّل بعد. عاود المحاولة من بعد.", "Unavailable" "ماشي متوفر", "Under review or additional checks required." "تحت المراجعة، ولا خاصها تحققات إضافية.", "Unlink" "فصل الربط", "Unlinked." "تم فصل الربط.", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "فصل الربط ما كيأثرش على تسجيل الدخول بـ Passkey ولا wallet.", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "استعملها من CLI / IDE", "Use from an agent" "استعملها من agent", "Username" "اسم المستخدم", "Verification is complete." "التحقق من الهوية كمل.", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "التحقق من الهوية ماشي متوفر دابا. عاود المحاولة من بعد.", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "خدمة التحقق ماشي متوفرة. عاود التحديث من بعد.", "Verified" "متأكد", "What is a linked account?" "شنو هو الحساب المربوط؟", "What is a principal?" "شنو هو principal؟", "What is a scope?" "شنو هو scope؟", "What is organization SSO?" "شنو هو SSO ديال المنظمة؟", "asserted" "مؤكّد", "enforced" "واجب", "not required" "ماشي واجب", "optional" "اختياري", "revoked " "ملغي "}, :arz {" and " " و ", "(no label)" "(بدون تسمية)", ". The full guide is at " ". الدليل الكامل موجود في ", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." ". التوكنات بتُلغى واحد واحد من القايمة اللي فوق؛ ومن هذه اللحظة الـ API بيرد بـ 401 token-revoked.", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "لازم خطة Team أو Enterprise.", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "انتهت صلاحية فحص AML/CTF. لازم إعادة مراجعة.", "About charges" "عن الرسوم", "Account" "الحساب", "Add or resume card" "إضافة أو استكمال كارت", "All legacy tokens revoked." "كل التوكنات القديمة اتلغت.", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "المؤسسة بتتصدر كـ did:webvh DID؛ والعضوية بتتدار بشهادات قابلة للتحقق (VC). اللي بينشئ المؤسسة بياخد رتبة owner.", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "الموافقة بتحصل أوتوماتيك لما Stripe يخلص. حدّث الصفحة دي عشان تشوف التغيير. لو سبت إدخال الكارت في النص، تقدر تكمّل من تحت.", "Approved scopes" "الصلاحيات المعتمدة", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "سجّل الدخول عبر IdP الخاص بالمؤسسة", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "متاح للمؤسسات في خطط Team / Enterprise. SAML لسه غير مدعوم.", "Billing and credits" "الفوترة والأرصدة", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "الفوترة تحت المراجعة دلوقتي. الشراء لسه غير متاح.", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "الفوترة محتاجة مطابقة. اتصل بالدعم.", "Billing service unavailable." "خدمة الفوترة مش متاحة.", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "تم إلغاء إدخال الكارت. تقدر تكمّل من تحت.", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "تم استلام الكارت. الموافقة بتتم حسب إشعار Stripe، عادةً في ثواني. استخدم \"تحديث الحالة\" للتحقق من جديد.", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "التحقق من الكارت: سجّل كارت ائتمان أو خصم مباشر عشان تكمّله (checkout.stripe.com). الكروت مسبقة الدفع والافتراضية مش مقبولة.", "Checking sign-in state…" "بيتم فحص حالة تسجيل الدخول…", "Checking the identity provider…" "بيتم فحص مزوّد الهوية (IdP)…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "بيتم فحص حالة تسجيل دخولك…", "Configured" "مضبوط", "Connection token (shown once)" "توكن الاتصال (بيتعرض مرة واحدة)", "Continue with GitHub" "استمر باستخدام GitHub", "Continue with Google" "استمر باستخدام Google", "Copied." "تم النسخ.", "Copy" "نسخ", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "انسخ التوكن واحفظه دلوقتي. مش هيتعرض تاني خالص.", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "معرفنا نتحقق من حالة تسجيل الدخول. حدّث الصفحة.", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "معرفنا ننشئه. حدّث الصفحة وحاول تاني.", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "معرفنا نصدره. حدّث الصفحة وحاول تاني.", "Could not load." "معرفنا نحمّله.", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "معرفنا نتواصل مع Stripe. حاول تاني بعدين؛ ولو المشكلة استمرت، اتصل ب support@kotoba.cloud.", "Could not read linked accounts." "معرفنا نقرا الحسابات المرتبطة.", "Could not remove." "معرفنا نشيله.", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "معرفنا نلغيه. حدّث الصفحة وحاول تاني.", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "معرفنا نبدأ. حدّث الصفحة وحاول تاني.", "Could not unlink." "معرفنا نفصل الربط.", "Create an organization first." "أنشئ منظمة الأول.", "Create organization" "إنشاء منظمة", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "بيتم إنشاء جلسة التحقق بتاعة Stripe…", "Creating the organization…" "بيتم إنشاء المنظمة…", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "التحقق من الوثائق (Stripe Identity، verify.stripe.com) ممكن يتضاف. تفاصيل الكارت والوثائق بتروح لـ Stripe بس؛ kotoba.cloud بيحتفظ بالحالة وتاريخ الانتهاء ومرجع الإثبات. التحقق ينتهي بعد 365 يوم.", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "كل صلاحية (scope) بتتوافق عليها على أساسها الخاص بالبحث. الصلاحية المنتهية أو المعلّقة مش هتقدر تشغّل الاستدلال (inference).", "Eligible" "مؤهّل", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "مؤهّل. الحصة المجانية بتاعتك متاحة.", "Email domains" "دومينات الإيميل", "Environment variables" "متغيرات البيئة", "Free allowance" "الحصة المجانية", "Go to billing" "روح لصفحة الفوترة", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "ربط Google / GitHub لسه مش متفعّل في البيئة دي.", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "Google / GitHub بس بيحددوا هوية الحساب. تسجيل الدخول نفسه بيتم بـ Passkey أو محفظة (wallet) — مش باستخدام باسورد أبدًا.", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "قواعد الـ Guardrail والـ Firewall والامتثال ونسخها موجودة تحت ضوابط الأمان.", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "الـ Handle لازم يكون شكله com-<name>.kotoba.cloud.", "How verification works" "إزاي التحقق بيتم", "IdP assertion confirmed" "تم تأكيد مصادقة IdP", "IdP assertion required" "مطلوب تأكيد من IdP", "IdP re-assertion required" "مطلوب إعادة تأكيد من IdP", "Identity verification" "التحقق من الهوية", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "التحقق من الهوية انتهت صلاحيته. أعد التحقق.", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "التحقق من الهوية غير مكتمل. ابدأه من قسم «التحقق من الهوية» فوق.", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "الأعضاء المدعوين بيشاركوا توكنات API والصلاحيات (scopes) والفوترة. الأدوار هي owner / admin / member / billing.", "Issue a connection token" "إصدار توكن اتصال", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "إصدار توكن اتصال لعميل CLI / IDE محلي. بيتعرض مرة واحدة بس.", "Issue it from this page." "أصدره من الصفحة دي.", "Issued tokens" "التوكنات المُصدَرة", "Link GitHub" "ربط GitHub", "Link Google" "ربط Google", "Linked accounts" "الحسابات المتربطة", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "ربط حساب Google أو GitHub بيخلي «الاستمرار مع Google» يعرض الـ Passkey بتاع الحساب ده المرة الجايه. الحساب المتربط بس بيسمّي الحساب؛ مش وسيلة تسجيل دخول.", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "العملاء اللي بيدعموا MCP زي Claude Code بيقروا ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "دعوات الأعضاء تفتح لما تكون فيه منظمة موجودة.", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "الأعضاء بيتم إدارتهم عن طريق مزود هوية المنظمة (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace وMicrosoft Entra ID وOkta وغيرهم). العضو اللي يتشال من IdP بيفقد الوصول للمنظمة في فترة إعادة المصادقة الجاية.", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "لسه مفيش صلاحيات (scopes) متوافق عليها. قدّم الطلب بعد تسجيل الباحث.", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "مفيش مسار ثقة حالي. أعد بدء التحقق.", "No linked accounts." "مفيش حسابات متربطة.", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "لسه مفيش أي منظمة. اكتب handle علشان تعمل واحدة.", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "لسه مفيش فريق. اعمل منظمة علشان تبقى owner وتقدر تدعو أعضاء.", "No tokens issued" "لا يوجد توكنات صادرة", "Not signed in." "لسه مسجل دخول.", "Not verified" "غير موثّق", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "فقط الـ owner أو الـ admin يقدروا يضبطوا الإعداد ده.", "Open security controls" "فتح ضوابط الأمان", "Open the guide" "فتح الدليل", "Organization" "المنظمة", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "SSO الخاص بالمنظمة (Team / Enterprise)", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "SSO الخاص بالمنظمة لسه مش مفعّل في هذه البيئة.", "Organization handle" "Handle المنظمة", "Organizations and teams" "المنظمات والفرق", "Pending" "قيد المراجعة", "Policy re-acceptance required." "لازم توافق على السياسة تاني.", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "الكروت المدفوعة مقدمًا والكروت الافتراضية مش صالحة للتحقق من الهوية. ضيف كارت ائتمان أو خصم عادي.", "Principal" "الـ Principal", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "الـ principal غير متطابق. اتصل بالدعم.", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "الفترة بين إعادة التحقق (بالساعات)", "Refresh" "تحديث", "Remove SSO" "إزالة SSO", "Removed." "تم الحذف.", "Require IdP authentication" "طلب التحقق من IdP", "Research access" "الوصول لبيئة البحث", "Revoke" "إلغاء", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "إلغاء كل التوكنات اللي صدرت قبل التسجيل", "Role mapping (group=role)" "تعيين الأدوار (group=role)", "Save SSO" "حفظ SSO", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "تم الحفظ. دلوقتي الأعضاء يقدروا يعملوا تحقق باستخدام IdP بتاع المنظمة.", "Security controls" "ضوابط الأمان", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "لازم إعادة تحقق من الجلسة. أعد تحميل الصفحة.", "Sign in" "تسجيل الدخول", "Sign in again before unlinking." "سجّل دخول تاني قبل ما تفصل الربط.", "Sign in first." "سجّل دخول الأول.", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "سجّل دخول علشان تقدر تدير التحقق من الهوية، الوصول لبيئة البحث، المنظمات، الفوترة، وتوكنات الاتصال من هنا.", "Start verification" "بدء التحقق", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "البدء هيوديك لفحص Stripe (تسجيل الكارت على checkout.stripe.com لو مفيش كارت مسجل، والمستندات على verify.stripe.com).", "Status" "الحالة", "Team" "الفريق", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "حساب Google/GitHub ده متربط بالفعل بحساب Kotoba تاني.", "That handle is already taken." "الهاندل ده متاخد قبل كده.", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "الـ IdP مش طريقة لتسجيل الدخول. الأعضاء الأول بيسجلوا دخول بـ Passkey أو محفظة، وبعدين بيوثّقوا نفسهم مع IdP بتاع المؤسسة عشان يحصلوا على العضوية. الأدوار هي admin / member / billing؛ ودور owner مستحيل يتم منحه من خلال IdP.", "The organization service is not connected yet." "خدمة المؤسسة لسه مش متوصلة.", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "الـ principal هو المعرّف الثابت اللي Kotoba Cloud بيعرفك بيه. ده مبيتغيرش لما تغيّر الـ Passkey أو المحفظة.", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "مساحة البحث المجانية المتحقق منها مبيتحاسبش عليها فلوس. المساحة المدفوعة بتتشترى من غير شحن أوتوماتيك.", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "إصدار التوكن لسه مش مفعّل. جرب تاني بعدين.", "Unavailable" "غير متاح", "Under review or additional checks required." "تحت المراجعة، أو محتاج فحوصات إضافية.", "Unlink" "فك الربط", "Unlinked." "تم فك الربط.", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "فك الربط ماله علاقة بتسجيل الدخول بـ Passkey أو محفظة.", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "استخدام من CLI / IDE", "Use from an agent" "استخدام من Agent", "Username" "اسم المستخدم", "Verification is complete." "التحقق من الهوية خلص.", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "خدمة التحقق من الهوية غير متاحة مؤقتًا. جرب تاني بعدين.", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "خدمة التحقق من الهوية غير متاحة. حدّث الصفحة بعدين.", "Verified" "متحقق منه", "What is a linked account?" "الحساب المرتبط يعني إيه؟", "What is a principal?" "الـ principal يعني إيه؟", "What is a scope?" "الـ scope يعني إيه؟", "What is organization SSO?" "SSO المؤسسة يعني إيه؟", "asserted" "مؤكد", "enforced" "إجباري", "not required" "غير مطلوب", "optional" "اختياري", "revoked " "ملغي "}, :bn {" and " " এবং ", "(no label)" "(কোনো লেবেল নেই)", ". The full guide is at " "। সম্পূর্ণ নির্দেশিকা এখানে পাওয়া যাবে ", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." "। উপরের তালিকা থেকে টোকেন একে একে বাতিল করা হয়; সেই মুহূর্ত থেকে API 401 token-revoked উত্তর দেয়।", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "Team বা Enterprise প্ল্যান প্রয়োজন।", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "AML/CTF স্ক্রিনিং-এর মেয়াদ শেষ হয়ে গেছে। পুনরায় পরীক্ষা প্রয়োজন।", "About charges" "চার্জ সম্পর্কে", "Account" "অ্যাকাউন্ট", "Add or resume card" "কার্ড যুক্ত করুন বা পুনরায় শুরু করুন", "All legacy tokens revoked." "সব লিগ্যাসি টোকেন বাতিল করা হয়েছে।", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "একটি প্রতিষ্ঠান did:webvh DID হিসেবে ইস্যু করা হয়; সদস্যপদ ভেরিফায়েবল ক্রেডেনশিয়াল (VC) দিয়ে পরিচালিত হয়। নির্মাতা owner রোল পান।", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "Stripe-এ যাচাই সম্পন্ন হলে স্বয়ংক্রিয়ভাবে অনুমোদন হয়। পরিবর্তন দেখতে এই পেজ রিফ্রেশ করুন। কার্ড এন্ট্রি মাঝপথে ছেড়ে দিয়ে থাকলে নিচে থেকে পুনরায় শুরু করুন।", "Approved scopes" "অনুমোদিত স্কোপ", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "প্রতিষ্ঠানের IdP দিয়ে প্রমাণীকরণ করুন", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "Team / Enterprise প্ল্যানের প্রতিষ্ঠানের জন্য উপলব্ধ। SAML এখনো সমর্থিত নয়।", "Billing and credits" "বিলিং ও ক্রেডিট", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "বিলিং যাচাইকরণে আছে। এখনো কেনাকাটা করা সম্ভব নয়।", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "বিলিং সমন্বয়ের প্রয়োজন। সাপোর্টের সাথে যোগাযোগ করুন।", "Billing service unavailable." "বিলিং সার্ভিস উপলব্ধ নয়।", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "কার্ড এন্ট্রি বাতিল করা হয়েছে। নিচে থেকে পুনরায় শুরু করুন।", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "কার্ড গ্রহণ করা হয়েছে। Stripe-এর নোটিফিকেশন অনুযায়ী অনুমোদন হবে, সাধারণত কয়েক সেকেন্ডের মধ্যে। পুনরায় পরীক্ষা করতে \"স্ট্যাটাস রিফ্রেশ করুন\" ব্যবহার করুন।", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "কার্ড যাচাইকরণ: এটি সম্পূর্ণ করতে একটি ক্রেডিট বা ডেবিট কার্ড নিবন্ধন করুন (checkout.stripe.com)। প্রিপেইড এবং ভার্চুয়াল কার্ড গ্রহণযোগ্য নয়।", "Checking sign-in state…" "সাইন-ইন স্থিতি পরীক্ষা করা হচ্ছে…", "Checking the identity provider…" "IdP যাচাই করা হচ্ছে…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "আপনার সাইন-ইন স্থিতি পরীক্ষা করা হচ্ছে…", "Configured" "কনফিগার করা হয়েছে", "Connection token (shown once)" "কানেকশন টোকেন (একবার দেখানো হয়)", "Continue with GitHub" "GitHub দিয়ে চালিয়ে যান", "Continue with Google" "Google দিয়ে চালিয়ে যান", "Copied." "কপি হয়েছে।", "Copy" "কপি", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "এখনই টোকেন কপি করে সংরক্ষণ করুন। এটি আর কখনো দেখানো হবে না।", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "সাইন-ইন স্থিতি যাচাই করা যায়নি। রিফ্রেশ করুন।", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "তৈরি করা যায়নি। রিফ্রেশ করে পুনরায় চেষ্টা করুন।", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "ইস্যু করা যায়নি। রিফ্রেশ করে পুনরায় চেষ্টা করুন।", "Could not load." "লোড করা যায়নি।", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "Stripe-এ পৌঁছানো যায়নি। পরে আবার চেষ্টা করুন; সমস্যা অব্যাহত থাকলে support@kotoba.cloud-এ যোগাযোগ করুন।", "Could not read linked accounts." "লিংকড অ্যাকাউন্ট পড়া যায়নি।", "Could not remove." "সরানো যায়নি।", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "বাতিল করা যায়নি। রিফ্রেশ করে পুনরায় চেষ্টা করুন।", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "শুরু করা যায়নি। রিফ্রেশ করে পুনরায় চেষ্টা করুন।", "Could not unlink." "আনলিংক করা যায়নি।", "Create an organization first." "প্রথমে একটি সংস্থা তৈরি করুন।", "Create organization" "সংস্থা তৈরি করুন", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "Stripe ভেরিফিকেশন সেশন তৈরি করা হচ্ছে…", "Creating the organization…" "সংস্থা তৈরি করা হচ্ছে…", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "ডকুমেন্ট ভেরিফিকেশন (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) যুক্ত করা যায়। কার্ডের তথ্য ও ডকুমেন্ট শুধুমাত্র Stripe-এ যায়; kotoba.cloud কেবল স্ট্যাটাস, মেয়াদ শেষের তারিখ এবং একটি প্রমাণ রেফারেন্স রাখে। যাচাইকরণের মেয়াদ ৩৬৫ দিন পর শেষ হয়।", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "প্রতিটি স্কোপ গবেষণার জন্য নিজস্ব ভিত্তিতে অনুমোদিত হয়। মেয়াদ শেষ হওয়া বা স্থগিত স্কোপ ইনফারেন্স চালাতে পারে না।", "Eligible" "যোগ্য", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "যোগ্য। আপনার ফ্রি অ্যালাউন্স উপলব্ধ।", "Email domains" "ইমেল ডোমেইন", "Environment variables" "এনভায়রনমেন্ট ভেরিয়েবল", "Free allowance" "ফ্রি অ্যালাউন্স", "Go to billing" "বিলিং পেজে যান", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "এই পরিবেশে Google / GitHub লিংকিং এখনও সক্রিয় করা হয়নি।", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "Google / GitHub শুধু অ্যাকাউন্ট চিহ্নিত করে। সাইন-ইন নিজেই পাসকি বা ওয়ালেট ব্যবহার করে — কখনও পাসওয়ার্ড নয়।", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "গার্ডরেইল, ফায়ারওয়াল এবং কমপ্লায়েন্স নিয়ম এবং তাদের ভার্সন সিকিউরিটি কন্ট্রোলস-এর অধীনে দেখানো হয়।", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "হ্যান্ডেল অবশ্যই com-<name>.kotoba.cloud ফর্ম্যাটে হতে হবে।", "How verification works" "যাচাইকরণ কীভাবে কাজ করে", "IdP assertion confirmed" "IdP অ্যাসারশন নিশ্চিত হয়েছে", "IdP assertion required" "IdP অ্যাসারশন প্রয়োজন", "IdP re-assertion required" "IdP পুনরায় অ্যাসারশন প্রয়োজন", "Identity verification" "পরিচয় যাচাই", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "পরিচয় যাচাইয়ের মেয়াদ শেষ হয়ে গেছে। পুনরায় যাচাই করুন।", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "পরিচয় যাচাই অসম্পূর্ণ। উপরে 本人確認 থেকে শুরু করুন।", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "আমন্ত্রিত সদস্যরা API টোকেন, স্কোপ এবং বিলিং শেয়ার করে। রোলগুলো হলো owner / admin / member / billing।", "Issue a connection token" "একটি সংযোগ টোকেন ইস্যু করুন", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "লোকাল CLI / IDE এজেন্টের জন্য একটি সংযোগ টোকেন ইস্যু করুন। এটি একবারই দেখানো হয়।", "Issue it from this page." "এই পেজ থেকেই ইস্যু করুন।", "Issued tokens" "ইস্যু করা টোকেন", "Link GitHub" "GitHub লিংক করুন", "Link Google" "Google লিংক করুন", "Linked accounts" "লিংক করা অ্যাকাউন্ট", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "একটি Google বা GitHub অ্যাকাউন্ট লিংক করলে পরের বার \"Continue with Google\" এই অ্যাকাউন্টের পাসকি সাজেস্ট করবে। লিংক করা অ্যাকাউন্ট শুধু অ্যাকাউন্টটির নাম নির্দেশ করে; এটি সাইন-ইন করার কোনো উপায় নয়।", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "Claude Code-এর মতো MCP-সক্ষম এজেন্টরা পড়ে ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "সংস্থা তৈরি হলেই সদস্য আমন্ত্রণ চালু হয়।", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "সদস্যদের সংস্থার আইডেন্টিটি প্রোভাইডার (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta এবং অন্যান্য) দ্বারা পরিচালিত হয়। IdP থেকে বাদ পড়া সদস্য পরবর্তী পুনঃপ্রমাণীকরণ ব্যবধানে সংস্থার অ্যাক্সেস হারায়।", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "এখনও কোনো অনুমোদিত স্কোপ নেই। গবেষক নিবন্ধনের পর আবেদন করুন।", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "কোনো কার্যকর ট্রাস্ট রুট নেই। যাচাই পুনরায় শুরু করুন।", "No linked accounts." "কোনো লিংক করা অ্যাকাউন্ট নেই।", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "এখনও কোনো organization নেই। একটি তৈরি করতে হ্যান্ডেল লিখুন।", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "এখনও কোনো team নেই। owner হতে এবং সদস্যদের আমন্ত্রণ জানাতে একটি organization তৈরি করুন।", "No tokens issued" "কোনো টোকেন ইস্যু করা হয়নি", "Not signed in." "সাইন ইন করা নেই।", "Not verified" "যাচাই করা হয়নি", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "শুধুমাত্র owner বা admin এটি কনফিগার করতে পারবেন।", "Open security controls" "সিকিউরিটি কন্ট্রোল খুলুন", "Open the guide" "গাইড খুলুন", "Organization" "Organization", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "এই environment-এ Organization SSO এখনও সক্রিয় করা হয়নি।", "Organization handle" "Organization হ্যান্ডেল", "Organizations and teams" "Organizations এবং Teams", "Pending" "অপেক্ষমাণ", "Policy re-acceptance required." "নীতি পুনরায় গ্রহণ করা আবশ্যক।", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "যাচাইয়ের জন্য প্রিপেইড এবং ভার্চুয়াল কার্ড ব্যবহার করা যায় না। একটি নিয়মিত ক্রেডিট বা ডেবিট কার্ড যোগ করুন।", "Principal" "Principal", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "Principal মেলেনি। সাপোর্টের সাথে যোগাযোগ করুন।", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "পুনরায়-প্রমাণীকরণের ব্যবধান (ঘণ্টা)", "Refresh" "রিফ্রেশ", "Remove SSO" "SSO সরান", "Removed." "সরানো হয়েছে।", "Require IdP authentication" "IdP প্রমাণীকরণ আবশ্যক করুন", "Research access" "রিসার্চ অ্যাক্সেস", "Revoke" "বাতিল করুন", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "রেজিস্ট্রির আগে ইস্যু করা প্রতিটি টোকেন বাতিল করুন", "Role mapping (group=role)" "রোল ম্যাপিং (group=role)", "Save SSO" "SSO সংরক্ষণ করুন", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "সংরক্ষিত হয়েছে। সদস্যরা এখন \"organization's IdP\" দিয়ে যাচাই করতে পারবেন।", "Security controls" "সিকিউরিটি কন্ট্রোল", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "সেশন পুনঃযাচাইকরণ আবশ্যক। এই পেজটি রিলোড করুন।", "Sign in" "সাইন ইন", "Sign in again before unlinking." "লিঙ্ক বিচ্ছিন্ন করার আগে আবার সাইন ইন করুন।", "Sign in first." "প্রথমে সাইন ইন করুন।", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "identity verification, research access, organizations, billing এবং connection token পরিচালনা করতে এখানে সাইন ইন করুন।", "Start verification" "যাচাইকরণ শুরু করুন", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "শুরু করলে আপনাকে Stripe-এর যাচাই পেজে নিয়ে যাওয়া হবে (কোনো কার্ড না থাকলে checkout.stripe.com-এ কার্ড সেটআপ, ডকুমেন্ট verify.stripe.com-এ)।", "Status" "স্ট্যাটাস", "Team" "Team", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "সেই Google/GitHub অ্যাকাউন্টটি ইতিমধ্যে অন্য একটি Kotoba অ্যাকাউন্টের সাথে লিঙ্ক করা আছে।", "That handle is already taken." "এই হ্যান্ডেলটি ইতিমধ্যে ব্যবহৃত হয়েছে।", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "IdP সাইন ইন করার কোনো পদ্ধতি নয়। সদস্যরা প্রথমে পাসকি বা ওয়ালেট দিয়ে সাইন ইন করেন, তারপর সদস্যপদ পাওয়ার জন্য সংস্থার IdP-এর মাধ্যমে প্রমাণীকরণ করেন। ভূমিকা হতে পারে admin / member / billing; owner কখনো IdP থেকে প্রদান করা হয় না।", "The organization service is not connected yet." "সংস্থার পরিষেবা এখনও সংযুক্ত করা হয়নি।", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "প্রিন্সিপাল হলো সেই স্থায়ী শনাক্তকারী, যার মাধ্যমে kotoba.cloud আপনাকে চিহ্নিত করে। পাসকি বা ওয়ালেট বদলালেও এটি পরিবর্তিত হয় না।", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "যাচাইকৃত ফ্রি রিসার্চ ভাতার জন্য কখনো চার্জ করা হয় না। পেইড ক্যাপাসিটি স্বয়ংক্রিয় টপ-আপ ছাড়াই ক্রয় করা হয়।", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "টোকেন ইস্যু করা এখনও সক্রিয় করা হয়নি। কিছুক্ষণ পরে আবার চেষ্টা করুন।", "Unavailable" "অনুপলব্ধ", "Under review or additional checks required." "পর্যালোচনা চলছে, বা অতিরিক্ত যাচাইয়ের প্রয়োজন।", "Unlink" "সংযোগ বিচ্ছিন্ন করুন", "Unlinked." "সংযোগ বিচ্ছিন্ন করা হয়েছে।", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "সংযোগ বিচ্ছিন্ন করলেও পাসকি বা ওয়ালেট দিয়ে সাইন ইন করায় কোনো প্রভাব পড়বে না।", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "CLI / IDE থেকে ব্যবহার করুন", "Use from an agent" "এজেন্ট থেকে ব্যবহার করুন", "Username" "ব্যবহারকারীর নাম", "Verification is complete." "পরিচয় যাচাই সম্পন্ন হয়েছে।", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "পরিচয় যাচাই পরিষেবা সাময়িকভাবে অনুপলব্ধ। কিছুক্ষণ পরে আবার চেষ্টা করুন।", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "যাচাইকরণ পরিষেবা অনুপলব্ধ। পরে রিফ্রেশ করুন।", "Verified" "যাচাই করা হয়েছে", "What is a linked account?" "সংযুক্ত অ্যাকাউন্ট কী?", "What is a principal?" "প্রিন্সিপাল কী?", "What is a scope?" "স্কোপ কী?", "What is organization SSO?" "সংস্থার SSO কী?", "asserted" "প্রত্যয়িত", "enforced" "বাধ্যতামূলক", "not required" "প্রয়োজন নেই", "optional" "ঐচ্ছিক", "revoked " "প্রত্যাহার করা হয়েছে "}, :de {" and " " und ", "(no label)" "(keine Bezeichnung)", ". The full guide is at " ". Die vollständige Anleitung finden Sie unter ", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." ". Tokens werden einzeln aus der obigen Liste widerrufen; ab diesem Zeitpunkt antwortet die API mit 401 token-revoked.", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "Ein Team- oder Enterprise-Plan ist erforderlich.", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "Die AML/CTF-Prüfung ist abgelaufen. Eine erneute Überprüfung ist erforderlich.", "About charges" "Über Gebühren", "Account" "Konto", "Add or resume card" "Karte hinzufügen oder fortsetzen", "All legacy tokens revoked." "Alle alten Tokens wurden widerrufen.", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "Eine Organisation wird als did:webvh-DID ausgestellt; die Mitgliedschaft wird über Verifiable Credentials (VC) verwaltet. Der Ersteller erhält die Rolle „Owner“.", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "Die Genehmigung erfolgt automatisch, sobald Stripe den Vorgang abgeschlossen hat. Aktualisieren Sie diese Seite, um die Änderung zu sehen. Wenn Sie die Karteneingabe unterbrochen haben, können Sie unten fortsetzen.", "Approved scopes" "Genehmigte Scopes", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "Mit dem IdP der Organisation authentifizieren", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "Verfügbar für Organisationen mit Team- / Enterprise-Plan. SAML wird derzeit noch nicht unterstützt.", "Billing and credits" "Abrechnung und Guthaben", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "Die Abrechnung wird gerade überprüft. Käufe sind noch nicht möglich.", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "Die Abrechnung muss abgeglichen werden. Bitte wenden Sie sich an den Support.", "Billing service unavailable." "Der Abrechnungsdienst ist nicht verfügbar.", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "Die Karteneingabe wurde abgebrochen. Unten fortsetzen.", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "Karte erfasst. Die Genehmigung erfolgt nach der Benachrichtigung von Stripe, in der Regel innerhalb von Sekunden. Verwenden Sie „Status aktualisieren“, um erneut zu prüfen.", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "Kartenverifizierung: Registrieren Sie eine Kredit- oder Debitkarte, um sie abzuschließen (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid- und virtuelle Karten werden nicht akzeptiert.", "Checking sign-in state…" "Anmeldestatus wird überprüft…", "Checking the identity provider…" "IdP wird überprüft…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "Ihr Anmeldestatus wird überprüft…", "Configured" "Konfiguriert", "Connection token (shown once)" "Verbindungstoken (wird nur einmal angezeigt)", "Continue with GitHub" "Mit GitHub fortfahren", "Continue with Google" "Mit Google fortfahren", "Copied." "Kopiert.", "Copy" "Kopieren", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "Kopieren und speichern Sie das Token jetzt. Es wird nie wieder angezeigt.", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "Der Anmeldestatus konnte nicht überprüft werden. Bitte aktualisieren.", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "Erstellen nicht möglich. Aktualisieren und erneut versuchen.", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "Ausstellen nicht möglich. Aktualisieren und erneut versuchen.", "Could not load." "Laden nicht möglich.", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "Stripe konnte nicht erreicht werden. Bitte später erneut versuchen; wenn das Problem weiterhin besteht, kontaktieren Sie support@kotoba.cloud.", "Could not read linked accounts." "Verknüpfte Konten konnten nicht gelesen werden.", "Could not remove." "Entfernen nicht möglich.", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "Widerrufen nicht möglich. Aktualisieren und erneut versuchen.", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "Konnte nicht gestartet werden. Aktualisieren und erneut versuchen.", "Could not unlink." "Verknüpfung konnte nicht aufgehoben werden.", "Create an organization first." "Erstellen Sie zuerst eine Organisation.", "Create organization" "Organisation erstellen", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "Stripe-Verifizierungssitzung wird erstellt…", "Creating the organization…" "Organisation wird erstellt…", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "Eine Dokumentenprüfung (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) kann ergänzt werden. Kartendaten und Dokumente gehen ausschließlich an Stripe; kotoba.cloud speichert nur Status, Ablaufdatum und einen Nachweisverweis. Die Verifizierung läuft nach 365 Tagen ab.", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "Jeder Scope wird individuell für Forschungszwecke genehmigt. Ein abgelaufener oder gesperrter Scope kann keine Inferenz ausführen.", "Eligible" "Berechtigt", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "Berechtigt. Ihr kostenloses Kontingent steht zur Verfügung.", "Email domains" "E-Mail-Domains", "Environment variables" "Umgebungsvariablen", "Free allowance" "Kostenloses Kontingent", "Go to billing" "Zur Abrechnung", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "Die Verknüpfung von Google/GitHub ist in dieser Umgebung noch nicht aktiviert.", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "Google/GitHub dienen nur zur Identifizierung des Kontos. Die Anmeldung selbst erfolgt per Passkey oder Wallet – niemals mit einem Passwort.", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "Guardrail-, Firewall- und Compliance-Regeln samt Versionen finden Sie unter Sicherheitskontrollen.", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "Das Handle muss dem Format com-<name>.kotoba.cloud entsprechen.", "How verification works" "So funktioniert die Verifizierung", "IdP assertion confirmed" "IdP-Bestätigung erhalten", "IdP assertion required" "IdP-Bestätigung erforderlich", "IdP re-assertion required" "Erneute IdP-Bestätigung erforderlich", "Identity verification" "Identitätsprüfung", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "Die Identitätsprüfung ist abgelaufen. Bitte erneut verifizieren.", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "Die Identitätsprüfung ist unvollständig. Starten Sie sie oben unter „本人確認“.", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "Eingeladene Mitglieder teilen sich API-Token, Scopes und Abrechnung. Rollen sind owner / admin / member / billing.", "Issue a connection token" "Verbindungstoken ausstellen", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "Stellt ein Verbindungstoken für einen lokalen CLI-/IDE-Agenten aus. Es wird nur einmal angezeigt.", "Issue it from this page." "Auf dieser Seite ausstellen.", "Issued tokens" "Ausgestellte Token", "Link GitHub" "GitHub verknüpfen", "Link Google" "Google verknüpfen", "Linked accounts" "Verknüpfte Konten", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "Wenn Sie ein Google- oder GitHub-Konto verknüpfen, schlägt „Weiter mit Google“ beim nächsten Mal den Passkey dieses Kontos vor. Ein verknüpftes Konto ist ein Kennzeichen des Kontos, kein Anmeldeweg.", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "MCP-fähige Agenten wie Claude Code lesen ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "Mitgliedereinladungen sind verfügbar, sobald eine Organisation existiert.", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "Mitglieder werden über den Identitätsanbieter der Organisation verwaltet (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta u. a.). Ein aus dem IdP entferntes Mitglied verliert den Organisationszugriff beim nächsten Re-Authentifizierungsintervall.", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "Noch keine genehmigten Scopes. Nach der Forscherregistrierung beantragen.", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "Kein gültiger Vertrauenspfad. Bitte die Verifizierung neu starten.", "No linked accounts." "Keine verknüpften Konten.", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "Noch keine Organisationen vorhanden. Geben Sie ein Handle ein, um eine zu erstellen.", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "Noch kein Team vorhanden. Erstellen Sie eine Organisation, um Owner zu werden und Mitglieder einzuladen.", "No tokens issued" "Keine Tokens ausgestellt", "Not signed in." "Nicht angemeldet.", "Not verified" "Nicht verifiziert", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "Nur ein Owner oder Admin kann dies konfigurieren.", "Open security controls" "Sicherheitskontrollen öffnen", "Open the guide" "Anleitung öffnen", "Organization" "Organisation", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "Organisations-SSO (Team / Enterprise)", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "Organisations-SSO ist in dieser Umgebung noch nicht aktiviert.", "Organization handle" "Organisations-Handle", "Organizations and teams" "Organisationen und Teams", "Pending" "Ausstehend", "Policy re-acceptance required." "Erneute Zustimmung zu den Richtlinien erforderlich.", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "Prepaid- und virtuelle Karten können nicht zur Verifizierung verwendet werden. Fügen Sie eine reguläre Kredit- oder Debitkarte hinzu.", "Principal" "Principal", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "Principal stimmt nicht überein. Kontaktieren Sie den Support.", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "Intervall für erneute Authentifizierung (Stunden)", "Refresh" "Aktualisieren", "Remove SSO" "SSO entfernen", "Removed." "Entfernt.", "Require IdP authentication" "IdP-Authentifizierung erforderlich machen", "Research access" "Zugang zur Forschungsumgebung", "Revoke" "Widerrufen", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "Alle vor der Registrierung ausgestellten Tokens widerrufen", "Role mapping (group=role)" "Rollenzuordnung (group=role)", "Save SSO" "SSO speichern", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "Gespeichert. Mitglieder können sich nun mit dem IdP der Organisation authentifizieren.", "Security controls" "Sicherheitskontrollen", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "Erneute Sitzungsprüfung erforderlich. Laden Sie diese Seite neu.", "Sign in" "Anmelden", "Sign in again before unlinking." "Melden Sie sich erneut an, bevor Sie die Verknüpfung aufheben.", "Sign in first." "Melden Sie sich zuerst an.", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "Melden Sie sich an, um hier Identitätsverifizierung, Zugang zur Forschungsumgebung, Organisationen, Abrechnung und Verbindungstokens zu verwalten.", "Start verification" "Verifizierung starten", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "Beim Start werden Sie zur Stripe-Prüfung weitergeleitet (Karteneinrichtung auf checkout.stripe.com, falls keine Karte hinterlegt ist; Dokumente auf verify.stripe.com).", "Status" "Status", "Team" "Team", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "Dieses Google-/GitHub-Konto ist bereits mit einem anderen Kotoba-Konto verknüpft.", "That handle is already taken." "Dieser Handle ist bereits vergeben.", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "Der IdP ist keine Anmeldemethode. Mitglieder melden sich zunächst mit einem Passkey oder einer Wallet an und authentifizieren sich anschließend beim IdP der Organisation, um die Mitgliedschaft zu erhalten. Die Rollen sind admin / member / billing; owner wird nie von einem IdP vergeben.", "The organization service is not connected yet." "Der Organisationsdienst ist noch nicht verbunden.", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "Der Principal ist die stabile Kennung, unter der Kotoba Cloud Sie kennt. Sie ändert sich nicht, wenn Sie einen Passkey oder eine Wallet ersetzen.", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "Das verifizierte kostenlose Forschungskontingent wird nie berechnet. Bezahlte Kapazität wird ohne automatisches Aufladen gekauft.", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "Die Token-Ausgabe ist noch nicht aktiviert. Bitte später erneut versuchen.", "Unavailable" "Nicht verfügbar", "Under review or additional checks required." "In Prüfung oder zusätzliche Prüfungen erforderlich.", "Unlink" "Trennen", "Unlinked." "Trennung erfolgt.", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "Das Trennen wirkt sich nicht auf die Anmeldung mit einem Passkey oder einer Wallet aus.", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "Verwendung über CLI / IDE", "Use from an agent" "Verwendung durch einen Agenten", "Username" "Benutzername", "Verification is complete." "Die Verifizierung ist abgeschlossen.", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "Die Verifizierung ist vorübergehend nicht verfügbar. Bitte später erneut versuchen.", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "Der Verifizierungsdienst ist nicht verfügbar. Bitte später aktualisieren.", "Verified" "Verifiziert", "What is a linked account?" "Was ist ein verknüpftes Konto?", "What is a principal?" "Was ist ein Principal?", "What is a scope?" "Was ist ein Scope?", "What is organization SSO?" "Was ist Organisations-SSO?", "asserted" "bestätigt", "enforced" "erforderlich", "not required" "nicht erforderlich", "optional" "optional", "revoked " "widerrufen "}, :es {" and " " y ", "(no label)" "(sin etiqueta)", ". The full guide is at " ". La guía completa está en ", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." ". Los tokens se revocan uno por uno desde la lista anterior; a partir de ese momento la API responde 401 token-revoked.", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "Se requiere un plan Team o Enterprise.", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "La verificación AML/CTF ha caducado. Es necesaria una nueva revisión.", "About charges" "Acerca de los cargos", "Account" "Cuenta", "Add or resume card" "Añadir o reanudar tarjeta", "All legacy tokens revoked." "Se revocaron todos los tokens anteriores.", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "Una organización se emite como un DID did:webvh; la membresía se gestiona con credenciales verificables (VC). El creador recibe el rol de owner.", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "La aprobación ocurre automáticamente cuando Stripe finaliza el proceso. Actualiza esta página para ver el cambio. Si interrumpiste el registro de la tarjeta, puedes reanudarlo abajo.", "Approved scopes" "Ámbitos aprobados", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "Autenticarse con el IdP de la organización", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "Disponible para organizaciones con los planes Team / Enterprise. SAML aún no está soportado.", "Billing and credits" "Facturación y créditos", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "La facturación está en validación. Las compras aún no están disponibles.", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "La facturación necesita reconciliación. Contacta con soporte.", "Billing service unavailable." "Servicio de facturación no disponible.", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "Se canceló el registro de la tarjeta. Puedes reanudarlo abajo.", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "Tarjeta recibida. La aprobación sigue a la notificación de Stripe, normalmente en segundos. Usa «Actualizar estado» para volver a comprobarlo.", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "Verificación de tarjeta: registra una tarjeta de crédito o débito para completarla (checkout.stripe.com). No se aceptan tarjetas prepago ni virtuales.", "Checking sign-in state…" "Comprobando el estado de inicio de sesión…", "Checking the identity provider…" "Comprobando el proveedor de identidad…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "Comprobando el estado de tu sesión…", "Configured" "Configurado", "Connection token (shown once)" "Token de conexión (se muestra una sola vez)", "Continue with GitHub" "Continuar con GitHub", "Continue with Google" "Continuar con Google", "Copied." "Copiado.", "Copy" "Copiar", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "Copia y guarda el token ahora. No volverá a mostrarse.", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "No se pudo comprobar el estado de inicio de sesión. Actualiza.", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "No se pudo crear. Actualiza y vuelve a intentarlo.", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "No se pudo emitir. Actualiza y vuelve a intentarlo.", "Could not load." "No se pudo cargar.", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "No se pudo conectar con Stripe. Inténtalo de nuevo más tarde; si el problema persiste, contacta con support@kotoba.cloud.", "Could not read linked accounts." "No se pudieron leer las cuentas vinculadas.", "Could not remove." "No se pudo eliminar.", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "No se pudo revocar. Actualiza y vuelve a intentarlo.", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "No se pudo iniciar. Actualiza y vuelve a intentarlo.", "Could not unlink." "No se pudo desvincular.", "Create an organization first." "Primero crea una organización.", "Create organization" "Crear organización", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "Creando la sesión de verificación de Stripe…", "Creating the organization…" "Creando la organización…", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "Se puede añadir la verificación de documentos (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com). Los datos de la tarjeta y los documentos se envían únicamente a Stripe; kotoba.cloud solo conserva el estado, la caducidad y una referencia de la evidencia. La verificación caduca a los 365 días.", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "Cada ámbito se aprueba de forma individual para la investigación. Un ámbito caducado o suspendido no puede ejecutar inferencia.", "Eligible" "Elegible", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "Elegible. Tu cuota gratuita está disponible.", "Email domains" "Dominios de correo", "Environment variables" "Variables de entorno", "Free allowance" "Cuota gratuita", "Go to billing" "Ir a facturación", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "La vinculación con Google / GitHub aún no está habilitada en este entorno.", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "Google / GitHub solo identifican la cuenta. El inicio de sesión en sí usa una passkey o una wallet, nunca una contraseña.", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "Las reglas de guardrail, firewall y cumplimiento, junto con sus versiones, se muestran en Controles de seguridad.", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "El identificador debe tener el formato com-<nombre>.kotoba.cloud.", "How verification works" "Cómo funciona la verificación", "IdP assertion confirmed" "Aserción del IdP confirmada", "IdP assertion required" "Se requiere aserción del IdP", "IdP re-assertion required" "Se requiere una nueva aserción del IdP", "Identity verification" "Verificación de identidad", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "La verificación de identidad ha caducado. Vuelve a verificarla.", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "La verificación de identidad está incompleta. Inícala en «Verificación de identidad» más arriba.", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "Los miembros invitados comparten tokens de API, ámbitos y facturación. Los roles son owner / admin / member / billing.", "Issue a connection token" "Emitir un token de conexión", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "Emite un token de conexión para un agente local de CLI / IDE. Se muestra una sola vez.", "Issue it from this page." "Emítelo desde esta página.", "Issued tokens" "Tokens emitidos", "Link GitHub" "Vincular GitHub", "Link Google" "Vincular Google", "Linked accounts" "Cuentas vinculadas", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "Vincular una cuenta de Google o GitHub permite que «Continuar con Google» sugiera la passkey de esta cuenta la próxima vez. Una cuenta vinculada solo identifica la cuenta; no es un método de inicio de sesión.", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "Los agentes compatibles con MCP, como Claude Code, leen ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "Las invitaciones a miembros se habilitan al crear una organización.", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "Los miembros se gestionan a través del proveedor de identidad de la organización (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta y otros). Un miembro eliminado del IdP pierde el acceso a la organización en el siguiente intervalo de reautenticación.", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "Aún no hay ámbitos aprobados. Solicítalos después del registro de investigador.", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "No hay una ruta de confianza vigente. Reinicia la verificación.", "No linked accounts." "No hay cuentas vinculadas.", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "Aún no hay organizaciones. Ingresa un identificador para crear una.", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "Aún no hay equipo. Crea una organización para convertirte en propietario e invitar miembros.", "No tokens issued" "No se han emitido tokens", "Not signed in." "No has iniciado sesión.", "Not verified" "No verificado", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "Solo un propietario o administrador puede configurar esto.", "Open security controls" "Abrir controles de seguridad", "Open the guide" "Abrir la guía", "Organization" "Organización", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "SSO de organización (Team / Enterprise)", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "El SSO de organización aún no está habilitado en este entorno.", "Organization handle" "Identificador de la organización", "Organizations and teams" "Organizaciones y equipos", "Pending" "Pendiente", "Policy re-acceptance required." "Es necesario aceptar nuevamente la política.", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "Las tarjetas prepago y virtuales no se pueden usar para la verificación. Agrega una tarjeta de crédito o débito regular.", "Principal" "Principal", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "El principal no coincide. Contacta con soporte.", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "Intervalo de reautenticación (horas)", "Refresh" "Actualizar", "Remove SSO" "Eliminar SSO", "Removed." "Eliminado.", "Require IdP authentication" "Requerir autenticación del IdP", "Research access" "Acceso a investigación", "Revoke" "Revocar", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "Revocar todos los tokens emitidos antes del registro", "Role mapping (group=role)" "Asignación de roles (grupo=rol)", "Save SSO" "Guardar SSO", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "Guardado. Los miembros ya pueden autenticarse con el IdP de la organización.", "Security controls" "Controles de seguridad", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "Se requiere reverificar la sesión. Recarga esta página.", "Sign in" "Iniciar sesión", "Sign in again before unlinking." "Vuelve a iniciar sesión antes de desvincular.", "Sign in first." "Primero inicia sesión.", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "Inicia sesión para gestionar aquí la verificación de identidad, el acceso a investigación, las organizaciones, la facturación y los tokens de conexión.", "Start verification" "Iniciar verificación", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "Al iniciar, se te dirigirá a la verificación de Stripe (configuración de tarjeta en checkout.stripe.com si no hay tarjeta registrada, y documentos en verify.stripe.com).", "Status" "Estado", "Team" "Equipo", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "Esa cuenta de Google/GitHub ya está vinculada a otra cuenta de Kotoba.", "That handle is already taken." "Ese identificador ya está en uso.", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "El IdP no es un método de inicio de sesión. Los miembros primero inician sesión con una passkey o una wallet, y luego se autentican con el IdP de la organización para obtener la membresía. Los roles son admin / member / billing; el rol owner nunca se otorga mediante un IdP.", "The organization service is not connected yet." "El servicio de organización aún no está conectado.", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "El principal es el identificador estable con el que kotoba.cloud te reconoce. No cambia cuando reemplazas una passkey o una wallet.", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "La asignación gratuita de investigación verificada nunca se cobra. La capacidad de pago se compra sin recarga automática.", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "La emisión de tokens aún no está habilitada. Vuelve a intentarlo más tarde.", "Unavailable" "No disponible", "Under review or additional checks required." "En revisión, o se requieren verificaciones adicionales.", "Unlink" "Desvincular", "Unlinked." "Desvinculado.", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "Desvincular no afecta el inicio de sesión con una passkey o una wallet.", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "Usar desde una CLI / IDE", "Use from an agent" "Usar desde un agente", "Username" "Nombre de usuario", "Verification is complete." "La verificación está completa.", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "La verificación no está disponible temporalmente. Vuelve a intentarlo más tarde.", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "El servicio de verificación no está disponible. Actualiza más tarde.", "Verified" "Verificado", "What is a linked account?" "¿Qué es una cuenta vinculada?", "What is a principal?" "¿Qué es un principal?", "What is a scope?" "¿Qué es un scope?", "What is organization SSO?" "¿Qué es el SSO de la organización?", "asserted" "declarado", "enforced" "obligatorio", "not required" "no requerido", "optional" "opcional", "revoked " "revocado "}, :fr {" and " " et ", "(no label)" "(aucun libellé)", ". The full guide is at " ". Le guide complet se trouve à l'adresse ", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." ". Les jetons sont révoqués un par un depuis la liste ci-dessus ; à partir de ce moment, l'API répond 401 token-revoked.", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "Un forfait Team ou Enterprise est requis.", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "Le contrôle AML/CTF a expiré. Un nouvel examen est nécessaire.", "About charges" "À propos des frais", "Account" "Compte", "Add or resume card" "Ajouter ou reprendre une carte", "All legacy tokens revoked." "Tous les jetons antérieurs ont été révoqués.", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "Une organisation est émise sous forme de DID did:webvh ; l'adhésion est gérée avec des identifiants vérifiables (VC). Le créateur reçoit le rôle owner.", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "L'approbation se fait automatiquement dès que Stripe a terminé. Actualisez cette page pour voir le changement. Si vous avez interrompu la saisie de la carte, reprenez ci-dessous.", "Approved scopes" "Portées approuvées", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "S'authentifier avec le fournisseur d'identité de l'organisation", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "Disponible pour les organisations aux forfaits Team / Enterprise. SAML n'est pas encore pris en charge.", "Billing and credits" "Facturation et crédits", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "La facturation est en cours de validation. Les achats ne sont pas encore disponibles.", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "La facturation nécessite une réconciliation. Contactez le support.", "Billing service unavailable." "Service de facturation indisponible.", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "La saisie de la carte a été annulée. Reprenez ci-dessous.", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "Carte reçue. L'approbation suit la notification de Stripe, généralement en quelques secondes. Utilisez « Actualiser le statut » pour vérifier à nouveau.", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "Vérification par carte : enregistrez une carte de crédit ou de débit pour la finaliser (checkout.stripe.com). Les cartes prépayées et virtuelles ne sont pas acceptées.", "Checking sign-in state…" "Vérification de l'état de connexion…", "Checking the identity provider…" "Vérification du fournisseur d'identité…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "Vérification de votre état de connexion…", "Configured" "Configuré", "Connection token (shown once)" "Jeton de connexion (affiché une seule fois)", "Continue with GitHub" "Continuer avec GitHub", "Continue with Google" "Continuer avec Google", "Copied." "Copié.", "Copy" "Copier", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "Copiez et conservez le jeton dès maintenant. Il ne sera plus jamais affiché.", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "Impossible de vérifier l'état de connexion. Actualisez.", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "Impossible de créer. Actualisez et réessayez.", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "Impossible de délivrer. Actualisez et réessayez.", "Could not load." "Impossible de charger.", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "Impossible de contacter Stripe. Réessayez plus tard ; si le problème persiste, contactez support@kotoba.cloud.", "Could not read linked accounts." "Impossible de lire les comptes liés.", "Could not remove." "Impossible de supprimer.", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "Impossible de révoquer. Actualisez et réessayez.", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "Impossible de démarrer. Actualisez et réessayez.", "Could not unlink." "Impossible de dissocier.", "Create an organization first." "Créez d'abord une organisation.", "Create organization" "Créer une organisation", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "Création de la session de vérification Stripe…", "Creating the organization…" "Création de l'organisation…", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "La vérification de documents (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) peut être ajoutée. Les détails de carte et les documents ne sont transmis qu'à Stripe ; kotoba.cloud conserve uniquement le statut, la date d'expiration et une référence de preuve. La vérification expire après 365 jours.", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "Chaque portée est approuvée sur sa propre base pour la recherche. Une portée expirée ou suspendue ne peut pas exécuter d'inférence.", "Eligible" "Éligible", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "Éligible. Votre quota gratuit est disponible.", "Email domains" "Domaines de messagerie", "Environment variables" "Variables d'environnement", "Free allowance" "Quota gratuit", "Go to billing" "Accéder à la facturation", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "La liaison Google / GitHub n'est pas encore activée dans cet environnement.", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "Google / GitHub servent uniquement à identifier le compte. La connexion elle-même utilise une clé d'accès ou un portefeuille — jamais un mot de passe.", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "Les règles de garde-fou, de pare-feu et de conformité, ainsi que leurs versions, sont affichées dans Contrôles de sécurité.", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "L'identifiant doit être au format com-<nom>.kotoba.cloud.", "How verification works" "Comment fonctionne la vérification", "IdP assertion confirmed" "Assertion IdP confirmée", "IdP assertion required" "Assertion IdP requise", "IdP re-assertion required" "Nouvelle assertion IdP requise", "Identity verification" "Vérification d'identité", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "La vérification d'identité a expiré. Vérifiez-vous à nouveau.", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "La vérification d'identité est incomplète. Démarrez-la dans « 本人確認 » ci-dessus.", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "Les membres invités partagent les jetons API, les portées et la facturation. Les rôles sont owner / admin / member / billing.", "Issue a connection token" "Émettre un jeton de connexion", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "Émettez un jeton de connexion pour un agent CLI / IDE local. Il n'est affiché qu'une seule fois.", "Issue it from this page." "Émettez-le depuis cette page.", "Issued tokens" "Jetons émis", "Link GitHub" "Lier GitHub", "Link Google" "Lier Google", "Linked accounts" "Comptes liés", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "Lier un compte Google ou GitHub permet à « Continuer avec Google » de proposer la clé d'accès de ce compte la prochaine fois. Un compte lié identifie le compte ; ce n'est pas un moyen de se connecter.", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "Les agents compatibles MCP tels que Claude Code lisent ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "Les invitations de membres s'ouvrent dès qu'une organisation existe.", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "Les membres sont gérés par le fournisseur d'identité de l'organisation (OpenID Connect : Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta et autres). Un membre retiré de l'IdP perd l'accès à l'organisation au prochain intervalle de réauthentification.", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "Aucune portée approuvée pour l'instant. Faites une demande après l'inscription en tant que chercheur.", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "Aucune route de confiance actuelle. Recommencez la vérification.", "No linked accounts." "Aucun compte lié.", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "Aucune organisation pour l'instant. Saisissez un identifiant pour en créer une.", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "Aucune équipe pour l'instant. Créez une organisation pour devenir owner et inviter des membres.", "No tokens issued" "Aucun token émis", "Not signed in." "Non connecté.", "Not verified" "Non vérifié", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "Seul un owner ou un admin peut configurer ceci.", "Open security controls" "Ouvrir les contrôles de sécurité", "Open the guide" "Ouvrir le guide", "Organization" "Organisation", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "SSO d'organisation (Team / Enterprise)", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "Le SSO d'organisation n'est pas encore activé dans cet environnement.", "Organization handle" "Identifiant de l'organisation", "Organizations and teams" "Organisations et équipes", "Pending" "En cours", "Policy re-acceptance required." "Une nouvelle acceptation des règles est requise.", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "Les cartes prépayées et virtuelles ne peuvent pas être utilisées pour la vérification. Ajoutez une carte de crédit ou de débit classique.", "Principal" "Principal", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "Le principal ne correspond pas. Contactez le support.", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "Intervalle de réauthentification (heures)", "Refresh" "Actualiser", "Remove SSO" "Supprimer le SSO", "Removed." "Supprimé.", "Require IdP authentication" "Exiger l'authentification via le fournisseur d'identité", "Research access" "Accès à la recherche", "Revoke" "Révoquer", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "Révoquer tous les tokens émis avant l'enregistrement", "Role mapping (group=role)" "Correspondance des rôles (group=role)", "Save SSO" "Enregistrer le SSO", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "Enregistré. Les membres peuvent désormais s'authentifier avec le fournisseur d'identité de l'organisation.", "Security controls" "Contrôles de sécurité", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "Une nouvelle vérification de session est requise. Rechargez cette page.", "Sign in" "Se connecter", "Sign in again before unlinking." "Reconnectez-vous avant de dissocier ce compte.", "Sign in first." "Connectez-vous d'abord.", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "Connectez-vous pour gérer ici la vérification d'identité, l'accès à la recherche, les organisations, la facturation et les tokens de connexion.", "Start verification" "Démarrer la vérification", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "Le démarrage vous redirige vers la vérification Stripe (ajout de carte sur checkout.stripe.com si aucune carte n'est enregistrée, documents sur verify.stripe.com).", "Status" "Statut", "Team" "Équipe", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "Ce compte Google/GitHub est déjà lié à un autre compte Kotoba.", "That handle is already taken." "Ce nom d'utilisateur est déjà pris.", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "L'IdP n'est pas un moyen de connexion. Les membres se connectent d'abord avec une passkey ou un portefeuille, puis s'authentifient auprès de l'IdP de l'organisation pour obtenir leur appartenance. Les rôles sont admin / member / billing ; le rôle owner n'est jamais accordé par un IdP.", "The organization service is not connected yet." "Le service d'organisation n'est pas encore connecté.", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "Le principal est l'identifiant stable par lequel kotoba.cloud vous reconnaît. Il ne change pas lorsque vous remplacez une passkey ou un portefeuille.", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "Le quota de recherche gratuit vérifié n'est jamais facturé. La capacité payante est achetée sans rechargement automatique.", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "L'émission de jetons n'est pas encore activée. Réessayez plus tard.", "Unavailable" "Indisponible", "Under review or additional checks required." "En cours d'examen ou vérifications supplémentaires requises.", "Unlink" "Dissocier", "Unlinked." "Dissocié.", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "La dissociation n'affecte pas la connexion par passkey ou par portefeuille.", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "Utiliser depuis une CLI / un IDE", "Use from an agent" "Utiliser depuis un agent", "Username" "Nom d'utilisateur", "Verification is complete." "La vérification d'identité est terminée.", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "La vérification est temporairement indisponible. Réessayez plus tard.", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "Le service de vérification est indisponible. Actualisez plus tard.", "Verified" "Vérifié", "What is a linked account?" "Qu'est-ce qu'un compte associé ?", "What is a principal?" "Qu'est-ce qu'un principal ?", "What is a scope?" "Qu'est-ce qu'un scope ?", "What is organization SSO?" "Qu'est-ce que le SSO d'organisation ?", "asserted" "attesté", "enforced" "obligatoire", "not required" "non requis", "optional" "facultatif", "revoked " "révoqué "}, :he {" and " " ו- ", "(no label)" "(אין תווית)", ". The full guide is at " ". המדריך המלא נמצא בכתובת ", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." ". הטוקנים מבוטלים אחד-אחד מהרשימה שלמעלה; מאותה נקודה ואילך ה-API מחזיר 401 token-revoked.", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "נדרשת תוכנית Team או Enterprise.", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "בדיקת AML/CTF פגה. נדרשת בדיקה חוזרת.", "About charges" "מידע על החיובים", "Account" "חשבון", "Add or resume card" "הוספת כרטיס או המשך תהליך", "All legacy tokens revoked." "כל הטוקנים הישנים בוטלו.", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "ארגון מונפק כ-DID מסוג did:webvh; החברות בו מנוהלת באמצעות אישורים מאומתים (VC). היוצר מקבל את תפקיד ה-owner.", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "האישור מתבצע אוטומטית עם סיום התהליך ב-Stripe. רענן את הדף כדי לראות את השינוי. אם הפסקת את הזנת הכרטיס באמצע, אפשר להמשיך למטה.", "Approved scopes" "היקפי הרשאה מאושרים", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "אימות מול ה-IdP של הארגון", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "זמין לארגונים בתוכניות Team / Enterprise. SAML אינו נתמך עדיין.", "Billing and credits" "חיוב ויתרות", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "החיוב בבדיקה. רכישות אינן זמינות עדיין.", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "החיוב דורש התאמה. פנה לתמיכה.", "Billing service unavailable." "שירות החיוב אינו זמין.", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "הזנת הכרטיס בוטלה. אפשר להמשיך למטה.", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "הכרטיס התקבל. האישור יתבצע לאחר קבלת ההתראה מ-Stripe, בדרך כלל תוך שניות. השתמש ב'עדכון סטטוס' לבדיקה חוזרת.", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "אימות כרטיס: יש לרשום כרטיס אשראי או דביט כדי להשלים את התהליך (checkout.stripe.com). כרטיסים נטענים וכרטיסים וירטואליים אינם מתקבלים.", "Checking sign-in state…" "בודקים את מצב הכניסה…", "Checking the identity provider…" "בודקים את ה-IdP…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "בודקים את מצב הכניסה שלך…", "Configured" "מוגדר", "Connection token (shown once)" "טוקן חיבור (מוצג פעם אחת)", "Continue with GitHub" "המשך עם GitHub", "Continue with Google" "המשך עם Google", "Copied." "הועתק.", "Copy" "העתקה", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "העתק ושמור את הטוקן כעת. הוא לא יוצג שוב.", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "לא ניתן לבדוק את מצב הכניסה. רענן.", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "לא ניתן ליצור. רענן ונסה שוב.", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "לא ניתן להנפיק. רענן ונסה שוב.", "Could not load." "לא ניתן לטעון.", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "לא ניתן להתחבר ל-Stripe. נסה שוב מאוחר יותר; אם הבעיה נמשכת, פנה אל support@kotoba.cloud.", "Could not read linked accounts." "לא ניתן לקרוא את החשבונות המקושרים.", "Could not remove." "לא ניתן להסיר.", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "לא ניתן לבטל. רענן ונסה שוב.", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "לא ניתן היה להתחיל. רענן ונסה שוב.", "Could not unlink." "לא ניתן היה להסיר את הקישור.", "Create an organization first." "צור ארגון לפני כן.", "Create organization" "צור ארגון", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "יוצר את סשן האימות של Stripe…", "Creating the organization…" "יוצר את הארגון…", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "ניתן להוסיף אימות מסמכים (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com). פרטי כרטיס ומסמכים נשלחים ל-Stripe בלבד; kotoba.cloud שומר רק את הסטטוס, תוקף וייחוס ראיה. האימות פג תוקף לאחר 365 יום.", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "כל scope מאושר בנפרד עבור מחקר. לא ניתן להפעיל הסקה (inference) עם scope שפג תוקפו או שהושעה.", "Eligible" "זכאי", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "זכאי. המכסה החינמית שלך זמינה.", "Email domains" "דומיינים של אימייל", "Environment variables" "משתני סביבה", "Free allowance" "מכסה חינמית", "Go to billing" "עבור לחיוב", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "קישור Google / GitHub עדיין לא מופעל בסביבה זו.", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "Google / GitHub משמשים לזיהוי החשבון בלבד. הכניסה עצמה מתבצעת באמצעות passkey או wallet — לעולם לא סיסמה.", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "כללי Guardrail, חומת אש (firewall) ותאימות (compliance) והגרסאות שלהם מוצגים בפקדי אבטחה.", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "השם המזהה חייב להיות בפורמט com-<name>.kotoba.cloud.", "How verification works" "כיצד האימות עובד", "IdP assertion confirmed" "אישור ה-IdP אומת", "IdP assertion required" "נדרש אישור IdP", "IdP re-assertion required" "נדרש אישור IdP חדש", "Identity verification" "אימות זהות", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "אימות הזהות פג תוקף. יש לאמת מחדש.", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "אימות הזהות אינו שלם. התחל בקטע \"אימות זהות\" מעלה.", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "חברים מוזמנים חולקים אסימוני API, scopes וחיוב. התפקידים הם owner / admin / member / billing.", "Issue a connection token" "הפק אסימון חיבור", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "הפק אסימון חיבור עבור סוכן CLI / IDE מקומי. הוא יוצג פעם אחת בלבד.", "Issue it from this page." "הפק אותו מדף זה.", "Issued tokens" "אסימונים שהופקו", "Link GitHub" "קשר GitHub", "Link Google" "קשר Google", "Linked accounts" "חשבונות מקושרים", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "קישור חשבון Google או GitHub מאפשר ל-\"המשך עם Google\" להציע בפעם הבאה את ה-passkey של חשבון זה. חשבון מקושר מזהה את החשבון בלבד; הוא אינו אמצעי כניסה.", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "סוכנים התומכים ב-MCP, כגון Claude Code, קוראים ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "הזמנת חברים תיפתח לאחר יצירת ארגון.", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "החברים מנוהלים על ידי ספק הזהות (IdP) של הארגון (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta ואחרים). חבר שהוסר מה-IdP יאבד גישה לארגון במחזור האימות מחדש הבא.", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "אין עדיין scopes מאושרים. הגש בקשה לאחר רישום כחוקר.", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "אין נתיב אמון תקף כעת. יש להפעיל מחדש את האימות.", "No linked accounts." "אין חשבונות מקושרים.", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "אין עדיין ארגונים. הזן שם משתמש (handle) כדי ליצור ארגון.", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "אין עדיין צוות. צור ארגון כדי להיות בעל התפקיד owner ולהזמין חברים.", "No tokens issued" "לא הונפקו אסימונים", "Not signed in." "לא מחובר.", "Not verified" "לא מאומת", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "רק owner או admin יכולים להגדיר זאת.", "Open security controls" "פתח בקרות אבטחה", "Open the guide" "פתח את המדריך", "Organization" "ארגון", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "SSO ארגוני (Team / Enterprise)", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "SSO ארגוני אינו מופעל בסביבה זו עדיין.", "Organization handle" "שם משתמש (handle) של הארגון", "Organizations and teams" "ארגונים וצוותים", "Pending" "בהמתנה", "Policy re-acceptance required." "נדרשת הסכמה חדשה למדיניות.", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "לא ניתן להשתמש בכרטיסים נטענים או וירטואליים לאימות. הוסף כרטיס אשראי או דביט רגיל.", "Principal" "Principal", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "אי-התאמה ב-Principal. פנה לתמיכה.", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "מרווח אימות חוזר (שעות)", "Refresh" "רענן", "Remove SSO" "הסר SSO", "Removed." "הוסר.", "Require IdP authentication" "דרוש אימות מול IdP", "Research access" "גישה למחקר", "Revoke" "בטל", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "בטל את כל האסימונים שהונפקו לפני הרישום", "Role mapping (group=role)" "מיפוי תפקידים (group=role)", "Save SSO" "שמור SSO", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "נשמר. חברים יכולים כעת להתאמת עם IdP של הארגון.", "Security controls" "בקרות אבטחה", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "נדרש אימות חוזר של ההתחברות. טען מחדש את העמוד.", "Sign in" "התחבר", "Sign in again before unlinking." "התחבר שוב לפני ביטול הקישור.", "Sign in first." "התחבר קודם.", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "התחבר כדי לנהל כאן אימות זהות, גישה למחקר, ארגונים, חיוב ואסימוני חיבור.", "Start verification" "התחל אימות", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "התחלה תעביר אותך לבדיקת Stripe (הגדרת כרטיס ב-checkout.stripe.com אם אין כרטיס רשום, ומסמכים ב-verify.stripe.com).", "Status" "סטטוס", "Team" "צוות", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "חשבון ה-Google/GitHub הזה מקושר כבר לחשבון Kotoba אחר.", "That handle is already taken." "השם הזה תפוס.", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "ה-IdP אינו אמצעי כניסה. חברים מתחברים תחילה עם פאסקי או ארנק, ולאחר מכן מתאמתים מול ה-IdP של הארגון כדי לקבל חברות. התפקידים הם admin / member / billing; owner לעולם לא מוענק על ידי IdP.", "The organization service is not connected yet." "שירות הארגון עדיין לא מחובר.", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "הפרינציפל הוא המזהה הקבוע שבאמצעותו Kotoba Cloud מכיר אותך. הוא לא משתנה כשמחליפים פאסקי או ארנק.", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "מכסת המחקר החינמית המאומתת אינה מחויבת בתשלום. קיבולת בתשלום נרכשת בלי טעינה אוטומטית.", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "הנפקת אסימונים עדיין לא מופעלת. נסה שוב מאוחר יותר.", "Unavailable" "לא זמין", "Under review or additional checks required." "בבדיקה, או שנדרשות בדיקות נוספות.", "Unlink" "בטל קישור", "Unlinked." "הקישור בוטל.", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "ביטול הקישור אינו משפיע על הכניסה באמצעות פאסקי או ארנק.", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "שימוש מ-CLI / IDE", "Use from an agent" "שימוש מתוך סוכן", "Username" "שם משתמש", "Verification is complete." "אימות הזהות הושלם.", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "אימות הזהות אינו זמין כרגע. נסה שוב מאוחר יותר.", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "שירות אימות הזהות אינו זמין. רענן מאוחר יותר.", "Verified" "מאומת", "What is a linked account?" "מה זה חשבון מקושר?", "What is a principal?" "מה זה פרינציפל?", "What is a scope?" "מה זה scope?", "What is organization SSO?" "מה זה SSO ארגוני?", "asserted" "מאושר", "enforced" "מחויב", "not required" "לא נדרש", "optional" "אופציונלי", "revoked " "בוטל "}, :hi {" and " " और ", "(no label)" "(कोई लेबल नहीं)", ". The full guide is at " "। पूरी गाइड यहाँ उपलब्ध है ", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." " पर उपलब्ध है। टोकन को ऊपर दी गई सूची से एक-एक करके निरस्त किया जा सकता है; निरस्त होने के बाद API 401 token-revoked उत्तर देता है।", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "Team या Enterprise प्लान आवश्यक है।", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "AML/CTF जाँच की समय-सीमा समाप्त हो गई है। पुनः समीक्षा आवश्यक है।", "About charges" "शुल्क के बारे में", "Account" "खाता", "Add or resume card" "कार्ड जोड़ें या जारी रखें", "All legacy tokens revoked." "पंजीकरण से पहले जारी सभी टोकन निरस्त कर दिए गए हैं।", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "संगठन को did:webvh DID के रूप में जारी किया जाता है; सदस्यता को सत्यापन योग्य क्रेडेंशियल (VC) से प्रबंधित किया जाता है। निर्माता को owner भूमिका दी जाती है।", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "Stripe की प्रक्रिया पूरी होने पर स्वीकृति स्वतः हो जाती है। बदलाव देखने के लिए इस पेज को रीफ़्रेश करें। यदि आपने कार्ड जोड़ने की प्रक्रिया बीच में छोड़ दी थी, तो नीचे से जारी रखें।", "Approved scopes" "स्वीकृत स्कोप", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "संगठन के IdP से प्रमाणित करें", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "यह सुविधा Team / Enterprise प्लान वाले संगठनों के लिए उपलब्ध है। SAML अभी समर्थित नहीं है।", "Billing and credits" "बिलिंग और क्रेडिट", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "बिलिंग सत्यापन में है। अभी खरीदारी उपलब्ध नहीं है।", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "बिलिंग को मिलान की आवश्यकता है। सहायता से संपर्क करें।", "Billing service unavailable." "बिलिंग सेवा उपलब्ध नहीं है।", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "कार्ड जोड़ने की प्रक्रिया रद्द कर दी गई। नीचे से जारी रखें।", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "कार्ड प्राप्त हो गया है। Stripe की सूचना मिलने पर स्वीकृति होती है, आमतौर पर कुछ ही सेकंड में। फिर से जाँचने के लिए 状態を更新 का उपयोग करें।", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "कार्ड सत्यापन: इसे पूरा करने के लिए क्रेडिट या डेबिट कार्ड दर्ज करें (checkout.stripe.com)। प्रीपेड और वर्चुअल कार्ड स्वीकार नहीं किए जाते।", "Checking sign-in state…" "साइन-इन स्थिति की जाँच की जा रही है…", "Checking the identity provider…" "पहचान प्रदाता की जाँच की जा रही है…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "आपकी साइन-इन स्थिति की जाँच की जा रही है…", "Configured" "कॉन्फ़िगर किया गया", "Connection token (shown once)" "कनेक्शन टोकन (केवल एक बार दिखाया जाएगा)", "Continue with GitHub" "GitHub से जारी रखें", "Continue with Google" "Google से जारी रखें", "Copied." "कॉपी हो गया।", "Copy" "कॉपी करें", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "अभी टोकन कॉपी करके सुरक्षित रखें। यह फिर कभी नहीं दिखाया जाएगा।", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "साइन-इन स्थिति की जाँच नहीं की जा सकी। रीफ़्रेश करें।", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "बनाया नहीं जा सका। रीफ़्रेश करके फिर से प्रयास करें।", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "जारी नहीं किया जा सका। रीफ़्रेश करके फिर से प्रयास करें।", "Could not load." "लोड नहीं हो सका।", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "Stripe से संपर्क नहीं हो सका। कुछ समय बाद फिर से प्रयास करें; समस्या बने रहने पर support@kotoba.cloud से संपर्क करें।", "Could not read linked accounts." "लिंक किए गए खातों को पढ़ा नहीं जा सका।", "Could not remove." "हटाया नहीं जा सका।", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "निरस्त नहीं किया जा सका। रीफ़्रेश करके फिर से प्रयास करें।", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "शुरू नहीं किया जा सका। रीफ़्रेश करें और फिर से प्रयास करें।", "Could not unlink." "अनलिंक नहीं किया जा सका।", "Create an organization first." "पहले एक संगठन बनाएँ।", "Create organization" "संगठन बनाएँ", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "Stripe सत्यापन सत्र बनाया जा रहा है…", "Creating the organization…" "संगठन बनाया जा रहा है…", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "दस्तावेज़ सत्यापन (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) जोड़ा जा सकता है। कार्ड विवरण और दस्तावेज़ केवल Stripe को भेजे जाते हैं; kotoba.cloud केवल स्थिति, समाप्ति तिथि और एक प्रमाण संदर्भ रखता है। सत्यापन 365 दिनों के बाद समाप्त हो जाता है।", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "प्रत्येक स्कोप शोध के लिए अपने-अपने आधार पर स्वीकृत होता है। समय-सीमा समाप्त या निलंबित स्कोप से इन्फेरेंस नहीं चलाया जा सकता।", "Eligible" "पात्र", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "पात्र। आपकी मुफ़्त सीमा उपलब्ध है।", "Email domains" "ईमेल डोमेन", "Environment variables" "एनवायरनमेंट वेरिएबल", "Free allowance" "मुफ़्त सीमा", "Go to billing" "बिलिंग पर जाएँ", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "इस एनवायरनमेंट में Google / GitHub लिंकिंग अभी सक्षम नहीं है।", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "Google / GitHub केवल खाते की पहचान करते हैं। साइन इन के लिए पासकी या वॉलेट का उपयोग होता है — पासवर्ड कभी नहीं।", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "गार्डरेल, फ़ायरवॉल और कंप्लायंस नियम एवं उनके संस्करण सुरक्षा नियंत्रण में दिखाए जाते हैं।", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "हैंडल com-<name>.kotoba.cloud प्रारूप में होना चाहिए।", "How verification works" "सत्यापन कैसे काम करता है", "IdP assertion confirmed" "IdP प्रमाणीकरण की पुष्टि हो गई", "IdP assertion required" "IdP प्रमाणीकरण आवश्यक है", "IdP re-assertion required" "IdP पुनः-प्रमाणीकरण आवश्यक है", "Identity verification" "पहचान सत्यापन", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "पहचान सत्यापन की समय-सीमा समाप्त हो गई है। फिर से सत्यापित करें।", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "पहचान सत्यापन अधूरा है। इसे ऊपर 本人確認 में शुरू करें।", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "आमंत्रित सदस्य API टोकन, स्कोप और बिलिंग साझा करते हैं। भूमिकाएँ हैं owner / admin / member / billing।", "Issue a connection token" "कनेक्शन टोकन जारी करें", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "स्थानीय CLI / IDE एजेंट के लिए कनेक्शन टोकन जारी करें। यह केवल एक बार दिखाया जाता है।", "Issue it from this page." "इसे इस पेज से जारी करें।", "Issued tokens" "जारी किए गए टोकन", "Link GitHub" "GitHub लिंक करें", "Link Google" "Google लिंक करें", "Linked accounts" "लिंक किए गए खाते", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "Google या GitHub खाता लिंक करने पर अगली बार \"Continue with Google\" इस खाते की पासकी सुझाएगा। लिंक किया गया खाता केवल खाते को पहचानता है; यह साइन इन करने का तरीका नहीं है।", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "Claude Code जैसे MCP-सक्षम एजेंट पढ़ते हैं ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "संगठन बनने के बाद सदस्य आमंत्रण खुलते हैं।", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "सदस्यों को संगठन के आइडेंटिटी प्रोवाइडर (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta और अन्य) द्वारा प्रबंधित किया जाता है। IdP से हटाया गया सदस्य अगले पुनः-प्रमाणीकरण अंतराल पर संगठन की एक्सेस खो देता है।", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "अभी तक कोई स्वीकृत स्कोप नहीं है। शोधकर्ता पंजीकरण के बाद आवेदन करें।", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "कोई मौजूदा ट्रस्ट रूट नहीं है। सत्यापन फिर से शुरू करें।", "No linked accounts." "कोई लिंक किया गया खाता नहीं है।", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "अभी तक कोई संगठन नहीं है। एक बनाने के लिए हैंडल दर्ज करें।", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "अभी तक कोई टीम नहीं है। owner बनने और सदस्यों को आमंत्रित करने के लिए एक संगठन बनाएं।", "No tokens issued" "कोई टोकन जारी नहीं किया गया", "Not signed in." "साइन इन नहीं किया गया है।", "Not verified" "सत्यापित नहीं", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "इसे केवल owner या admin ही कॉन्फ़िगर कर सकते हैं।", "Open security controls" "सुरक्षा नियंत्रण खोलें", "Open the guide" "गाइड खोलें", "Organization" "संगठन", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "संगठन SSO (Team / Enterprise)", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "इस एनवायरनमेंट में संगठन SSO अभी सक्षम नहीं है।", "Organization handle" "संगठन हैंडल", "Organizations and teams" "संगठन और टीमें", "Pending" "प्रक्रियाधीन", "Policy re-acceptance required." "नीति को फिर से स्वीकार करना आवश्यक है।", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "प्रीपेड और वर्चुअल कार्ड का उपयोग वेरिफ़िकेशन के लिए नहीं किया जा सकता। कृपया एक सामान्य क्रेडिट या डेबिट कार्ड जोड़ें।", "Principal" "प्रिंसिपल", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "प्रिंसिपल मेल नहीं खाता। सपोर्ट से संपर्क करें।", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "पुनः-प्रमाणीकरण अंतराल (घंटे)", "Refresh" "रीफ्रेश करें", "Remove SSO" "SSO हटाएं", "Removed." "हटा दिया गया।", "Require IdP authentication" "IdP प्रमाणीकरण आवश्यक बनाएं", "Research access" "रिसर्च एक्सेस", "Revoke" "रद्द करें", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "रजिस्ट्री से पहले जारी किए गए सभी टोकन रद्द करें", "Role mapping (group=role)" "रोल मैपिंग (group=role)", "Save SSO" "SSO सेव करें", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "सेव हो गया। सदस्य अब \"संगठन के IdP से प्रमाणित करें\" का उपयोग कर सकते हैं।", "Security controls" "सुरक्षा नियंत्रण", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "सेशन का पुनः-सत्यापन आवश्यक है। इस पेज को रीलोड करें।", "Sign in" "साइन इन करें", "Sign in again before unlinking." "अनलिंक करने से पहले दोबारा साइन इन करें।", "Sign in first." "पहले साइन इन करें।", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "पहचान वेरिफ़िकेशन, रिसर्च एक्सेस, संगठन, बिलिंग और कनेक्शन टोकन को यहां मैनेज करने के लिए साइन इन करें।", "Start verification" "वेरिफ़िकेशन शुरू करें", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "शुरू करने पर आप Stripe की जाँच पर पहुँच जाते हैं (यदि कार्ड दर्ज नहीं है तो checkout.stripe.com पर कार्ड सेटअप, दस्तावेज़ verify.stripe.com पर)।", "Status" "स्थिति", "Team" "टीम", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "यह Google/GitHub अकाउंट पहले से ही किसी अन्य Kotoba अकाउंट से लिंक है।", "That handle is already taken." "यह हैंडल पहले से उपयोग में है।", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "IdP साइन इन करने का तरीका नहीं है। सदस्य पहले पासकी या वॉलेट से साइन इन करते हैं, फिर सदस्यता प्राप्त करने के लिए संगठन के IdP से प्रमाणीकरण करते हैं। भूमिकाएं admin / member / billing होती हैं; owner भूमिका IdP द्वारा कभी नहीं दी जाती।", "The organization service is not connected yet." "संगठन सेवा अभी कनेक्ट नहीं की गई है।", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "प्रिंसिपल वह स्थिर पहचानकर्ता है जिससे kotoba.cloud आपको पहचानता है। पासकी या वॉलेट बदलने पर भी यह नहीं बदलता।", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "सत्यापित मुफ़्त रिसर्च कोटा से कभी शुल्क नहीं लिया जाता। पेड कैपेसिटी बिना ऑटो टॉप-अप के खरीदी जाती है।", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "टोकन जारी करना अभी सक्षम नहीं है। कृपया बाद में फिर से कोशिश करें।", "Unavailable" "उपलब्ध नहीं", "Under review or additional checks required." "समीक्षा में है, या अतिरिक्त जांच आवश्यक है।", "Unlink" "लिंक हटाएं", "Unlinked." "लिंक हटा दिया गया।", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "लिंक हटाने से पासकी या वॉलेट से साइन इन करने पर कोई असर नहीं पड़ता।", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "CLI / IDE से उपयोग करें", "Use from an agent" "एजेंट से उपयोग करें", "Username" "उपयोगकर्ता नाम", "Verification is complete." "पहचान सत्यापन पूरा हो चुका है।", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "पहचान सत्यापन सेवा अस्थायी रूप से उपलब्ध नहीं है। कृपया बाद में फिर से कोशिश करें।", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "सत्यापन सेवा उपलब्ध नहीं है। कृपया बाद में रीफ़्रेश करें।", "Verified" "सत्यापित", "What is a linked account?" "लिंक किया गया खाता क्या है?", "What is a principal?" "प्रिंसिपल क्या है?", "What is a scope?" "स्कोप क्या है?", "What is organization SSO?" "संगठन SSO क्या है?", "asserted" "सत्यापित", "enforced" "अनिवार्य", "not required" "आवश्यक नहीं", "optional" "वैकल्पिक", "revoked " "रद्द किया गया "}, :id {" and " " dan ", "(no label)" "(tanpa label)", ". The full guide is at " ". Panduan lengkapnya ada di ", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." ". Token dicabut satu per satu dari daftar di atas; sejak saat itu API akan merespons 401 token-revoked.", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "Paket Team atau Enterprise diperlukan.", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "Pemeriksaan AML/CTF telah kedaluwarsa. Tinjauan ulang diperlukan.", "About charges" "Tentang biaya", "Account" "Akun", "Add or resume card" "Tambah atau lanjutkan kartu", "All legacy tokens revoked." "Semua token lama telah dicabut.", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "Sebuah organisasi diterbitkan sebagai DID did:webvh; keanggotaan dikelola dengan kredensial yang dapat diverifikasi (VC). Pembuat menerima peran owner.", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "Persetujuan terjadi secara otomatis setelah Stripe menyelesaikan proses. Muat ulang halaman ini untuk melihat perubahannya. Jika Anda meninggalkan proses pendaftaran kartu di tengah jalan, lanjutkan di bawah ini.", "Approved scopes" "Cakupan yang disetujui", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "Autentikasi dengan IdP organisasi", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "Tersedia untuk organisasi dengan paket Team / Enterprise. SAML belum didukung.", "Billing and credits" "Penagihan dan kredit", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "Penagihan sedang dalam proses validasi. Pembelian belum tersedia.", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "Penagihan memerlukan rekonsiliasi. Hubungi dukungan.", "Billing service unavailable." "Layanan penagihan tidak tersedia.", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "Pendaftaran kartu dibatalkan. Lanjutkan di bawah ini.", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "Kartu diterima. Persetujuan akan mengikuti notifikasi dari Stripe, biasanya dalam beberapa detik. Gunakan 状態を更新 untuk memeriksa ulang.", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "Verifikasi kartu: daftarkan kartu kredit atau debit untuk menyelesaikannya (checkout.stripe.com). Kartu prabayar dan kartu virtual tidak diterima.", "Checking sign-in state…" "Memeriksa status masuk…", "Checking the identity provider…" "Memeriksa penyedia identitas (IdP)…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "Memeriksa status masuk Anda…", "Configured" "Terkonfigurasi", "Connection token (shown once)" "Token koneksi (ditampilkan sekali)", "Continue with GitHub" "Lanjutkan dengan GitHub", "Continue with Google" "Lanjutkan dengan Google", "Copied." "Disalin.", "Copy" "Salin", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "Salin dan simpan token ini sekarang. Token ini tidak akan ditampilkan lagi.", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "Tidak dapat memeriksa status masuk. Muat ulang.", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "Tidak dapat membuat. Muat ulang dan coba lagi.", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "Tidak dapat menerbitkan. Muat ulang dan coba lagi.", "Could not load." "Tidak dapat memuat.", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "Tidak dapat terhubung ke Stripe. Coba lagi nanti; jika masalah berlanjut, hubungi support@kotoba.cloud.", "Could not read linked accounts." "Tidak dapat membaca akun yang terhubung.", "Could not remove." "Tidak dapat menghapus.", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "Tidak dapat mencabut. Muat ulang dan coba lagi.", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "Tidak dapat memulai. Muat ulang dan coba lagi.", "Could not unlink." "Tidak dapat melepas tautan.", "Create an organization first." "Buat organisasi terlebih dahulu.", "Create organization" "Buat organisasi", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "Membuat sesi verifikasi Stripe…", "Creating the organization…" "Membuat organisasi…", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "Verifikasi dokumen (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) dapat ditambahkan. Detail kartu dan dokumen hanya dikirim ke Stripe; kotoba.cloud hanya menyimpan status, tanggal kedaluwarsa, dan referensi bukti. Verifikasi berakhir setelah 365 hari.", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "Setiap scope disetujui berdasarkan dasarnya masing-masing untuk riset. Scope yang kedaluwarsa atau ditangguhkan tidak dapat menjalankan inferensi.", "Eligible" "Memenuhi syarat", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "Memenuhi syarat. Kuota gratis Anda tersedia.", "Email domains" "Domain email", "Environment variables" "Variabel lingkungan", "Free allowance" "Kuota gratis", "Go to billing" "Buka halaman tagihan", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "Penautan Google / GitHub belum diaktifkan di lingkungan ini.", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "Google / GitHub hanya mengidentifikasi akun. Proses masuk itu sendiri menggunakan passkey atau wallet — tidak pernah kata sandi.", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "Aturan guardrail, firewall, dan kepatuhan beserta versinya ditampilkan di bagian Kontrol keamanan.", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "Handle harus berbentuk com-<nama>.kotoba.cloud.", "How verification works" "Cara kerja verifikasi", "IdP assertion confirmed" "Assertion IdP terkonfirmasi", "IdP assertion required" "Assertion IdP diperlukan", "IdP re-assertion required" "Re-assertion IdP diperlukan", "Identity verification" "Verifikasi identitas", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "Verifikasi identitas telah berakhir. Verifikasi ulang.", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "Verifikasi identitas belum selesai. Mulai di 本人確認 di atas.", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "Anggota yang diundang berbagi token API, scope, dan tagihan. Peran terdiri dari owner / admin / member / billing.", "Issue a connection token" "Terbitkan token koneksi", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "Terbitkan token koneksi untuk agen CLI / IDE lokal. Token hanya ditampilkan sekali.", "Issue it from this page." "Terbitkan dari halaman ini.", "Issued tokens" "Token yang diterbitkan", "Link GitHub" "Tautkan GitHub", "Link Google" "Tautkan Google", "Linked accounts" "Akun tertaut", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "Menautkan akun Google atau GitHub membuat \"Lanjutkan dengan Google\" menawarkan passkey akun ini di lain waktu. Akun tertaut hanya menandai akun; ini bukan cara untuk masuk.", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "Agen berkemampuan MCP seperti Claude Code membaca ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "Undangan anggota terbuka setelah organisasi dibuat.", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "Anggota dikelola oleh penyedia identitas organisasi (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta, dan lainnya). Anggota yang dihapus dari IdP akan kehilangan akses organisasi pada interval autentikasi ulang berikutnya.", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "Belum ada scope yang disetujui. Ajukan setelah pendaftaran peneliti.", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "Tidak ada jalur kepercayaan yang berlaku. Mulai ulang verifikasi.", "No linked accounts." "Belum ada akun tertaut.", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "Belum ada organisasi. Masukkan handle untuk membuatnya.", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "Belum ada tim. Buat organisasi untuk menjadi owner dan mengundang anggota.", "No tokens issued" "Belum ada token yang diterbitkan", "Not signed in." "Belum masuk.", "Not verified" "Belum terverifikasi", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "Hanya owner atau admin yang dapat mengonfigurasi ini.", "Open security controls" "Buka kontrol keamanan", "Open the guide" "Buka panduan", "Organization" "Organisasi", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "SSO Organisasi (Team / Enterprise)", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "SSO organisasi belum diaktifkan di lingkungan ini.", "Organization handle" "Handle organisasi", "Organizations and teams" "Organisasi dan tim", "Pending" "Sedang diproses", "Policy re-acceptance required." "Perlu menyetujui ulang kebijakan.", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "Kartu prabayar dan kartu virtual tidak dapat digunakan untuk verifikasi. Tambahkan kartu kredit atau debit biasa.", "Principal" "Principal", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "Principal tidak cocok. Hubungi dukungan.", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "Interval autentikasi ulang (jam)", "Refresh" "Segarkan", "Remove SSO" "Hapus SSO", "Removed." "Dihapus.", "Require IdP authentication" "Wajibkan autentikasi IdP", "Research access" "Akses riset", "Revoke" "Cabut", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "Cabut semua token yang diterbitkan sebelum registrasi", "Role mapping (group=role)" "Pemetaan peran (group=role)", "Save SSO" "Simpan SSO", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "Disimpan. Anggota sekarang dapat melakukan autentikasi melalui IdP organisasi.", "Security controls" "Kontrol keamanan", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "Verifikasi ulang sesi diperlukan. Muat ulang halaman ini.", "Sign in" "Masuk", "Sign in again before unlinking." "Masuk kembali sebelum memutuskan tautan.", "Sign in first." "Masuk terlebih dahulu.", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "Masuk untuk mengelola verifikasi identitas, akses riset, organisasi, penagihan, dan token koneksi di sini.", "Start verification" "Mulai verifikasi", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "Memulai akan membawa Anda ke pemeriksaan Stripe (pengaturan kartu di checkout.stripe.com jika belum ada kartu terdaftar, dokumen di verify.stripe.com).", "Status" "Status", "Team" "Tim", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "Akun Google/GitHub tersebut sudah terhubung ke akun Kotoba lain.", "That handle is already taken." "Handle tersebut sudah digunakan.", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "IdP bukan cara untuk masuk. Anggota pertama-tama masuk dengan passkey atau wallet, lalu melakukan autentikasi dengan IdP organisasi untuk mendapatkan keanggotaan. Peran yang tersedia adalah admin / member / billing; peran owner tidak pernah diberikan melalui IdP.", "The organization service is not connected yet." "Layanan organisasi belum terhubung.", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "Principal adalah pengidentifikasi stabil yang digunakan kotoba.cloud untuk mengenali Anda. Nilai ini tidak berubah saat Anda mengganti passkey atau wallet.", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "Kuota riset gratis yang terverifikasi tidak akan pernah dikenakan biaya. Kapasitas berbayar dibeli tanpa top-up otomatis.", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "Penerbitan token belum diaktifkan. Coba lagi nanti.", "Unavailable" "Tidak tersedia", "Under review or additional checks required." "Sedang ditinjau, atau memerlukan pemeriksaan tambahan.", "Unlink" "Lepas tautan", "Unlinked." "Tautan telah dilepas.", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "Melepas tautan tidak memengaruhi proses masuk dengan passkey atau wallet.", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "Gunakan dari CLI / IDE", "Use from an agent" "Gunakan dari agen", "Username" "Nama pengguna", "Verification is complete." "Verifikasi telah selesai.", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "Verifikasi untuk sementara tidak tersedia. Coba lagi nanti.", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "Layanan verifikasi tidak tersedia. Muat ulang nanti.", "Verified" "Terverifikasi", "What is a linked account?" "Apa itu akun tertaut?", "What is a principal?" "Apa itu principal?", "What is a scope?" "Apa itu scope?", "What is organization SSO?" "Apa itu SSO organisasi?", "asserted" "terverifikasi", "enforced" "wajib", "not required" "tidak diwajibkan", "optional" "opsional", "revoked " "dicabut "}, :it {" and " " e ", "(no label)" "(nessuna etichetta)", ". The full guide is at " ". La guida completa è disponibile su ", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." ". I token vengono revocati uno per uno dall'elenco sopra; da quel momento l'API risponde 401 token-revoked.", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "È richiesto un piano Team o Enterprise.", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "Il controllo AML/CTF è scaduto. È necessaria una nuova verifica.", "About charges" "Informazioni sui costi", "Account" "Account", "Add or resume card" "Aggiungi o riprendi la carta", "All legacy tokens revoked." "Tutti i token precedenti sono stati revocati.", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "Un'organizzazione viene emessa come DID did:webvh; l'appartenenza è gestita tramite credenziali verificabili (VC). Il creatore riceve il ruolo di owner.", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "L'approvazione avviene automaticamente al termine della verifica su Stripe. Aggiorna questa pagina per vedere la modifica. Se hai interrotto la registrazione della carta, puoi riprenderla qui sotto.", "Approved scopes" "Ambiti approvati", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "Autenticati con l'IdP dell'organizzazione", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "Disponibile per le organizzazioni con piano Team / Enterprise. SAML non è ancora supportato.", "Billing and credits" "Fatturazione e crediti", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "La fatturazione è in fase di verifica. Gli acquisti non sono ancora disponibili.", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "La fatturazione richiede una riconciliazione. Contatta l'assistenza.", "Billing service unavailable." "Servizio di fatturazione non disponibile.", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "La registrazione della carta è stata annullata. Puoi riprenderla qui sotto.", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "Carta registrata. L'approvazione segue la notifica di Stripe, di solito in pochi secondi. Usa \"Aggiorna stato\" per verificare di nuovo.", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "Verifica della carta: registra una carta di credito o debito per completarla (checkout.stripe.com). Le carte prepagate e virtuali non sono accettate.", "Checking sign-in state…" "Verifica dello stato di accesso in corso…", "Checking the identity provider…" "Verifica dell'IdP in corso…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "Verifica dello stato di accesso in corso…", "Configured" "Configurato", "Connection token (shown once)" "Token di connessione (mostrato una sola volta)", "Continue with GitHub" "Continua con GitHub", "Continue with Google" "Continua con Google", "Copied." "Copiato.", "Copy" "Copia", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "Copia e conserva subito il token. Non verrà mostrato di nuovo.", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "Non è stato possibile verificare lo stato di accesso. Aggiorna.", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "Non è stato possibile crearlo. Aggiorna e riprova.", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "Non è stato possibile emetterlo. Aggiorna e riprova.", "Could not load." "Non è stato possibile caricarlo.", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "Non è stato possibile contattare Stripe. Riprova più tardi; se il problema persiste, contatta support@kotoba.cloud.", "Could not read linked accounts." "Non è stato possibile leggere gli account collegati.", "Could not remove." "Non è stato possibile rimuoverlo.", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "Non è stato possibile revocarlo. Aggiorna e riprova.", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "Impossibile avviare. Aggiorna e riprova.", "Could not unlink." "Impossibile scollegare.", "Create an organization first." "Crea prima un'organizzazione.", "Create organization" "Crea organizzazione", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "Creazione della sessione di verifica Stripe…", "Creating the organization…" "Creazione dell'organizzazione…", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "È possibile aggiungere la verifica dei documenti (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com). I dati della carta e i documenti vengono inviati solo a Stripe; kotoba.cloud conserva solo lo stato, la scadenza e un riferimento alla prova. La verifica scade dopo 365 giorni.", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "Ogni scope viene approvato singolarmente per la ricerca. Uno scope scaduto o sospeso non può eseguire inferenza.", "Eligible" "Ammissibile", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "Ammissibile. La tua quota gratuita è disponibile.", "Email domains" "Domini e-mail", "Environment variables" "Variabili d'ambiente", "Free allowance" "Quota gratuita", "Go to billing" "Vai alla fatturazione", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "Il collegamento a Google / GitHub non è ancora attivato in questo ambiente.", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "Google / GitHub servono solo a identificare l'account. L'accesso in sé avviene tramite passkey o wallet, mai con una password.", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "Le regole di guardrail, firewall e conformità e le relative versioni sono visibili in Controlli di sicurezza.", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "L'handle deve avere il formato com-<nome>.kotoba.cloud.", "How verification works" "Come funziona la verifica", "IdP assertion confirmed" "Asserzione IdP confermata", "IdP assertion required" "Asserzione IdP richiesta", "IdP re-assertion required" "Ri-asserzione IdP richiesta", "Identity verification" "Verifica dell'identità", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "La verifica dell'identità è scaduta. Verifica di nuovo.", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "La verifica dell'identità è incompleta. Avviala in 本人確認 qui sopra.", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "I membri invitati condividono token API, scope e fatturazione. I ruoli sono owner / admin / member / billing.", "Issue a connection token" "Emetti un token di connessione", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "Emetti un token di connessione per un agente CLI / IDE locale. Viene mostrato una sola volta.", "Issue it from this page." "Emettilo da questa pagina.", "Issued tokens" "Token emessi", "Link GitHub" "Collega GitHub", "Link Google" "Collega Google", "Linked accounts" "Account collegati", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "Collegando un account Google o GitHub, la prossima volta \"Continua con Google\" proporrà la passkey di questo account. Un account collegato identifica l'account; non è un metodo di accesso.", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "Gli agenti compatibili con MCP, come Claude Code, leggono ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "Gli inviti per i membri si aprono dopo la creazione di un'organizzazione.", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "I membri sono gestiti dall'identity provider dell'organizzazione (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta e altri). Un membro rimosso dall'IdP perde l'accesso all'organizzazione al successivo intervallo di ri-autenticazione.", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "Nessuno scope approvato per ora. Fai richiesta dopo la registrazione come ricercatore.", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "Nessun percorso di fiducia attivo. Riavvia la verifica.", "No linked accounts." "Nessun account collegato.", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "Nessuna organizzazione ancora. Inserisci un handle per crearne una.", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "Nessun team ancora. Crea un'organizzazione per diventare owner e invitare membri.", "No tokens issued" "Nessun token emesso", "Not signed in." "Non hai effettuato l'accesso.", "Not verified" "Non verificato", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "Solo un owner o un admin può configurare questa opzione.", "Open security controls" "Apri i controlli di sicurezza", "Open the guide" "Apri la guida", "Organization" "Organizzazione", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "SSO organizzativo (Team / Enterprise)", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "L'SSO organizzativo non è ancora abilitato in questo ambiente.", "Organization handle" "Handle dell'organizzazione", "Organizations and teams" "Organizzazioni e team", "Pending" "In corso", "Policy re-acceptance required." "È necessario accettare nuovamente le norme.", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "Le carte prepagate e virtuali non possono essere usate per la verifica. Aggiungi una carta di credito o debito normale.", "Principal" "Principal", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "Il principal non corrisponde. Contatta l'assistenza.", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "Intervallo di ri-autenticazione (ore)", "Refresh" "Aggiorna", "Remove SSO" "Rimuovi SSO", "Removed." "Rimosso.", "Require IdP authentication" "Richiedi autenticazione IdP", "Research access" "Accesso alla ricerca", "Revoke" "Revoca", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "Revoca tutti i token emessi prima della registrazione", "Role mapping (group=role)" "Mappatura ruoli (group=role)", "Save SSO" "Salva SSO", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "Salvato. I membri possono ora autenticarsi con l'IdP dell'organizzazione.", "Security controls" "Controlli di sicurezza", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "È necessaria una nuova verifica della sessione. Ricarica questa pagina.", "Sign in" "Accedi", "Sign in again before unlinking." "Accedi di nuovo prima di scollegare.", "Sign in first." "Accedi prima di continuare.", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "Accedi per gestire qui la verifica dell'identità, l'accesso alla ricerca, le organizzazioni, la fatturazione e i token di connessione.", "Start verification" "Avvia la verifica", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "L'avvio ti reindirizza alla verifica Stripe (configurazione carta su checkout.stripe.com se non ne hai una registrata, documenti su verify.stripe.com).", "Status" "Stato", "Team" "Team", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "Questo account Google/GitHub è già collegato a un altro account Kotoba.", "That handle is already taken." "Questo handle è già in uso.", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "L'IdP non è un metodo di accesso. I membri accedono prima con una passkey o un wallet, poi si autenticano con l'IdP dell'organizzazione per ottenere l'appartenenza. I ruoli sono admin / member / billing; il ruolo owner non viene mai concesso da un IdP.", "The organization service is not connected yet." "Il servizio dell'organizzazione non è ancora connesso.", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "Il principal è l'identificatore stabile con cui kotoba.cloud ti riconosce. Non cambia quando sostituisci una passkey o un wallet.", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "L'allocazione gratuita per la ricerca verificata non viene mai fatturata. La capacità a pagamento viene acquistata senza ricarica automatica.", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "L'emissione dei token non è ancora attiva. Riprova più tardi.", "Unavailable" "Non disponibile", "Under review or additional checks required." "In fase di revisione o sono necessari controlli aggiuntivi.", "Unlink" "Disconnetti", "Unlinked." "Disconnesso.", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "La disconnessione non influisce sull'accesso con una passkey o un wallet.", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "Usa da CLI / IDE", "Use from an agent" "Usa da un agente", "Username" "Nome utente", "Verification is complete." "La verifica è completa.", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "La verifica è temporaneamente non disponibile. Riprova più tardi.", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "Il servizio di verifica non è disponibile. Aggiorna più tardi.", "Verified" "Verificato", "What is a linked account?" "Cos'è un account collegato?", "What is a principal?" "Cos'è un principal?", "What is a scope?" "Cos'è uno scope?", "What is organization SSO?" "Cos'è lo SSO dell'organizzazione?", "asserted" "attestato", "enforced" "obbligatorio", "not required" "non richiesto", "optional" "opzionale", "revoked " "revocato "}, :jv {" and " " lan ", "(no label)" "(ora ana label)", ". The full guide is at " ". Pandhuan lengkap ana ing ", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." ". Token dicabut siji-siji saka dhaptar ing dhuwur; wiwit wektu kuwi API bakal mangsuli 401 token-revoked.", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "Perlu plan Team utawa Enterprise.", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "Screening AML/CTF wis kadaluwarsa. Perlu ditinjau maneh.", "About charges" "Babagan biaya", "Account" "Akun", "Add or resume card" "Tambah utawa lanjutake kertu", "All legacy tokens revoked." "Kabeh token lawas wis dicabut.", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "Organisasi diterbitake minangka DID did:webvh; keanggotan dikelola nganggo verifiable credential (VC). Sing gawe bakal nampa peran owner.", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "Persetujuan bakal kelakon otomatis nalika Stripe wis rampung mriksa. Refresh kaca iki kanggo ndeleng owahane. Yen sampeyan mandheg tengah-tengah pas ngisi kertu, lanjutake ing ngisor iki.", "Approved scopes" "Scope kang disetujoni", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "Autentikasi nganggo IdP organisasi", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "Kasedhiya kanggo organisasi ing plan Team / Enterprise. SAML durung didhukung.", "Billing and credits" "Billing lan kredit", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "Billing lagi ing proses validasi. Pembelian durung bisa ditindakake.", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "Billing perlu direkonsiliasi. Hubungi dhukungan.", "Billing service unavailable." "Layanan billing ora kasedhiya.", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "Pengisian kertu dibatalake. Lanjutake ing ngisor iki.", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "Kertu wis ditampa. Persetujuan bakal nyusul saka notifikasi Stripe, biasane sajroning sawetara detik. Gunakake 状態を更新 kanggo mriksa maneh.", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "Verifikasi kertu: daftarake kertu kredit utawa debit kanggo ngrampungake (checkout.stripe.com). Kertu prabayar lan kertu virtual ora ditampa.", "Checking sign-in state…" "Nliti status sign-in…", "Checking the identity provider…" "Nliti IdP…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "Nliti status sign-in sampeyan…", "Configured" "Wis dikonfigurasi", "Connection token (shown once)" "Token sambungan (ditampilake sepisan)", "Continue with GitHub" "Lanjut nganggo GitHub", "Continue with Google" "Lanjut nganggo Google", "Copied." "Wis disalin.", "Copy" "Salin", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "Salin lan simpen token iki saiki. Token iki ora bakal ditampilake maneh.", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "Ora bisa mriksa status sign-in. Refresh.", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "Ora bisa digawe. Refresh lan coba maneh.", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "Ora bisa ngeluwarake. Refresh lan coba maneh.", "Could not load." "Ora bisa dimuat.", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "Ora bisa nyambung menyang Stripe. Coba maneh mengko; yen isih kelakon, hubungi support@kotoba.cloud.", "Could not read linked accounts." "Ora bisa maca akun sing disambungake.", "Could not remove." "Ora bisa dibusak.", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "Ora bisa dicabut. Refresh lan coba maneh.", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "Ora bisa miwiti. Refresh banjur coba maneh.", "Could not unlink." "Ora bisa mbatalake gandhengan.", "Create an organization first." "Gawe organisasi dhisik.", "Create organization" "Gawe organisasi", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "Nggawe sesi verifikasi Stripe…", "Creating the organization…" "Nggawe organisasi…", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "Verifikasi dokumen (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) bisa ditambahake. Detail kertu lan dokumen mung dikirim menyang Stripe; kotoba.cloud nyimpen status, tanggal kadaluwarsa, lan referensi bukti. Verifikasi kadaluwarsa sawise 365 dina.", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "Saben scope disetujoni miturut dhasar dhewe-dhewe kanggo riset. Scope sing kadaluwarsa utawa ditundha ora bisa nglakokake inferensi.", "Eligible" "Layak", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "Layak. Jatah gratis sampeyan kasedhiya.", "Email domains" "Domain email", "Environment variables" "Variabel lingkungan", "Free allowance" "Jatah gratis", "Go to billing" "Menyang kaca billing", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "Nggandhengake Google / GitHub durung diaktifake ing lingkungan iki.", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "Google / GitHub mung ngenali akun. Mlebu dhewe nggunakake passkey utawa wallet — ora tau nggunakake password.", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "Aturan guardrail, firewall, lan kepatuhan sarta versine ditampilake ing Kontrol keamanan.", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "Handle kudu wujud com-<name>.kotoba.cloud.", "How verification works" "Cara kerja verifikasi", "IdP assertion confirmed" "Assertion IdP wis dikonfirmasi", "IdP assertion required" "Assertion IdP dibutuhake", "IdP re-assertion required" "Assertion ulang IdP dibutuhake", "Identity verification" "Verifikasi identitas", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "Verifikasi identitas wis kadaluwarsa. Verifikasi maneh.", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "Verifikasi identitas durung rampung. Wiwiti ing 本人確認 ing dhuwur.", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "Anggota sing diundang bakal nyambut API token, scope, lan billing. Peran yaiku owner / admin / member / billing.", "Issue a connection token" "Terbitake token sambungan", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "Terbitake token sambungan kanggo agen CLI / IDE lokal. Ditampilake mung sepisan.", "Issue it from this page." "Terbitake saka kaca iki.", "Issued tokens" "Token sing wis diterbitake", "Link GitHub" "Gandhengake GitHub", "Link Google" "Gandhengake Google", "Linked accounts" "Akun sing digandhengake", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "Nggandhengake akun Google utawa GitHub ngidini \"Continue with Google\" nawakake passkey akun iki ing sesi ngarep. Akun sing digandhengake dadi tandha jeneng akun; iku dudu cara kanggo mlebu.", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "Agen sing kompatibel MCP kaya Claude Code maca ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "Undhangan anggota bakal dibukak yen organisasi wis ana.", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "Anggota dikelola dening penyedia identitas organisasi (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta, lan liya-liyane). Anggota sing dibusak saka IdP bakal ilang akses organisasi ing interval re-otentikasi sabanjure.", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "Durung ana scope sing disetujoni. Ajukan sawise registrasi peneliti.", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "Ora ana rute pracaya sing aktif. Wiwiti verifikasi maneh.", "No linked accounts." "Ora ana akun sing digandhengake.", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "Durung ana organisasi. Lebokna handle kanggo nggawe siji.", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "Durung ana tim. Gawe organisasi supaya dadi owner lan bisa ngundang anggota.", "No tokens issued" "Durung ana token sing diterbitake", "Not signed in." "Durung mlebu.", "Not verified" "Durung diverifikasi", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "Mung owner utawa admin sing bisa nyetel iki.", "Open security controls" "Bukak kontrol keamanan", "Open the guide" "Bukak pandhuan", "Organization" "Organisasi", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "SSO Organisasi (Team / Enterprise)", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "SSO organisasi durung diaktifake ing lingkungan iki.", "Organization handle" "Handle organisasi", "Organizations and teams" "Organisasi lan tim", "Pending" "Lagi dipriksa", "Policy re-acceptance required." "Persetujuan kabijakan kudu dibarengi maneh.", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "Kertu prabayar lan kertu virtual ora bisa dienggo kanggo verifikasi. Tambahna kertu kredit utawa debit biasa.", "Principal" "Principal", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "Principal ora cocog. Hubungi support.", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "Interval re-autentikasi (jam)", "Refresh" "Segerake", "Remove SSO" "Busak SSO", "Removed." "Wis dibusak.", "Require IdP authentication" "Mbutuhake autentikasi IdP", "Research access" "Akses riset", "Revoke" "Batalake", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "Batalake kabeh token sing diterbitake sadurunge registry", "Role mapping (group=role)" "Pemetaan role (group=role)", "Save SSO" "Simpen SSO", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "Disimpen. Anggota saiki bisa ngautentikasi nganggo IdP organisasi.", "Security controls" "Kontrol keamanan", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "Sesi kudu diverifikasi ulang. Muat ulang kaca iki.", "Sign in" "Mlebu", "Sign in again before unlinking." "Mlebu maneh sadurunge mbatalake pengaitan.", "Sign in first." "Mlebu dhisik.", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "Mlebu kanggo ngatur verifikasi identitas, akses riset, organisasi, tagihan, lan token sambungan ing kene.", "Start verification" "Wiwiti verifikasi", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "Miwiti bakal mindhah sampeyan menyang pamriksan Stripe (setelan kertu ing checkout.stripe.com yen durung ana kertu sing kadhaptar, dokumen ing verify.stripe.com).", "Status" "Status", "Team" "Tim", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "Akun Google/GitHub kasebut wis dikaitake karo akun Kotoba liyane.", "That handle is already taken." "Handle kasebut wis dienggo.", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "IdP dudu cara kanggo login. Anggota kudu login luwih dhisik nganggo passkey utawa wallet, banjur nindakake autentikasi liwat IdP organisasi kanggo entuk keanggotan. Peran kang ana yaiku admin / member / billing; owner ora bakal diwenehake dening IdP.", "The organization service is not connected yet." "Layanan organisasi durung disambungake.", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "Principal iku identitas stabil sing digunakake kotoba.cloud kanggo ngenali sampeyan. Iki ora bakal owah nalika sampeyan ngganti passkey utawa wallet.", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "Jatah riset gratis kang wis diverifikasi ora bakal ditagih. Kapasitas berbayar dituku tanpa isi ulang otomatis.", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "Penerbitan token durung diaktifake. Coba maneh sabanjure.", "Unavailable" "Ora Kasedhiya", "Under review or additional checks required." "Isih ditliti utawa mbutuhake priksa tambahan.", "Unlink" "Batalake Pertalian", "Unlinked." "Pertalian wis dibatalake.", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "Mbatalake pertalian ora mengaruhi login nganggo passkey utawa wallet.", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "Gunakake saka CLI / IDE", "Use from an agent" "Gunakake saka agent", "Username" "Nama pangguna", "Verification is complete." "Verifikasi wis rampung.", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "Verifikasi lagi ora kasedhiya kanggo wektu iki. Coba maneh sabanjure.", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "Layanan verifikasi ora kasedhiya. Refresh sabanjure.", "Verified" "Wis Diverifikasi", "What is a linked account?" "Apa iku akun sing ditalikake?", "What is a principal?" "Apa iku principal?", "What is a scope?" "Apa iku scope?", "What is organization SSO?" "Apa iku SSO organisasi?", "asserted" "wis dikonfirmasi", "enforced" "wajib", "not required" "ora wajib", "optional" "opsional", "revoked " "wis dibatalake "}, :ko {" and " " 및 ", "(no label)" "(라벨 없음)", ". The full guide is at " ". 전체 가이드는 ", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." ". 토큰은 위 목록에서 하나씩 취소됩니다. 취소한 순간부터 API는 401 token-revoked를 반환합니다.", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "Team 또는 Enterprise 요금제가 필요합니다.", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "AML/CTF 심사가 만료되었습니다. 재심사가 필요합니다.", "About charges" "청구 정보", "Account" "계정", "Add or resume card" "카드 등록 또는 재개", "All legacy tokens revoked." "등록 이전에 발급된 모든 토큰이 취소되었습니다.", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "조직은 did:webvh DID로 발급되며, 멤버십은 검증 가능한 자격증명(VC)으로 관리됩니다. 생성자에게는 owner 역할이 부여됩니다.", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "Stripe에서 확인이 완료되면 자동으로 승인됩니다. 이 페이지를 새로고침하면 변경된 상태를 확인할 수 있습니다. 카드 등록을 중단했다면 아래에서 다시 시작하세요.", "Approved scopes" "승인된 범위", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "조직의 IdP로 인증하기", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "Team / Enterprise 요금제의 조직에서 사용할 수 있습니다. SAML은 아직 지원되지 않습니다.", "Billing and credits" "결제 및 크레딧", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "결제는 검증 중입니다. 아직 구매할 수 없습니다.", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "결제 내용 조정이 필요합니다. 지원팀에 문의하세요.", "Billing service unavailable." "결제 서비스에 연결할 수 없습니다.", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "카드 등록이 취소되었습니다. 아래에서 다시 시작하세요.", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "카드 등록이 접수되었습니다. Stripe의 알림에 따라 보통 몇 초 내에 승인됩니다. 다시 확인하려면 '상태 새로고침'을 사용하세요.", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "카드 인증: 신용카드 또는 체크카드를 등록하여 완료합니다(checkout.stripe.com). 선불카드 및 가상카드는 사용할 수 없습니다.", "Checking sign-in state…" "로그인 상태 확인 중…", "Checking the identity provider…" "ID 공급자 확인 중…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "로그인 상태를 확인하고 있습니다…", "Configured" "설정됨", "Connection token (shown once)" "연결 토큰(한 번만 표시)", "Continue with GitHub" "GitHub로 계속하기", "Continue with Google" "Google로 계속하기", "Copied." "복사되었습니다.", "Copy" "복사", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "지금 토큰을 복사하여 저장하세요. 이 화면을 나가면 다시 표시되지 않습니다.", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "로그인 상태를 확인할 수 없습니다. 새로고침하세요.", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "생성할 수 없습니다. 새로고침 후 다시 시도하세요.", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "발급할 수 없습니다. 새로고침 후 다시 시도하세요.", "Could not load." "불러올 수 없습니다.", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "Stripe에 연결할 수 없습니다. 잠시 후 다시 시도해 주세요. 문제가 계속되면 support@kotoba.cloud로 문의하세요.", "Could not read linked accounts." "연동된 계정을 불러올 수 없습니다.", "Could not remove." "삭제할 수 없습니다.", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "취소할 수 없습니다. 새로고침 후 다시 시도하세요.", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "시작할 수 없습니다. 새로고침 후 다시 시도하세요.", "Could not unlink." "연동을 해제할 수 없습니다.", "Create an organization first." "먼저 조직을 생성하세요.", "Create organization" "조직 생성", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "Stripe 확인 세션을 생성하는 중…", "Creating the organization…" "조직을 생성하는 중…", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "문서 확인(Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com)을 추가할 수 있습니다. 카드 정보와 문서는 Stripe에만 전송되며, kotoba.cloud는 상태, 만료일, 증빙 참조만 보관합니다. 확인은 365일 후 만료됩니다.", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "각 스코프는 연구 근거별로 승인됩니다. 만료되었거나 정지된 스코프로는 추론을 실행할 수 없습니다.", "Eligible" "이용 가능", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "이용 가능합니다. 무료 할당량을 사용할 수 있습니다.", "Email domains" "이메일 도메인", "Environment variables" "환경 변수", "Free allowance" "무료 할당량", "Go to billing" "결제로 이동", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "이 환경에서는 Google / GitHub 연동이 아직 활성화되지 않았습니다.", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "Google / GitHub는 계정 식별에만 사용됩니다. 로그인 자체는 패스키 또는 지갑으로 이루어지며 비밀번호는 사용하지 않습니다.", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "가드레일, 방화벽, 컴플라이언스 규칙과 버전은 보안 제어에서 확인할 수 있습니다.", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "핸들은 com-<name>.kotoba.cloud 형식이어야 합니다.", "How verification works" "본인 확인 방법", "IdP assertion confirmed" "IdP 인증 확인됨", "IdP assertion required" "IdP 인증 필요", "IdP re-assertion required" "IdP 재인증 필요", "Identity verification" "본인 확인", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "본인 확인이 만료되었습니다. 다시 확인해 주세요.", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "본인 확인이 완료되지 않았습니다. 위의 「本人確認」에서 시작하세요.", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "초대된 멤버는 API 토큰, 스코프, 결제 정보를 공유합니다. 역할은 owner / admin / member / billing입니다.", "Issue a connection token" "연결 토큰 발급", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "로컬 CLI / IDE 에이전트용 연결 토큰을 발급합니다. 한 번만 표시됩니다.", "Issue it from this page." "이 페이지에서 발급하세요.", "Issued tokens" "발급된 토큰", "Link GitHub" "GitHub 연동", "Link Google" "Google 연동", "Linked accounts" "연동된 계정", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "Google 또는 GitHub 계정을 연동하면 다음번에 \"Google로 계속하기\"에서 이 계정의 패스키를 제안받을 수 있습니다. 연동된 계정은 계정을 식별하는 용도이며 로그인 수단이 아닙니다.", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "Claude Code와 같은 MCP 지원 에이전트는 ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "조직을 생성하면 멤버 초대를 사용할 수 있습니다.", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "멤버는 조직의 ID 공급자(OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta 등)로 관리됩니다. IdP에서 제거된 멤버는 다음 재인증 시점에 조직 액세스 권한을 잃습니다.", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "아직 승인된 스코프가 없습니다. 연구자 등록 후 신청하세요.", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "현재 유효한 신뢰 경로가 없습니다. 본인 확인을 다시 시작하세요.", "No linked accounts." "연동된 계정이 없습니다.", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "아직 소속된 조직이 없습니다. 핸들을 입력하여 생성하세요.", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "아직 팀이 없습니다. 조직을 생성하면 owner 역할이 부여되며, 멤버를 초대할 수 있습니다.", "No tokens issued" "발급된 토큰이 없습니다", "Not signed in." "로그인하지 않았습니다.", "Not verified" "미확인", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "owner 또는 admin만 설정할 수 있습니다.", "Open security controls" "보안 관리 열기", "Open the guide" "가이드 열기", "Organization" "조직", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "조직 SSO (Team / Enterprise)", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "이 환경에서는 아직 조직 SSO가 활성화되지 않았습니다.", "Organization handle" "조직 핸들", "Organizations and teams" "조직 및 팀", "Pending" "확인 중", "Policy re-acceptance required." "이용 정책 재동의가 필요합니다.", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "선불카드 및 가상카드는 본인 확인에 사용할 수 없습니다. 일반 신용카드 또는 체크카드를 등록해 주세요.", "Principal" "프린시펄", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "저장된 principal과 일치하지 않습니다. 지원팀에 문의하세요.", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "재인증 간격(시간)", "Refresh" "상태 새로고침", "Remove SSO" "SSO 삭제", "Removed." "삭제되었습니다.", "Require IdP authentication" "IdP 인증 필수화", "Research access" "연구 환경 이용", "Revoke" "폐기", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "등록 이전에 발급된 모든 토큰 폐기", "Role mapping (group=role)" "역할 매핑 (group=role)", "Save SSO" "SSO 저장", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "저장되었습니다. 이제 멤버는 '조직의 IdP로 인증'을 통해 인증할 수 있습니다.", "Security controls" "보안 관리", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "세션 재확인이 필요합니다. 이 페이지를 새로고침하세요.", "Sign in" "로그인", "Sign in again before unlinking." "연결을 해제하려면 다시 로그인한 후 진행해 주세요.", "Sign in first." "먼저 로그인하세요.", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "로그인하면 본인 확인, 연구 환경 이용, 조직, 결제, 연결 토큰을 여기에서 관리할 수 있습니다.", "Start verification" "본인 확인 시작", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "시작하면 Stripe 확인 화면으로 이동합니다(등록된 카드가 없으면 checkout.stripe.com에서 카드 등록, 서류 확인은 verify.stripe.com에서 진행).", "Status" "확인 상태", "Team" "팀", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "이 Google/GitHub 계정은 이미 다른 Kotoba 계정에 연결되어 있습니다.", "That handle is already taken." "이미 사용 중인 핸들입니다.", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "IdP는 로그인 수단이 아닙니다. 멤버는 먼저 패스키나 지갑으로 로그인한 다음, 조직의 IdP로 인증하여 멤버십을 획득합니다. 역할은 admin / member / billing 중 하나이며, owner는 IdP로 부여되지 않습니다.", "The organization service is not connected yet." "조직 서비스가 아직 연결되지 않았습니다.", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "프린시펄은 kotoba.cloud가 사용자를 식별하는 안정적인 ID입니다. 패스키나 지갑을 교체해도 변경되지 않습니다.", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "본인 확인된 무료 연구 할당량은 과금되지 않습니다. 유료 용량 구매는 자동 충전 없이 진행됩니다.", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "토큰 발급이 아직 활성화되지 않았습니다. 나중에 다시 시도해 주세요.", "Unavailable" "확인 불가", "Under review or additional checks required." "검토 중이거나 추가 확인이 필요합니다.", "Unlink" "연동 해제", "Unlinked." "연동을 해제했습니다.", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "연동을 해제해도 패스키·지갑 로그인에는 영향을 주지 않습니다.", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "CLI / IDE에서 사용", "Use from an agent" "에이전트에서 사용", "Username" "사용자 이름", "Verification is complete." "본인 확인이 완료되었습니다.", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "본인 확인 서비스를 일시적으로 사용할 수 없습니다. 나중에 다시 시도해 주세요.", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "본인 확인 서비스에 연결할 수 없습니다. 나중에 새로고침해 주세요.", "Verified" "확인됨", "What is a linked account?" "연동 계정이란?", "What is a principal?" "프린시펄이란?", "What is a scope?" "스코프란?", "What is organization SSO?" "조직 SSO란?", "asserted" "인증됨", "enforced" "필수", "not required" "인증 선택", "optional" "선택", "revoked " "취소됨 "}, :mr {" and " " आणि ", "(no label)" "(लेबल नाही)", ". The full guide is at " ". पूर्ण मार्गदर्शिका येथे आहे ", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." ". टोकन वरील यादीतून एका-एकाने रद्द केले जातात; त्या क्षणापासून API 401 token-revoked असे उत्तर देते.", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "Team किंवा Enterprise प्लॅन आवश्यक आहे.", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "AML/CTF स्क्रीनिंगची वेळ संपली आहे. पुनरावलोकन आवश्यक आहे.", "About charges" "शुल्काबद्दल", "Account" "खाते", "Add or resume card" "कार्ड जोडा किंवा सुरू ठेवा", "All legacy tokens revoked." "सर्व जुने टोकन रद्द केले आहेत.", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "संस्था did:webvh DID म्हणून जारी केली जाते; सदस्यत्व व्हेरिफायेबल क्रेडेन्शियल्स (VC) द्वारे व्यवस्थापित केले जाते. निर्मात्याला owner भूमिका मिळते.", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "Stripe ची पडताळणी पूर्ण झाल्यावर मंजुरी स्वयंचलितपणे होते. बदल पाहण्यासाठी हे पेज रिफ्रेश करा. कार्ड नोंदणी मध्येच सोडली असल्यास, खाली पुन्हा सुरू करा.", "Approved scopes" "मंजूर स्कोप", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "संस्थेच्या IdP सह प्रमाणीकरण करा", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "Team / Enterprise प्लॅनवरील संस्थांसाठी उपलब्ध. SAML अद्याप समर्थित नाही.", "Billing and credits" "बिलिंग आणि क्रेडिट्स", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "बिलिंग सत्यापित होत आहे. अद्याप खरेदी उपलब्ध नाही.", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "बिलिंगसाठी जुळवणी आवश्यक आहे. सपोर्टशी संपर्क करा.", "Billing service unavailable." "बिलिंग सेवा उपलब्ध नाही.", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "कार्ड नोंदणी रद्द केली गेली. खाली पुन्हा सुरू करा.", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "कार्ड प्राप्त झाले. Stripe च्या सूचनेनंतर मंजुरी मिळते, सहसा काही सेकंदांत. पुन्हा तपासण्यासाठी 状態を更新 वापरा.", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "कार्ड पडताळणी: पूर्ण करण्यासाठी क्रेडिट किंवा डेबिट कार्ड नोंदवा (checkout.stripe.com). प्रीपेड आणि व्हर्च्युअल कार्ड स्वीकारली जात नाहीत.", "Checking sign-in state…" "साइन-इन स्थिती तपासत आहे…", "Checking the identity provider…" "ओळख पुरवठादार (IdP) तपासत आहे…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "तुमची साइन-इन स्थिती तपासत आहे…", "Configured" "कॉन्फिगर केलेले", "Connection token (shown once)" "कनेक्शन टोकन (एकदाच दाखवले जाते)", "Continue with GitHub" "GitHub सह सुरू ठेवा", "Continue with Google" "Google सह सुरू ठेवा", "Copied." "कॉपी केले.", "Copy" "कॉपी करा", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "आता टोकन कॉपी करून साठवा. ते पुन्हा कधीही दाखवले जाणार नाही.", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "साइन-इन स्थिती तपासता आली नाही. रिफ्रेश करा.", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "तयार करता आले नाही. रिफ्रेश करून पुन्हा प्रयत्न करा.", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "जारी करता आले नाही. रिफ्रेश करून पुन्हा प्रयत्न करा.", "Could not load." "लोड करता आले नाही.", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "Stripe शी संपर्क होऊ शकला नाही. नंतर पुन्हा प्रयत्न करा; समस्या कायम राहिल्यास support@kotoba.cloud शी संपर्क करा.", "Could not read linked accounts." "लिंक केलेली खाती वाचता आली नाहीत.", "Could not remove." "काढता आले नाही.", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "रद्द करता आले नाही. रिफ्रेश करून पुन्हा प्रयत्न करा.", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "सुरू करता आले नाही. रिफ्रेश करून पुन्हा प्रयत्न करा.", "Could not unlink." "लिंक काढता आली नाही.", "Create an organization first." "आधी संस्था तयार करा.", "Create organization" "संस्था तयार करा", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "Stripe पडताळणी सत्र तयार केले जात आहे…", "Creating the organization…" "संस्था तयार केली जात आहे…", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "दस्तऐवज पडताळणी (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) जोडता येते. कार्ड तपशील आणि दस्तऐवज फक्त Stripe कडे जातात; kotoba.cloud केवळ स्थिती, वैधता कालावधी आणि पुरावा संदर्भ ठेवते. पडताळणी 365 दिवसांनंतर कालबाह्य होते.", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "प्रत्येक स्कोप संशोधनासाठी स्वतंत्रपणे मंजूर केला जातो. कालबाह्य किंवा स्थगित स्कोपमधून इन्फरन्स चालवता येत नाही.", "Eligible" "पात्र", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "पात्र. तुमची मोफत मर्यादा उपलब्ध आहे.", "Email domains" "ईमेल डोमेन", "Environment variables" "वातावरण चल", "Free allowance" "मोफत मर्यादा", "Go to billing" "बिलिंगकडे जा", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "या वातावरणात Google / GitHub लिंकिंग अद्याप सक्षम केलेले नाही.", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "Google / GitHub केवळ खाते ओळखण्यासाठी वापरले जातात. साइन इनसाठी पासकी किंवा वॉलेट वापरले जाते — पासवर्ड कधीही नाही.", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "गार्डरेल, फायरवॉल आणि कंप्लायन्स नियम आणि त्यांच्या आवृत्त्या सुरक्षा नियंत्रणे अंतर्गत दाखवल्या जातात.", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "हँडल com-<name>.kotoba.cloud या स्वरूपात असणे आवश्यक आहे.", "How verification works" "पडताळणी कशी कार्य करते", "IdP assertion confirmed" "IdP प्रमाणीकरण पुष्टी झाले", "IdP assertion required" "IdP प्रमाणीकरण आवश्यक", "IdP re-assertion required" "IdP पुन्हा-प्रमाणीकरण आवश्यक", "Identity verification" "ओळख पडताळणी", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "ओळख पडताळणीची वैधता संपली आहे. पुन्हा पडताळणी करा.", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "ओळख पडताळणी अपूर्ण आहे. वरील 本人確認 मधून सुरू करा.", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "आमंत्रित सदस्य API टोकन्स, स्कोप आणि बिलिंग सामायिक करतात. भूमिका owner / admin / member / billing आहेत.", "Issue a connection token" "कनेक्शन टोकन जारी करा", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "स्थानिक CLI / IDE एजंटसाठी कनेक्शन टोकन जारी करा. ते फक्त एकदाच दाखवले जाते.", "Issue it from this page." "याच पानावरून ते जारी करा.", "Issued tokens" "जारी केलेली टोकन्स", "Link GitHub" "GitHub लिंक करा", "Link Google" "Google लिंक करा", "Linked accounts" "लिंक केलेली खाती", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "Google किंवा GitHub खाते लिंक केल्यास पुढच्या वेळी \"Google सह सुरू ठेवा\" या खात्याची पासकी सुचवेल. लिंक केलेले खाते हे केवळ खात्याचे नाव आहे; ते साइन इन करण्याचा मार्ग नाही.", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "Claude Code सारखे MCP-सक्षम एजंट वाचतात ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "संस्था तयार झाल्यावर सदस्य आमंत्रणे उपलब्ध होतात.", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "सदस्यांचे व्यवस्थापन संस्थेच्या ओळख प्रदात्याद्वारे (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta आणि इतर) केले जाते. IdP मधून काढलेला सदस्य पुढील पुन्हा-प्रमाणीकरण अंतराळात संस्थेचा प्रवेश गमावतो.", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "अद्याप कोणतेही मंजूर स्कोप नाहीत. संशोधक नोंदणीनंतर अर्ज करा.", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "कोणताही वैध ट्रस्ट मार्ग नाही. पडताळणी पुन्हा सुरू करा.", "No linked accounts." "लिंक केलेली कोणतीही खाती नाहीत.", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "अद्याप कोणतीही संस्था नाही. एक तयार करण्यासाठी हँडल प्रविष्ट करा.", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "अद्याप कोणतीही टीम नाही. owner बनण्यासाठी आणि सदस्यांना आमंत्रित करण्यासाठी एक संस्था तयार करा.", "No tokens issued" "कोणतेही टोकन जारी केलेले नाहीत", "Not signed in." "साइन इन केलेले नाही.", "Not verified" "पडताळणी झालेली नाही", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "फक्त owner किंवा admin हे कॉन्फिगर करू शकतो.", "Open security controls" "सुरक्षा नियंत्रणे उघडा", "Open the guide" "मार्गदर्शक उघडा", "Organization" "संस्था", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "संस्था SSO (Team / Enterprise)", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "या वातावरणात संस्था SSO अद्याप सक्षम केलेले नाही.", "Organization handle" "संस्था हँडल", "Organizations and teams" "संस्था आणि टीम्स", "Pending" "प्रलंबित", "Policy re-acceptance required." "धोरण पुन्हा स्वीकारणे आवश्यक आहे.", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "प्रीपेड आणि व्हर्च्युअल कार्ड्सचा वापर पडताळणीसाठी करता येत नाही. नियमित क्रेडिट किंवा डेबिट कार्ड जोडा.", "Principal" "प्रिन्सिपल", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "प्रिन्सिपल जुळत नाही. सपोर्टशी संपर्क करा.", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "पुन्हा-ऑथेंटिकेशन अंतराल (तास)", "Refresh" "रिफ्रेश करा", "Remove SSO" "SSO काढा", "Removed." "काढले.", "Require IdP authentication" "IdP ऑथेंटिकेशन आवश्यक करा", "Research access" "संशोधन प्रवेश", "Revoke" "रद्द करा", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "नोंदणीपूर्वी जारी केलेले सर्व टोकन रद्द करा", "Role mapping (group=role)" "रोल मॅपिंग (group=role)", "Save SSO" "SSO जतन करा", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "जतन केले. सदस्य आता संस्थेच्या IdP सह ऑथेंटिकेट करू शकतात.", "Security controls" "सुरक्षा नियंत्रणे", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "सेशन पुन्हा-पडताळणी आवश्यक आहे. हे पेज रीलोड करा.", "Sign in" "साइन इन करा", "Sign in again before unlinking." "लिंक काढण्यापूर्वी पुन्हा साइन इन करा.", "Sign in first." "आधी साइन इन करा.", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "ओळख पडताळणी, संशोधन प्रवेश, संस्था, बिलिंग आणि कनेक्शन टोकन येथे व्यवस्थापित करण्यासाठी साइन इन करा.", "Start verification" "पडताळणी सुरू करा", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "सुरू केल्यास आपल्याला Stripe तपासणीकडे नेले जाईल (कार्ड नोंदणी नसल्यास checkout.stripe.com येथे कार्ड सेटअप, कागदपत्रे verify.stripe.com येथे).", "Status" "स्थिती", "Team" "टीम", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "ते Google/GitHub खाते आधीच दुसऱ्या Kotoba खात्याशी लिंक केलेले आहे.", "That handle is already taken." "हे हँडल आधीच वापरले गेले आहे.", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "IdP हे साइन इन करण्याचे साधन नाही. सदस्य आधी पासकी किंवा वॉलेटने साइन इन करतात, त्यानंतर सदस्यत्व मिळवण्यासाठी संस्थेच्या IdP सह ऑथेंटिकेट करतात. भूमिका admin / member / billing असतात; owner ही भूमिका IdP कडून कधीही दिली जात नाही.", "The organization service is not connected yet." "संस्था सेवा अद्याप जोडलेली नाही.", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "प्रिन्सिपल हा एक स्थिर आयडेंटिफायर आहे ज्याने kotoba.cloud तुम्हाला ओळखते. पासकी किंवा वॉलेट बदलल्यास तो बदलत नाही.", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "पडताळणी झालेल्या मोफत रिसर्च अलाउन्ससाठी कधीही शुल्क घेतले जात नाही. पेड कॅपॅसिटी ऑटोमॅटिक टॉप-अपशिवाय विकत घेतली जाते.", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "टोकन जारी करणे अद्याप सक्षम केलेले नाही. नंतर पुन्हा प्रयत्न करा.", "Unavailable" "अनुपलब्ध", "Under review or additional checks required." "पुनरावलोकन सुरू आहे किंवा अतिरिक्त पडताळणी आवश्यक आहे.", "Unlink" "लिंक काढा", "Unlinked." "लिंक काढली.", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "लिंक काढल्याने पासकी किंवा वॉलेटने साइन इन करण्यावर परिणाम होत नाही.", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "CLI / IDE वरून वापर", "Use from an agent" "एजंटवरून वापर", "Username" "युजरनेम", "Verification is complete." "पडताळणी पूर्ण झाली आहे.", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "पडताळणी सेवा तात्पुरती अनुपलब्ध आहे. नंतर पुन्हा प्रयत्न करा.", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "पडताळणी सेवा अनुपलब्ध आहे. नंतर रिफ्रेश करा.", "Verified" "पडताळणी झाली", "What is a linked account?" "लिंक केलेले खाते म्हणजे काय?", "What is a principal?" "प्रिन्सिपल म्हणजे काय?", "What is a scope?" "स्कोप म्हणजे काय?", "What is organization SSO?" "संस्था SSO म्हणजे काय?", "asserted" "अ‍ॅसर्टेड", "enforced" "अनिवार्य", "not required" "आवश्यक नाही", "optional" "पर्यायी", "revoked " "रद्द केले "}, :pcm {" and " " and ", "(no label)" "(no label)", ". The full guide is at " ". Full guide dey ", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." ". Dem dey revoke tokens one by one from the list wey dey up; from that moment the API go answer 401 token-revoked.", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "You need Team or Enterprise plan.", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "AML/CTF screening don expire. Dem need do the review again.", "About charges" "About charges", "Account" "Account", "Add or resume card" "Add or continue card", "All legacy tokens revoked." "All old tokens don revoke finish.", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "Dem go issue organization as did:webvh DID; membership dey managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The person wey create am go get owner role.", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "Approval go happen automatic once Stripe finish. Refresh this page make you see the change. If you stop the card entry for road, continue am below.", "Approved scopes" "Approved scopes", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "Authenticate with the organization IdP", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "Dis one dey available for organizations wey dey on Team / Enterprise plans. SAML no dey supported yet.", "Billing and credits" "Billing and credits", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "Billing dey for validation. E never ready make you buy anything yet.", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "Billing need reconciliation. Contact support.", "Billing service unavailable." "Billing service no dey available.", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "Dem cancel the card entry. Continue am below.", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "We don receive card. Approval go follow Stripe notification, e dey usually take small seconds. Use 状態を更新 make you check again.", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "Card verification: register credit or debit card make you complete am (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards no dey accepted.", "Checking sign-in state…" "We dey check sign-in state…", "Checking the identity provider…" "We dey check the identity provider (IdP)…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "We dey check your sign-in status…", "Configured" "E don configure", "Connection token (shown once)" "Connection token (dem go show am once)", "Continue with GitHub" "Continue with GitHub", "Continue with Google" "Continue with Google", "Copied." "E don copy.", "Copy" "Copy", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "Copy the token, keep am well now. Dem no go show am again.", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "E no fit check the sign-in state. Refresh.", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "E no fit create. Refresh, then try again.", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "E no fit issue am. Refresh, then try again.", "Could not load." "E no fit load.", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "E no fit reach Stripe. Try again later; if e still dey happen, contact support@kotoba.cloud.", "Could not read linked accounts." "E no fit read linked accounts.", "Could not remove." "E no fit remove am.", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "E no fit revoke am. Refresh, then try again.", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "No fit start. Refresh, then try again.", "Could not unlink." "No fit unlink.", "Create an organization first." "First create organization.", "Create organization" "Create organization", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "We dey create Stripe verification session…", "Creating the organization…" "We dey create di organization…", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "You fit add document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com). Card details and documents dey go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud dey keep di status, di expiry and evidence reference. Verification go expire after 365 days.", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "Dem dey approve every scope on im own ground for research. Scope wey expire or wey dem suspend no fit run inference.", "Eligible" "Eligible", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "You dey eligible. Your free allowance dey available.", "Email domains" "Email domains", "Environment variables" "Environment variables", "Free allowance" "Free allowance", "Go to billing" "Go to billing", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "Google / GitHub linking never enable for dis environment yet.", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "Google / GitHub na just to identify di account. To sign in, e dey use passkey or wallet — password no dey involved at all.", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules with dia versions dey show under Security controls.", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud.", "How verification works" "How verification dey work", "IdP assertion confirmed" "IdP assertion confirm", "IdP assertion required" "IdP assertion dey required", "IdP re-assertion required" "IdP re-assertion dey required", "Identity verification" "Identity verification", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "Identity verification expire. Verify again.", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "Identity verification never complete. Start am for 本人確認 wey dey up.", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "Members wey you invite go share API tokens, scopes and billing. Di roles na owner / admin / member / billing.", "Issue a connection token" "Issue connection token", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "Issue connection token for local CLI / IDE agent. Dem go show am once.", "Issue it from this page." "Issue am from dis page.", "Issued tokens" "Issued tokens", "Link GitHub" "Link GitHub", "Link Google" "Link Google", "Linked accounts" "Linked accounts", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "If you link Google or GitHub account, e go make \"Continue with Google\" offer dis account passkey next time. Linked account na just name for the account; e no be way to sign in.", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "MCP-capable agent like Claude Code dey read ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "Member invitations go open once organization dey exist.", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "Di organization identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others) dey manage members. If dem remove member from IdP, di member go lose organization access di next time re-authentication dey run.", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "No approved scope yet. Apply after you register as researcher.", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "No current trust route. Restart di verification.", "No linked accounts." "No linked account.", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "No organization dey yet. Enter handle to create one.", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "No team dey yet. Create organization make you become owner and invite members.", "No tokens issued" "No token wey dem issue", "Not signed in." "You never sign in.", "Not verified" "No dey verify", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "Na only owner or admin fit configure dis one.", "Open security controls" "Open security controls", "Open the guide" "Open di guide", "Organization" "Organization", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "Organization SSO never dey enabled for dis environment yet.", "Organization handle" "Organization handle", "Organizations and teams" "Organizations and teams", "Pending" "Dey pending", "Policy re-acceptance required." "You need agree to di policy again.", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "Prepaid card and virtual card no fit use for verification. Add normal credit or debit card.", "Principal" "Principal", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "Principal no match. Contact support.", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "Re-authentication interval (hours)", "Refresh" "Refresh", "Remove SSO" "Remove SSO", "Removed." "We don remove am.", "Require IdP authentication" "Make IdP authentication compulsory", "Research access" "Research access", "Revoke" "Revoke", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "Revoke every token wey dem issue before di registry", "Role mapping (group=role)" "Role mapping (group=role)", "Save SSO" "Save SSO", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "We don save am. Members fit now use 'authenticate with organization IdP' verify demsef.", "Security controls" "Security controls", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "Dem need reverify di session. Reload dis page.", "Sign in" "Sign in", "Sign in again before unlinking." "Sign in again before you unlink.", "Sign in first." "Sign in first.", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "Sign in make you fit manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens for here.", "Start verification" "Start verification", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "If you start, dem go carry you go Stripe check (card setup for checkout.stripe.com if no card dey on file, documents for verify.stripe.com).", "Status" "Status", "Team" "Team", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "Dat Google/GitHub account don already link to another Kotoba account.", "That handle is already taken." "Dat handle dem don already take am.", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "IdP no be way to sign in. Members go first sign in with passkey or wallet, before dem authenticate with the organization IdP to get membership. Roles na admin / member / billing; owner no dey ever come from IdP.", "The organization service is not connected yet." "Organization service never connect yet.", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "Principal na the stable identifier wey kotoba.cloud dey use know you. E no go change even if you change your passkey or wallet.", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "Dem no dey charge the free research allowance wey don verify. Paid capacity na to buy am, no automatic top-up.", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "Token issuance never dey enabled. Try again later.", "Unavailable" "No dey available", "Under review or additional checks required." "Dem still dey review am, or dem need additional check.", "Unlink" "Unlink", "Unlinked." "Don unlink.", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "If you unlink am, e no go affect how you dey sign in with passkey or wallet.", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "Use am from CLI / IDE", "Use from an agent" "Use am from agent", "Username" "Username", "Verification is complete." "Verification don complete.", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "Verification no dey available now. Try again later.", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "Verification service no dey available. Refresh later.", "Verified" "Don verify", "What is a linked account?" "Wetin be linked account?", "What is a principal?" "Wetin be principal?", "What is a scope?" "Wetin be scope?", "What is organization SSO?" "Wetin be organization SSO?", "asserted" "don confirm", "enforced" "must dey", "not required" "no need am", "optional" "no compulsory", "revoked " "don revoke "}, :pt {" and " " e ", "(no label)" "(sem rótulo)", ". The full guide is at " ". O guia completo está em ", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." ". Os tokens são revogados um a um a partir da lista acima; a partir desse momento, a API responde 401 token-revoked.", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "É necessário um plano Team ou Enterprise.", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "A verificação de AML/CTF expirou. É necessária uma nova análise.", "About charges" "Sobre cobranças", "Account" "Conta", "Add or resume card" "Adicionar ou retomar cartão", "All legacy tokens revoked." "Todos os tokens legados foram revogados.", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "Uma organização é emitida como um DID did:webvh; a associação é gerenciada com credenciais verificáveis (VC). O criador recebe a função de owner.", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "A aprovação ocorre automaticamente quando o Stripe conclui o processo. Atualize esta página para ver a mudança. Se você interrompeu o cadastro do cartão no meio do processo, retome abaixo.", "Approved scopes" "Escopos aprovados", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "Autenticar com o IdP da organização", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "Disponível para organizações nos planos Team / Enterprise. O SAML ainda não é suportado.", "Billing and credits" "Cobrança e créditos", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "A cobrança está em validação. As compras ainda não estão disponíveis.", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "A cobrança precisa de reconciliação. Contate o suporte.", "Billing service unavailable." "Serviço de cobrança indisponível.", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "O cadastro do cartão foi cancelado. Retome abaixo.", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "Cartão recebido. A aprovação segue a notificação do Stripe, geralmente em segundos. Use 状態を更新 para verificar novamente.", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "Verificação de cartão: registre um cartão de crédito ou débito para concluir (checkout.stripe.com). Cartões pré-pagos e virtuais não são aceitos.", "Checking sign-in state…" "Verificando o estado de login…", "Checking the identity provider…" "Verificando o provedor de identidade…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "Verificando o estado de login…", "Configured" "Configurado", "Connection token (shown once)" "Token de conexão (exibido uma vez)", "Continue with GitHub" "Continuar com o GitHub", "Continue with Google" "Continuar com o Google", "Copied." "Copiado.", "Copy" "Copiar", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "Copie e guarde o token agora. Ele nunca será exibido novamente.", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "Não foi possível verificar o estado de login. Atualize a página.", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "Não foi possível criar. Atualize e tente novamente.", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "Não foi possível emitir. Atualize e tente novamente.", "Could not load." "Não foi possível carregar.", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "Não foi possível conectar-se ao Stripe. Tente novamente mais tarde; se persistir, contate support@kotoba.cloud.", "Could not read linked accounts." "Não foi possível ler as contas vinculadas.", "Could not remove." "Não foi possível remover.", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "Não foi possível revogar. Atualize e tente novamente.", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "Não foi possível iniciar. Atualize e tente novamente.", "Could not unlink." "Não foi possível desvincular.", "Create an organization first." "Crie uma organização primeiro.", "Create organization" "Criar organização", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "Criando a sessão de verificação do Stripe…", "Creating the organization…" "Criando a organização…", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "A verificação de documentos (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) pode ser adicionada. Os dados do cartão e os documentos vão somente para o Stripe; a kotoba.cloud mantém apenas o status, a validade e uma referência de evidência. A verificação expira após 365 dias.", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "Cada escopo é aprovado com base em seu próprio fundamento de pesquisa. Um escopo expirado ou suspenso não pode executar inferência.", "Eligible" "Elegível", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "Elegível. Sua cota gratuita está disponível.", "Email domains" "Domínios de e-mail", "Environment variables" "Variáveis de ambiente", "Free allowance" "Cota gratuita", "Go to billing" "Ir para faturamento", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "A vinculação do Google / GitHub ainda não está habilitada neste ambiente.", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "O Google / GitHub apenas identifica a conta. O login em si usa uma passkey ou uma carteira digital — nunca uma senha.", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "As regras de guardrail, firewall e conformidade, junto com suas versões, são exibidas em Controles de segurança.", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "O identificador deve ter o formato com-<nome>.kotoba.cloud.", "How verification works" "Como funciona a verificação", "IdP assertion confirmed" "Asserção do IdP confirmada", "IdP assertion required" "Asserção do IdP necessária", "IdP re-assertion required" "Reasserção do IdP necessária", "Identity verification" "Verificação de identidade", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "A verificação de identidade expirou. Verifique novamente.", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "A verificação de identidade está incompleta. Inicie-a em Verificação de identidade, acima.", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "Os membros convidados compartilham tokens de API, escopos e faturamento. As funções são owner / admin / member / billing.", "Issue a connection token" "Emitir um token de conexão", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "Emita um token de conexão para um agente local de CLI / IDE. Ele é exibido apenas uma vez.", "Issue it from this page." "Emita-o nesta página.", "Issued tokens" "Tokens emitidos", "Link GitHub" "Vincular GitHub", "Link Google" "Vincular Google", "Linked accounts" "Contas vinculadas", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "Vincular uma conta do Google ou do GitHub permite que \"Continuar com o Google\" ofereça a passkey desta conta na próxima vez. Uma conta vinculada apenas identifica a conta; não é uma forma de entrar.", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "Agentes compatíveis com MCP, como o Claude Code, leem ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "Os convites de membros ficam disponíveis após a criação de uma organização.", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "Os membros são gerenciados pelo provedor de identidade da organização (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta e outros). Um membro removido do IdP perde o acesso à organização no próximo intervalo de reautenticação.", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "Ainda não há escopos aprovados. Solicite após o registro como pesquisador.", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "Não há rota de confiança atual. Reinicie a verificação.", "No linked accounts." "Nenhuma conta vinculada.", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "Ainda não há organizações. Digite um identificador para criar uma.", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "Ainda não há equipe. Crie uma organização para se tornar owner e convidar membros.", "No tokens issued" "Nenhum token emitido", "Not signed in." "Não está conectado.", "Not verified" "Não verificado", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "Somente um owner ou admin pode configurar isso.", "Open security controls" "Abrir controles de segurança", "Open the guide" "Abrir o guia", "Organization" "Organização", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "SSO da organização (Team / Enterprise)", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "O SSO da organização ainda não está habilitado neste ambiente.", "Organization handle" "Identificador da organização", "Organizations and teams" "Organizações e equipes", "Pending" "Pendente", "Policy re-acceptance required." "É necessário reaceitar a política.", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "Cartões pré-pagos e virtuais não podem ser usados para verificação. Adicione um cartão de crédito ou débito comum.", "Principal" "Principal", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "Incompatibilidade de principal. Contate o suporte.", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "Intervalo de reautenticação (horas)", "Refresh" "Atualizar", "Remove SSO" "Remover SSO", "Removed." "Removido.", "Require IdP authentication" "Exigir autenticação via IdP", "Research access" "Acesso à pesquisa", "Revoke" "Revogar", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "Revogar todos os tokens emitidos antes do registro", "Role mapping (group=role)" "Mapeamento de função (group=role)", "Save SSO" "Salvar SSO", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "Salvo. Os membros já podem autenticar-se com o IdP da organização.", "Security controls" "Controles de segurança", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "É necessário reverificar a sessão. Recarregue esta página.", "Sign in" "Entrar", "Sign in again before unlinking." "Entre novamente antes de desvincular.", "Sign in first." "Entre primeiro.", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "Entre para gerenciar verificação de identidade, acesso à pesquisa, organizações, cobrança e tokens de conexão aqui.", "Start verification" "Iniciar verificação", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "Ao iniciar, você será direcionado para a verificação do Stripe (configuração de cartão em checkout.stripe.com quando não houver cartão registrado, documentos em verify.stripe.com).", "Status" "Status", "Team" "Equipe", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "Essa conta do Google/GitHub já está vinculada a outra conta Kotoba.", "That handle is already taken." "Esse identificador já está em uso.", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "O IdP não é uma forma de login. Os membros primeiro fazem login com uma passkey ou uma carteira e, em seguida, autenticam-se com o IdP da organização para obter a associação. As funções são admin / member / billing; owner nunca é concedido por um IdP.", "The organization service is not connected yet." "O serviço da organização ainda não está conectado.", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "O principal é o identificador estável pelo qual o kotoba.cloud reconhece você. Ele não muda quando você substitui uma passkey ou uma carteira.", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "A cota gratuita de pesquisa verificada nunca é cobrada. A capacidade paga é comprada sem recarga automática.", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "A emissão de tokens ainda não está habilitada. Tente novamente mais tarde.", "Unavailable" "Indisponível", "Under review or additional checks required." "Em análise ou verificações adicionais necessárias.", "Unlink" "Desvincular", "Unlinked." "Desvinculado.", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "Desvincular não afeta o login com uma passkey ou uma carteira.", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "Usar a partir de um CLI / IDE", "Use from an agent" "Usar a partir de um agente", "Username" "Nome de usuário", "Verification is complete." "A verificação está completa.", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "A verificação está temporariamente indisponível. Tente novamente mais tarde.", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "O serviço de verificação está indisponível. Atualize mais tarde.", "Verified" "Verificado", "What is a linked account?" "O que é uma conta vinculada?", "What is a principal?" "O que é um principal?", "What is a scope?" "O que é um escopo?", "What is organization SSO?" "O que é SSO da organização?", "asserted" "atestado", "enforced" "obrigatório", "not required" "não obrigatório", "optional" "opcional", "revoked " "revogado "}, :ru {" and " " и ", "(no label)" "(без метки)", ". The full guide is at " ". Полное руководство доступно по адресу ", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." ". Токены отзываются по одному из списка выше; с этого момента API отвечает 401 token-revoked.", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "Требуется тариф Team или Enterprise.", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "Срок действия AML/CTF-проверки истёк. Требуется повторная проверка.", "About charges" "О списаниях", "Account" "Аккаунт", "Add or resume card" "Добавить или продолжить регистрацию карты", "All legacy tokens revoked." "Все прежние токены отозваны.", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "Организация выпускается как DID did:webvh; членство управляется с помощью верифицируемых учётных данных (VC). Создатель получает роль owner.", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "Подтверждение происходит автоматически после завершения проверки в Stripe. Обновите страницу, чтобы увидеть изменения. Если вы прервали добавление карты, продолжите ниже.", "Approved scopes" "Утверждённые области доступа", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "Пройти аутентификацию через IdP организации", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "Доступно организациям на тарифах Team / Enterprise. SAML пока не поддерживается.", "Billing and credits" "Биллинг и кредиты", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "Биллинг проходит проверку. Покупки пока недоступны.", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "Требуется сверка биллинга. Обратитесь в поддержку.", "Billing service unavailable." "Сервис биллинга недоступен.", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "Добавление карты было отменено. Продолжите ниже.", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "Карта получена. Подтверждение придёт после уведомления от Stripe, обычно в течение нескольких секунд. Используйте «Обновить статус», чтобы проверить ещё раз.", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "Проверка карты: чтобы завершить её, зарегистрируйте кредитную или дебетовую карту (checkout.stripe.com). Предоплаченные и виртуальные карты не принимаются.", "Checking sign-in state…" "Проверка статуса входа…", "Checking the identity provider…" "Проверка провайдера идентификации…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "Проверка статуса входа…", "Configured" "Настроено", "Connection token (shown once)" "Токен подключения (показывается один раз)", "Continue with GitHub" "Продолжить с GitHub", "Continue with Google" "Продолжить с Google", "Copied." "Скопировано.", "Copy" "Копировать", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "Скопируйте и сохраните токен сейчас. Повторно он не отображается.", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "Не удалось проверить статус входа. Обновите страницу.", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "Не удалось создать. Обновите страницу и попробуйте снова.", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "Не удалось выдать. Обновите страницу и попробуйте снова.", "Could not load." "Не удалось загрузить.", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "Не удалось связаться со Stripe. Попробуйте позже; если проблема повторяется, обратитесь по адресу support@kotoba.cloud.", "Could not read linked accounts." "Не удалось получить данные о привязанных аккаунтах.", "Could not remove." "Не удалось удалить.", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "Не удалось отозвать. Обновите страницу и попробуйте снова.", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "Не удалось запустить. Обновите страницу и повторите попытку.", "Could not unlink." "Не удалось отвязать.", "Create an organization first." "Сначала создайте организацию.", "Create organization" "Создать организацию", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "Создание сессии проверки Stripe…", "Creating the organization…" "Создание организации…", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "Можно дополнительно подключить проверку документов (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com). Данные карты и документы передаются только в Stripe; kotoba.cloud хранит лишь статус, срок действия и ссылку на подтверждающие данные. Проверка действует 365 дней.", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "Каждая область доступа утверждается индивидуально для исследований. С истёкшей или приостановленной областью доступа запуск инференса невозможен.", "Eligible" "Доступно", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "Доступно. Ваш бесплатный лимит активен.", "Email domains" "Домены электронной почты", "Environment variables" "Переменные окружения", "Free allowance" "Бесплатный лимит", "Go to billing" "Перейти к биллингу", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "Привязка Google / GitHub пока не включена в этой среде.", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "Google / GitHub только идентифицируют аккаунт. Сам вход выполняется через пасскей или кошелёк — никогда через пароль.", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "Правила ограждения, файрвола и соответствия требованиям, а также их версии показаны в разделе «Средства защиты».", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "Хендл должен иметь вид com-<имя>.kotoba.cloud.", "How verification works" "Как работает проверка", "IdP assertion confirmed" "Подтверждение от IdP получено", "IdP assertion required" "Требуется подтверждение от IdP", "IdP re-assertion required" "Требуется повторное подтверждение от IdP", "Identity verification" "Подтверждение личности", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "Срок подтверждения личности истёк. Пройдите проверку повторно.", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "Подтверждение личности не завершено. Начните его в разделе «Подтверждение личности» выше.", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "Приглашённые участники получают доступ к общим API-токенам, областям доступа и биллингу. Роли: owner / admin / member / billing.", "Issue a connection token" "Выпустить токен подключения", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "Выпустите токен подключения для локального CLI- или IDE-агента. Он показывается только один раз.", "Issue it from this page." "Выпустите его на этой странице.", "Issued tokens" "Выпущенные токены", "Link GitHub" "Привязать GitHub", "Link Google" "Привязать Google", "Linked accounts" "Привязанные аккаунты", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "Привязка аккаунта Google или GitHub позволяет кнопке «Продолжить с Google» в следующий раз предложить пасскей этого аккаунта. Привязанный аккаунт лишь обозначает аккаунт — это не способ входа.", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "Агенты с поддержкой MCP, такие как Claude Code, читают ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "Приглашение участников становится доступно после создания организации.", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "Участниками управляет провайдер идентификации организации (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta и другие). Участник, удалённый из IdP, теряет доступ к организации при следующей повторной аутентификации.", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "Пока нет утверждённых прав доступа. Подайте заявку после регистрации исследователя.", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "Нет действующего маршрута доверия. Начните проверку заново.", "No linked accounts." "Нет привязанных аккаунтов.", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "Пока нет организаций. Введите handle, чтобы создать организацию.", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "Команды пока нет. Создайте организацию, чтобы получить роль owner и приглашать участников.", "No tokens issued" "Токены не выданы", "Not signed in." "Вы не вошли в систему.", "Not verified" "Не подтверждено", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "Настроить это может только owner или admin.", "Open security controls" "Открыть управление безопасностью", "Open the guide" "Открыть руководство", "Organization" "Организация", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "SSO организации (Team / Enterprise)", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "SSO для организации ещё не включён в этой среде.", "Organization handle" "Handle организации", "Organizations and teams" "Организации и команды", "Pending" "На проверке", "Policy re-acceptance required." "Требуется повторное принятие условий использования.", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "Предоплаченные и виртуальные карты не подходят для верификации. Добавьте обычную кредитную или дебетовую карту.", "Principal" "Принципал", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "Несоответствие принципала. Обратитесь в поддержку.", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "Интервал повторной аутентификации (часы)", "Refresh" "Обновить", "Remove SSO" "Удалить SSO", "Removed." "Удалено.", "Require IdP authentication" "Требовать аутентификацию через IdP", "Research access" "Доступ к исследовательской среде", "Revoke" "Отозвать", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "Отозвать все токены, выданные до регистрации", "Role mapping (group=role)" "Сопоставление ролей (group=role)", "Save SSO" "Сохранить SSO", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "Сохранено. Теперь участники могут проходить аутентификацию через IdP организации.", "Security controls" "Управление безопасностью", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "Требуется повторная проверка сессии. Перезагрузите страницу.", "Sign in" "Войти", "Sign in again before unlinking." "Перед отключением войдите в систему повторно.", "Sign in first." "Сначала войдите в систему.", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "Войдите, чтобы управлять верификацией личности, доступом к исследовательской среде, организациями, биллингом и токенами подключения.", "Start verification" "Начать верификацию", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "После запуска вы перейдёте к проверке Stripe (если карта не привязана — оформление на checkout.stripe.com, проверка документов — на verify.stripe.com).", "Status" "Статус", "Team" "Команда", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "Этот аккаунт Google/GitHub уже привязан к другой учётной записи Kotoba.", "That handle is already taken." "Этот идентификатор уже занят.", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "IdP не является способом входа. Участники сначала входят по passkey или через кошелёк, а затем проходят аутентификацию через IdP организации, чтобы получить членство. Роли: admin / member / billing; роль owner через IdP никогда не назначается.", "The organization service is not connected yet." "Служба организаций пока не подключена.", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "Принципал — это неизменный идентификатор, по которому kotoba.cloud узнаёт вас. Он не меняется при замене passkey или кошелька.", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "Подтверждённая бесплатная исследовательская квота никогда не тарифицируется. Платные объёмы приобретаются без автопополнения.", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "Выпуск токенов пока не включён. Повторите попытку позже.", "Unavailable" "Недоступно", "Under review or additional checks required." "На рассмотрении или требуется дополнительная проверка.", "Unlink" "Отключить", "Unlinked." "Отключено.", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "Отключение не влияет на вход по passkey или через кошелёк.", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "Использование из CLI / IDE", "Use from an agent" "Использование из агента", "Username" "Имя пользователя", "Verification is complete." "Проверка личности завершена.", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "Служба проверки личности временно недоступна. Повторите попытку позже.", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "Служба проверки личности недоступна. Обновите страницу позже.", "Verified" "Подтверждено", "What is a linked account?" "Что такое привязанная учётная запись", "What is a principal?" "Что такое принципал", "What is a scope?" "Что такое scope", "What is organization SSO?" "Что такое SSO организации", "asserted" "подтверждено", "enforced" "обязательно", "not required" "не требуется", "optional" "необязательно", "revoked " "отозвано "}, :su {" and " " jeung ", "(no label)" "(teu aya label)", ". The full guide is at " ". Pituduh lengkep aya di ", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." ". Token dibatalkeun hiji-hiji tina daptar di luhur; ti saat éta API bakal ngajawab 401 token-revoked.", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "Peryogi plan Team atawa Enterprise.", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "Pamariksaan AML/CTF parantos kadaluwarsa. Peryogi diperiksa deui.", "About charges" "Ngeunaan biaya", "Account" "Akun", "Add or resume card" "Tambahkeun atawa teruskeun kartu", "All legacy tokens revoked." "Sadaya token lawas geus dibatalkeun.", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "Organisasi dikaluarkeun salaku DID did:webvh; kaanggotaan diatur ku verifiable credentials (VC). Nu nyieun bakal nampa peran owner.", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "Persetujuan bakal otomatis lamun Stripe geus rengse. Segerkeun kaca ieu pikeun ningali parobahan. Upami anjeun ninggalkeun proses input kartu di tengah jalan, teruskeun di handap.", "Approved scopes" "Scope anu disatujui", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "Otentikasi ku IdP organisasi", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "Sayogi pikeun organisasi dina plan Team / Enterprise. SAML acan didukung.", "Billing and credits" "Tagihan jeung kredit", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "Tagihan masih dina validasi. Pameuli teu acan bisa dilakukeun.", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "Tagihan peryogi rekonsiliasi. Kontak dukungan.", "Billing service unavailable." "Layanan tagihan teu sayogi.", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "Input kartu dibatalkeun. Teruskeun di handap.", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "Kartu geus katarima. Persetujuan bakal nuturkeun notifikasi ti Stripe, biasana dina sababaraha detik. Paké 状態を更新 pikeun mariksa deui.", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "Verifikasi kartu: daptarkeun kartu kredit atawa debit pikeun ngalengkepan (checkout.stripe.com). Kartu prabayar jeung virtual teu ditarima.", "Checking sign-in state…" "Ngaperiksa status asup…", "Checking the identity provider…" "Ngaperiksa IdP…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "Ngaperiksa status asup anjeun…", "Configured" "Dikonfigurasi", "Connection token (shown once)" "Token sambungan (ditembongkeun sakali)", "Continue with GitHub" "Teruskeun ku GitHub", "Continue with Google" "Teruskeun ku Google", "Copied." "Geus dikopi.", "Copy" "Kopi", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "Kopi jeung simpen token ayeuna. Éta moal ditembongkeun deui.", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "Teu tiasa mariksa status asup. Segerkeun.", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "Teu tiasa dijieun. Segerkeun jeung cobian deui.", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "Teu tiasa ngaluarkeun. Segerkeun jeung cobian deui.", "Could not load." "Teu tiasa dimuat.", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "Teu tiasa ngahubungi Stripe. Cobian deui engké; upami masih lumangsung, kontak support@kotoba.cloud.", "Could not read linked accounts." "Teu tiasa maca akun anu disambungkeun.", "Could not remove." "Teu tiasa dihapus.", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "Teu tiasa dibatalkeun. Segerkeun jeung cobian deui.", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "Teu tiasa mimiti. Refresh sareng cobian deui.", "Could not unlink." "Teu tiasa mutuskeun tautan.", "Create an organization first." "Jieun organisasi heula.", "Create organization" "Jieun organisasi", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "Nyiptakeun sesi verifikasi Stripe…", "Creating the organization…" "Nyiptakeun organisasi…", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "Verifikasi dokumen (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) tiasa ditambihkeun. Detail kartu sareng dokumen dikirim ngan ka Stripe; kotoba.cloud ngan nyimpen status, waktos kadaluwarsa, sareng référénsi bukti. Verifikasi kadaluwarsa saatos 365 dinten.", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "Unggal scope disatujui dumasar dasarna sorangan pikeun panalungtikan. Scope anu parantos kadaluwarsa atanapi dieureunkeun teu tiasa ngajalankeun inference.", "Eligible" "Layak", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "Layak. Kuota gratis anjeun tiasa dianggo.", "Email domains" "Domain email", "Environment variables" "Variabel lingkungan", "Free allowance" "Kuota gratis", "Go to billing" "Buka kaca billing", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "Tautan Google / GitHub teu acan diaktipkeun dina lingkungan ieu.", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "Google / GitHub ngan saukur ngaidentifikasi akun. Prosés asup nyalira ngagunakeun passkey atanapi wallet — sanes kecap konci.", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "Aturan guardrail, firewall, sareng compliance sareng versina ditingalikeun dina Security controls.", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "Handle kedah marupakeun format com-<name>.kotoba.cloud.", "How verification works" "Kumaha verifikasi jalanna", "IdP assertion confirmed" "Assertion IdP dikonfirmasi", "IdP assertion required" "Assertion IdP diperlukeun", "IdP re-assertion required" "Assertion IdP kedah diulang", "Identity verification" "Verifikasi identitas", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "Verifikasi identitas parantos kadaluwarsa. Verifikasi deui.", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "Verifikasi identitas teu acan lengkep. Mimitian di 本人確認 di luhur.", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "Anggota anu diulem babarengan ngagunakeun token API, scope, sareng billing. Peran nyaéta owner / admin / member / billing.", "Issue a connection token" "Kaluarkeun token koneksi", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "Kaluarkeun token koneksi pikeun agent CLI / IDE lokal. Ditembalkeun ngan sakali.", "Issue it from this page." "Kaluarkeun tina kaca ieu.", "Issued tokens" "Token anu parantos dikaluarkeun", "Link GitHub" "Tautkeun GitHub", "Link Google" "Tautkeun Google", "Linked accounts" "Akun anu ditautkeun", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "Nautkeun akun Google atanapi GitHub ngajadikeun \"Lanjutkeun ku Google\" nawiskeun passkey akun ieu dina waktos payun. Akun anu ditautkeun ngan saukur nandakeun akun; sanes cara pikeun asup.", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "Agent anu kompatibel MCP sapertos Claude Code maca ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "Uleman anggota bakal muka sanggeus organisasi dijieun.", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "Anggota diatur ku identity provider organisasi (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta, sareng anu sanésna). Anggota anu dicabut tina IdP bakal leungit aksés organisasi dina interval otentikasi ulang salajengna.", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "Teu acan aya scope anu disatujui. Ajukeun sanggeus ngadaptar jadi panalungtik.", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "Teu aya jalur kapercayaan anu aktip. Mimitikeun deui verifikasi.", "No linked accounts." "Teu aya akun anu ditautkeun.", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "Teu acan aya organisasi. Lebetkeun handle pikeun nyieun hiji.", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "Teu acan aya tim. Jieun organisasi pikeun jadi owner sareng ngondang anggota.", "No tokens issued" "Teu aya token anu diterbitkeun", "Not signed in." "Teu acan asup.", "Not verified" "Tacan diverifikasi", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "Ngan owner atanapi admin anu tiasa ngonfigurasi ieu.", "Open security controls" "Buka kontrol kaamanan", "Open the guide" "Buka pituduh", "Organization" "Organisasi", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "SSO Organisasi (Team / Enterprise)", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "SSO Organisasi tacan diaktifkeun dina lingkungan ieu.", "Organization handle" "Handle organisasi", "Organizations and teams" "Organisasi jeung tim", "Pending" "Nungguan", "Policy re-acceptance required." "Kedah nyatujuan deui kawijakan.", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "Kartu prabayar sareng kartu virtual teu tiasa dianggo pikeun verifikasi. Tambihkeun kartu kiridit atanapi debit biasa.", "Principal" "Principal", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "Principal teu cocog. Hubungi dukungan.", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "Interval otentikasi ulang (jam)", "Refresh" "Anyarkeun", "Remove SSO" "Piceun SSO", "Removed." "Dipiceun.", "Require IdP authentication" "Peryogikeun otentikasi IdP", "Research access" "Akses riset", "Revoke" "Bolaykeun", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "Bolaykeun sadaya token anu diterbitkeun samémeh registrasi", "Role mapping (group=role)" "Pemetaan peran (group=role)", "Save SSO" "Simpen SSO", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "Disimpen. Anggota ayeuna tiasa asup maké IdP organisasi.", "Security controls" "Kontrol kaamanan", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "Diperyogikeun verifikasi ulang sesi. Muat ulang kaca ieu.", "Sign in" "Asup", "Sign in again before unlinking." "Asup deui heula samémeh ngaleupaskeun tautan.", "Sign in first." "Asup heula.", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "Asup pikeun ngatur verifikasi identitas, akses riset, organisasi, tagihan, sareng token sambungan di ieu.", "Start verification" "Mimitian verifikasi", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "Mimitian bakal mawa anjeun ka pamariksaan Stripe (setelan kartu di checkout.stripe.com upami teu aya kartu kacatet, dokumén di verify.stripe.com).", "Status" "Status", "Team" "Tim", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "Akun Google/GitHub éta parantos ditautkeun kana akun Kotoba anu lian.", "That handle is already taken." "Handle éta geus dipaké.", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "IdP sanés cara pikeun asup. Anggota kedah asup heula ku passkey atawa wallet, saterasna otentikasi ka IdP organisasi pikeun kéngingkeun kaanggotaan. Peran nyaéta admin / member / billing; owner moal pernah dibéré ku IdP.", "The organization service is not connected yet." "Layanan organisasi acan disambungkeun.", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "Principal nyaéta idéntifier stabil anu dipaké ku kotoba.cloud pikeun mikawanoh anjeun. Ieu moal robah lamun anjeun ngagentos passkey atawa wallet.", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "Jatah panalungtikan gratis anu geus diverifikasi moal pernah dicharge. Kapasitas bayar dibeuli tanpa top-up otomatis.", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "Penerbitan token acan diaktifkeun. Cobaan deui engké.", "Unavailable" "Teu Tiasa Dianggo", "Under review or additional checks required." "Keur ditinjau atawa peryogi pariksa tambahan.", "Unlink" "Pegatkeun", "Unlinked." "Geus dipegatkeun.", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "Mutuskeun tutumbu teu mangaruhan kana asup ku passkey atawa wallet.", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "Paké tina CLI / IDE", "Use from an agent" "Paké tina agén", "Username" "Username", "Verification is complete." "Verifikasi geus réngsé.", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "Layanan verifikasi samentara teu tiasa dianggo. Cobaan deui engké.", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "Layanan verifikasi teu tiasa dianggo. Refresh deui engké.", "Verified" "Kaverifikasi", "What is a linked account?" "Naon ari akun anu ditutumbu?", "What is a principal?" "Naon ari principal?", "What is a scope?" "Naon ari scope?", "What is organization SSO?" "Naon ari SSO organisasi?", "asserted" "diasertasi", "enforced" "wajib", "not required" "teu diwajibkeun", "optional" "opsional", "revoked " "dicabut "}, :ur {" and " " اور ", "(no label)" "(کوئی لیبل نہیں)", ". The full guide is at " "۔ مکمل رہنما یہاں دستیاب ہے: ", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." "۔ ٹوکنز کو اوپر دی گئی فہرست سے ایک ایک کر کے منسوخ کیا جاتا ہے؛ اس لمحے سے API 401 token-revoked کا جواب دیتا ہے۔", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "Team یا Enterprise پلان درکار ہے۔", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "AML/CTF جانچ کی مدت ختم ہو گئی ہے۔ دوبارہ جائزہ درکار ہے۔", "About charges" "چارجز کے بارے میں", "Account" "اکاؤنٹ", "Add or resume card" "کارڈ شامل کریں یا جاری رکھیں", "All legacy tokens revoked." "تمام پرانے ٹوکنز منسوخ کر دیے گئے ہیں۔", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "ایک تنظیم کو did:webvh DID کے طور پر جاری کیا جاتا ہے؛ رکنیت کا انتظام قابل تصدیق اسناد (VC) کے ذریعے کیا جاتا ہے۔ تخلیق کار کو owner کا کردار دیا جاتا ہے۔", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "جب Stripe اپنا عمل مکمل کر لے تو منظوری خود بخود ہو جاتی ہے۔ تبدیلی دیکھنے کے لیے اس صفحے کو ریفریش کریں۔ اگر آپ نے کارڈ کے اندراج کو درمیان میں چھوڑ دیا تھا، تو نیچے سے جاری رکھیں۔", "Approved scopes" "منظور شدہ اسکوپس", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "تنظیم کے IdP سے تصدیق کریں", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "یہ Team / Enterprise پلانز پر موجود تنظیموں کے لیے دستیاب ہے۔ SAML ابھی تک سپورٹ نہیں کی جاتی۔", "Billing and credits" "بلنگ اور کریڈٹس", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "بلنگ کی توثیق جاری ہے۔ ابھی خریداری دستیاب نہیں ہے۔", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "بلنگ کو ریکنسیلیئشن کی ضرورت ہے۔ سپورٹ سے رابطہ کریں۔", "Billing service unavailable." "بلنگ سروس دستیاب نہیں ہے۔", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "کارڈ کا اندراج منسوخ کر دیا گیا تھا۔ نیچے سے جاری رکھیں۔", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "کارڈ موصول ہو گیا۔ منظوری Stripe کے نوٹیفکیشن کے مطابق ہوتی ہے، عام طور پر چند ثانیوں میں۔ دوبارہ چیک کرنے کے لیے \"حالت کو تازہ کریں\" استعمال کریں۔", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "کارڈ کی تصدیق: اسے مکمل کرنے کے لیے کریڈٹ یا ڈیبٹ کارڈ رجسٹر کریں (checkout.stripe.com)۔ پری پیڈ اور ورچوئل کارڈز قبول نہیں کیے جاتے۔", "Checking sign-in state…" "سائن اِن کی حالت چیک ہو رہی ہے…", "Checking the identity provider…" "شناختی فراہم کنندہ (IdP) کی جانچ ہو رہی ہے…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "آپ کی سائن اِن کی حیثیت چیک ہو رہی ہے…", "Configured" "تشکیل شدہ", "Connection token (shown once)" "کنکشن ٹوکن (ایک بار دکھایا جائے گا)", "Continue with GitHub" "GitHub کے ساتھ جاری رکھیں", "Continue with Google" "Google کے ساتھ جاری رکھیں", "Copied." "کاپی ہو گیا۔", "Copy" "کاپی کریں", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "ٹوکن کو ابھی کاپی کر کے محفوظ کر لیں۔ یہ دوبارہ کبھی نہیں دکھایا جائے گا۔", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "سائن اِن کی حالت چیک نہیں ہو سکی۔ ریفریش کریں۔", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "بنایا نہیں جا سکا۔ ریفریش کر کے دوبارہ کوشش کریں۔", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "جاری نہیں ہو سکا۔ ریفریش کر کے دوبارہ کوشش کریں۔", "Could not load." "لوڈ نہیں ہو سکا۔", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "Stripe سے رابطہ نہیں ہو سکا۔ کچھ وقت بعد دوبارہ کوشش کریں؛ اگر مسئلہ برقرار رہے تو support@kotoba.cloud سے رابطہ کریں۔", "Could not read linked accounts." "منسلک اکاؤنٹس نہیں پڑھے جا سکے۔", "Could not remove." "ہٹایا نہیں جا سکا۔", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "منسوخ نہیں ہو سکا۔ ریفریش کر کے دوبارہ کوشش کریں۔", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "شروع نہیں ہو سکا۔ ریفریش کر کے دوبارہ کوشش کریں۔", "Could not unlink." "منسلکی ختم نہیں کی جا سکی۔", "Create an organization first." "پہلے ایک تنظیم بنائیں۔", "Create organization" "تنظیم بنائیں", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "Stripe تصدیقی سیشن بنایا جا رہا ہے…", "Creating the organization…" "تنظیم بنائی جا رہی ہے…", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "دستاویزی تصدیق (Stripe Identity، verify.stripe.com) شامل کی جا سکتی ہے۔ کارڈ کی تفصیلات اور دستاویزات صرف Stripe کو جاتی ہیں؛ kotoba.cloud صرف حیثیت، مدت ختم ہونے کی تاریخ اور ثبوت کا حوالہ رکھتا ہے۔ تصدیق 365 دن بعد ختم ہو جاتی ہے۔", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "ہر اسکوپ اپنی بنیاد پر تحقیق کے لیے منظور ہوتا ہے۔ مدت ختم شدہ یا معطل اسکوپ انفرنس نہیں چلا سکتا۔", "Eligible" "اہل", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "اہل۔ آپ کی مفت مقدار دستیاب ہے۔", "Email domains" "ای میل ڈومینز", "Environment variables" "ماحولیاتی متغیرات", "Free allowance" "مفت مقدار", "Go to billing" "بلنگ پر جائیں", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "اس ماحول میں Google / GitHub لنکنگ ابھی فعال نہیں ہے۔", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "Google / GitHub صرف اکاؤنٹ کی شناخت کرتے ہیں۔ سائن ان کے لیے پاس کی یا والٹ استعمال ہوتا ہے — پاس ورڈ کبھی نہیں۔", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "گارڈریل، فائروال اور تعمیل کے قواعد اور ان کے ورژن سیکیورٹی کنٹرولز میں دکھائے جاتے ہیں۔", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "ہینڈل کی شکل com-<name>.kotoba.cloud جیسی ہونی چاہیے۔", "How verification works" "تصدیق کیسے کام کرتی ہے", "IdP assertion confirmed" "IdP تصدیق کی تصدیق ہو گئی", "IdP assertion required" "IdP تصدیق درکار ہے", "IdP re-assertion required" "IdP دوبارہ تصدیق درکار ہے", "Identity verification" "شناختی تصدیق", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "شناختی تصدیق کی مدت ختم ہو گئی ہے۔ دوبارہ تصدیق کریں۔", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "شناختی تصدیق نامکمل ہے۔ اسے اوپر موجود \"本人確認\" میں شروع کریں۔", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "مدعو کردہ ممبرز API ٹوکنز، اسکوپس اور بلنگ کا اشتراک کرتے ہیں۔ کردار owner / admin / member / billing ہیں۔", "Issue a connection token" "کنکشن ٹوکن جاری کریں", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "مقامی CLI / IDE ایجنٹ کے لیے کنکشن ٹوکن جاری کریں۔ یہ صرف ایک بار دکھایا جاتا ہے۔", "Issue it from this page." "اسے اسی صفحے سے جاری کریں۔", "Issued tokens" "جاری کردہ ٹوکنز", "Link GitHub" "GitHub منسلک کریں", "Link Google" "Google منسلک کریں", "Linked accounts" "منسلک اکاؤنٹس", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "Google یا GitHub اکاؤنٹ منسلک کرنے سے اگلی بار \"Continue with Google\" اس اکاؤنٹ کی پاس کی پیش کرے گا۔ منسلک اکاؤنٹ صرف اکاؤنٹ کی شناخت کے لیے ہے؛ یہ سائن ان کا طریقہ نہیں ہے۔", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "MCP کی صلاحیت رکھنے والے ایجنٹس جیسے Claude Code پڑھتے ہیں ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "تنظیم بننے کے بعد ممبر کی دعوتیں کھل جاتی ہیں۔", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "ممبرز کا انتظام تنظیم کے شناختی فراہم کنندہ (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace، Microsoft Entra ID، Okta وغیرہ) کے ذریعے ہوتا ہے۔ IdP سے ہٹایا گیا ممبر اگلی دوبارہ توثیق کے وقفے پر تنظیم تک رسائی کھو دیتا ہے۔", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "ابھی کوئی منظور شدہ اسکوپ نہیں ہے۔ محقق کی رجسٹریشن کے بعد درخواست دیں۔", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "کوئی موجودہ اعتماد کا راستہ نہیں ہے۔ تصدیق دوبارہ شروع کریں۔", "No linked accounts." "کوئی منسلک اکاؤنٹس نہیں ہیں۔", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "ابھی تک کوئی تنظیم نہیں ہے۔ ایک بنانے کے لیے ہینڈل درج کریں۔", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "ابھی تک کوئی ٹیم نہیں ہے۔ owner بننے اور ممبران کو مدعو کرنے کے لیے ایک تنظیم بنائیں۔", "No tokens issued" "کوئی ٹوکن جاری نہیں کیا گیا", "Not signed in." "سائن ان نہیں ہے۔", "Not verified" "غیر تصدیق شدہ", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "صرف owner یا admin ہی اسے ترتیب دے سکتے ہیں۔", "Open security controls" "سیکیورٹی کنٹرولز کھولیں", "Open the guide" "گائیڈ کھولیں", "Organization" "تنظیم", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "تنظیمی SSO (Team / Enterprise)", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "اس ماحول میں تنظیمی SSO ابھی فعال نہیں ہے۔", "Organization handle" "تنظیم کا ہینڈل", "Organizations and teams" "تنظیمیں اور ٹیمیں", "Pending" "زیرِ التوا", "Policy re-acceptance required." "پالیسی کی دوبارہ منظوری درکار ہے۔", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "پری پیڈ اور ورچوئل کارڈز تصدیق کے لیے استعمال نہیں کیے جا سکتے۔ ایک عام کریڈٹ یا ڈیبٹ کارڈ شامل کریں۔", "Principal" "پرنسپل", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "پرنسپل میچ نہیں ہوا۔ سپورٹ سے رابطہ کریں۔", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "دوبارہ تصدیق کا وقفہ (گھنٹے)", "Refresh" "تازہ کریں", "Remove SSO" "SSO ہٹائیں", "Removed." "ہٹا دیا گیا۔", "Require IdP authentication" "IdP تصدیق لازمی بنائیں", "Research access" "ریسرچ رسائی", "Revoke" "منسوخ کریں", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "رجسٹری سے پہلے جاری کیے گئے تمام ٹوکنز منسوخ کریں", "Role mapping (group=role)" "رول میپنگ (group=role)", "Save SSO" "SSO محفوظ کریں", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "محفوظ ہو گیا۔ ممبران اب تنظیم کے IdP سے تصدیق کر سکتے ہیں۔", "Security controls" "سیکیورٹی کنٹرولز", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "سیشن کی دوبارہ تصدیق درکار ہے۔ اس صفحے کو دوبارہ لوڈ کریں۔", "Sign in" "سائن ان", "Sign in again before unlinking." "منقطع کرنے سے پہلے دوبارہ سائن ان کریں۔", "Sign in first." "پہلے سائن ان کریں۔", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "شناختی تصدیق، ریسرچ رسائی، تنظیموں، بلنگ اور کنکشن ٹوکنز کا انتظام یہاں کرنے کے لیے سائن ان کریں۔", "Start verification" "تصدیق شروع کریں", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "شروع کرنے سے آپ Stripe چیک پر منتقل ہو جاتے ہیں (اگر کوئی کارڈ درج نہیں ہے تو checkout.stripe.com پر کارڈ سیٹ اپ، دستاویزات verify.stripe.com پر)۔", "Status" "حیثیت", "Team" "ٹیم", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "یہ Google/GitHub اکاؤنٹ پہلے ہی کسی دوسرے Kotoba اکاؤنٹ سے منسلک ہے۔", "That handle is already taken." "یہ ہینڈل پہلے سے استعمال میں ہے۔", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "IdP سائن ان کرنے کا طریقہ نہیں ہے۔ ممبران پہلے پاس کی یا والٹ سے سائن ان کرتے ہیں، پھر رکنیت حاصل کرنے کے لیے تنظیم کے IdP سے تصدیق کرتے ہیں۔ کردار admin / member / billing ہوتے ہیں؛ owner کبھی IdP سے تفویض نہیں ہوتا۔", "The organization service is not connected yet." "تنظیم کی سروس ابھی منسلک نہیں ہے۔", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "پرنسپل وہ مستحکم شناخت کنندہ ہے جس سے kotoba.cloud آپ کو پہچانتا ہے۔ پاس کی یا والٹ تبدیل کرنے پر یہ نہیں بدلتا۔", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "تصدیق شدہ مفت ریسرچ الاؤنس پر کبھی چارج نہیں لگتا۔ ادا شدہ گنجائش بغیر خودکار ٹاپ اپ کے خریدی جاتی ہے۔", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "ٹوکن اجراء ابھی فعال نہیں کیا گیا۔ بعد میں دوبارہ کوشش کریں۔", "Unavailable" "دستیاب نہیں", "Under review or additional checks required." "زیرِ جائزہ ہے، یا اضافی جانچ درکار ہے۔", "Unlink" "لنک ختم کریں", "Unlinked." "لنک ختم کر دیا گیا۔", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "لنک ختم کرنے سے پاس کی یا والٹ سے سائن ان کرنے پر کوئی اثر نہیں پڑتا۔", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "CLI / IDE سے استعمال", "Use from an agent" "ایجنٹ سے استعمال", "Username" "یوزر نیم", "Verification is complete." "شناختی تصدیق مکمل ہو گئی ہے۔", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "شناختی تصدیق کی سروس عارضی طور پر دستیاب نہیں۔ بعد میں دوبارہ کوشش کریں۔", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "شناختی تصدیق کی سروس دستیاب نہیں۔ بعد میں ریفریش کریں۔", "Verified" "تصدیق شدہ", "What is a linked account?" "منسلک اکاؤنٹ کیا ہے؟", "What is a principal?" "پرنسپل کیا ہے؟", "What is a scope?" "سکوپ کیا ہے؟", "What is organization SSO?" "تنظیمی SSO کیا ہے؟", "asserted" "تصدیق شدہ", "enforced" "لازمی", "not required" "تصدیق ضروری نہیں", "optional" "اختیاری", "revoked " "منسوخ شدہ "}, :zh-Hans {" and " " 与 ", "(no label)" "（无标签）", ". The full guide is at " "。完整指南请见 ", ". Tokens are revoked one by one from the list above; from that moment the API answers 401 token-revoked." "。可在上方列表中逐一撤销令牌，撤销后 API 将立即返回 401 token-revoked。", "A Team or Enterprise plan is required." "需要 Team 或 Enterprise 方案。", "AML/CTF screening has expired. Re-review is required." "AML/CTF 审查已过期，需要重新审核。", "About charges" "关于费用", "Account" "账户", "Add or resume card" "添加或继续登记卡片", "All legacy tokens revoked." "已撤销所有注册前发放的旧令牌。", "An organization is issued as a did:webvh DID; membership is managed with verifiable credentials (VC). The creator receives the owner role." "组织以 did:webvh DID 的形式发放，成员资格通过可验证凭证（VC）管理。创建者将获得 owner 角色。", "Approval happens automatically when Stripe completes. Refresh this page to see the change. If you left the card entry midway, resume below." "Stripe 验证完成后会自动通过审核，刷新此页面即可看到状态变化。如果卡片信息尚未填写完成，可在下方继续操作。", "Approved scopes" "已授权的权限范围", "Authenticate with the organization's IdP" "使用组织的 IdP 进行认证", "Available to organizations on the Team / Enterprise plans. SAML is not supported yet." "仅适用于 Team / Enterprise 方案的组织，目前尚不支持 SAML。", "Billing and credits" "账单与额度", "Billing is in validation. Purchases are not available yet." "账单正在验证中，暂时无法购买。", "Billing needs reconciliation. Contact support." "账单需要核对，请联系支持团队。", "Billing service unavailable." "账单服务当前不可用。", "Card entry was cancelled. Resume below." "卡片信息填写已取消，可在下方继续操作。", "Card received. Approval follows Stripe's notification, usually within seconds. Use 状態を更新 to re-check." "已收到卡片信息。审核结果将在 Stripe 通知后自动生效，通常只需几秒钟。可点击“状態を更新”重新检查。", "Card verification: register a credit or debit card to complete it (checkout.stripe.com). Prepaid and virtual cards are not accepted." "卡片验证：请登记信用卡或借记卡以完成验证（checkout.stripe.com）。不支持预付卡和虚拟卡。", "Checking sign-in state…" "正在检查登录状态…", "Checking the identity provider…" "正在检查身份提供方…", "Checking your sign-in status…" "正在检查登录状态…", "Configured" "已配置", "Connection token (shown once)" "连接令牌（仅显示一次）", "Continue with GitHub" "使用 GitHub 继续", "Continue with Google" "使用 Google 继续", "Copied." "已复制。", "Copy" "复制", "Copy and store the token now. It is never shown again." "请立即复制并妥善保存令牌，离开此页面后将无法再次查看。", "Could not check the sign-in state. Refresh." "无法检查登录状态，请刷新页面。", "Could not create. Refresh and retry." "创建失败，请刷新后重试。", "Could not issue. Refresh and retry." "发放失败，请刷新后重试。", "Could not load." "加载失败。", "Could not reach Stripe. Try again later; if it persists, contact support@kotoba.cloud." "无法连接到 Stripe，请稍后重试。如问题持续，请联系 support@kotoba.cloud。", "Could not read linked accounts." "无法读取关联账户信息。", "Could not remove." "删除失败。", "Could not revoke. Refresh and retry." "撤销失败，请刷新后重试。", "Could not start. Refresh and retry." "无法开始，请刷新后重试。", "Could not unlink." "无法取消关联。", "Create an organization first." "请先创建组织。", "Create organization" "创建组织", "Creating the Stripe verification session…" "正在创建 Stripe 验证会话……", "Creating the organization…" "正在创建组织……", "Document verification (Stripe Identity, verify.stripe.com) can be added. Card details and documents go to Stripe only; kotoba.cloud keeps the status, the expiry and an evidence reference. Verification expires after 365 days." "可另外添加证件验证（Stripe Identity，verify.stripe.com）。银行卡信息和证件仅发送给 Stripe；kotoba.cloud 只保留验证状态、有效期和证据引用。验证将在 365 天后失效。", "Each scope is approved on its own basis for research. An expired or suspended scope cannot run inference." "每个权限范围都会根据其研究依据单独审批。已过期或已暂停的权限范围无法运行推理。", "Eligible" "符合资格", "Eligible. Your free allowance is available." "符合资格。您可以使用免费额度进行研究。", "Email domains" "电子邮件域名", "Environment variables" "环境变量", "Free allowance" "免费额度", "Go to billing" "前往账单", "Google / GitHub linking is not enabled in this environment yet." "此环境尚未启用 Google / GitHub 关联功能。", "Google / GitHub only identify the account. Signing in itself uses a passkey or a wallet — never a password." "Google / GitHub 仅用于识别账户。登录本身使用通行密钥或钱包，绝不使用密码。", "Guardrail, firewall and compliance rules and their versions are shown under Security controls." "护栏、防火墙和合规规则及其版本信息可在“安全控制”中查看。", "Handle must look like com-<name>.kotoba.cloud." "句柄格式必须为 com-<名称>.kotoba.cloud。", "How verification works" "验证流程说明", "IdP assertion confirmed" "已确认 IdP 认证", "IdP assertion required" "需要 IdP 认证", "IdP re-assertion required" "需要重新进行 IdP 认证", "Identity verification" "身份验证", "Identity verification has expired. Re-verify." "身份验证已过期，请重新验证。", "Identity verification is incomplete. Start it in 本人確認 above." "身份验证尚未完成。请在上方的“本人確認”中开始验证。", "Invited members share API tokens, scopes and billing. Roles are owner / admin / member / billing." "受邀成员将共享 API 令牌、权限范围和账单。角色包括 owner / admin / member / billing。", "Issue a connection token" "发行连接令牌", "Issue a connection token for a local CLI / IDE agent. It is shown once." "为本地 CLI / IDE 代理发行连接令牌。该令牌仅显示一次。", "Issue it from this page." "请在本页面发行。", "Issued tokens" "已发行的令牌", "Link GitHub" "关联 GitHub", "Link Google" "关联 Google", "Linked accounts" "关联账户", "Linking a Google or GitHub account lets \"Continue with Google\" offer this account's passkey next time. A linked account names the account; it is not a way to sign in." "关联 Google 或 GitHub 账户后，下次可以通过“使用 Google 继续”调用此账户的通行密钥。关联账户只是账户的标识，并非登录方式。", "MCP-capable agents such as Claude Code read " "支持 MCP 的代理（如 Claude Code）会读取 ", "Member invitations open once an organization exists." "创建组织后即可开放成员邀请。", "Members are managed by the organization's identity provider (OpenID Connect: Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and others). A member removed from the IdP loses organization access at the next re-authentication interval." "成员由组织的身份提供方（OpenID Connect：Google Workspace、Microsoft Entra ID、Okta 等）进行管理。若某成员从 IdP 中被移除，将在下一次重新认证时失去组织访问权限。", "No approved scopes yet. Apply after researcher registration." "尚无已批准的权限范围。请在完成研究者注册后申请。", "No current trust route. Restart verification." "当前没有有效的信任路径，请重新进行验证。", "No linked accounts." "暂无关联账户。", "No organizations yet. Enter a handle to create one." "尚未加入任何组织。请输入一个 handle 来创建组织。", "No team yet. Create an organization to become owner and invite members." "暂无团队。创建组织后即可获得 owner 角色并邀请成员。", "No tokens issued" "尚未发行任何令牌", "Not signed in." "尚未登录。", "Not verified" "未验证", "Only an owner or admin can configure this." "仅 owner 或 admin 可以进行此配置。", "Open security controls" "打开安全管理", "Open the guide" "打开指南", "Organization" "组织", "Organization SSO (Team / Enterprise)" "组织 SSO（Team / Enterprise）", "Organization SSO is not enabled in this environment yet." "此环境尚未启用组织 SSO。", "Organization handle" "组织 handle", "Organizations and teams" "组织与团队", "Pending" "验证中", "Policy re-acceptance required." "需要重新同意使用条款。", "Prepaid and virtual cards cannot be used for verification. Add a regular credit or debit card." "预付卡和虚拟卡无法用于身份验证。请添加常规的信用卡或借记卡。", "Principal" "Principal", "Principal mismatch. Contact support." "与记录的 principal 不匹配，请联系支持团队。", "Re-authentication interval (hours)" "重新认证间隔（小时）", "Refresh" "刷新状态", "Remove SSO" "删除 SSO", "Removed." "已删除。", "Require IdP authentication" "要求进行 IdP 认证", "Research access" "研究环境使用权限", "Revoke" "撤销", "Revoke every token issued before the registry" "撤销注册之前发行的所有令牌", "Role mapping (group=role)" "角色映射（group=role）", "Save SSO" "保存 SSO", "Saved. Members can now assert with the organization's IdP." "已保存。成员现在可以通过“使用组织的 IdP 进行认证”登录。", "Security controls" "安全管理", "Session reverification required. Reload this page." "需要重新验证会话，请重新加载此页面。", "Sign in" "登录", "Sign in again before unlinking." "请重新登录后再取消关联。", "Sign in first." "请先登录。", "Sign in to manage identity verification, research access, organizations, billing and connection tokens here." "登录后即可在此管理身份验证、研究环境使用权限、组织、账单和连接令牌。", "Start verification" "开始身份验证", "Starting moves you to the Stripe check (card setup at checkout.stripe.com when no card is on file, documents at verify.stripe.com)." "开始后将跳转至 Stripe 验证页面（若未登记卡片，将在 checkout.stripe.com 完成卡片设置；证件验证在 verify.stripe.com 进行）。", "Status" "确认状态", "Team" "团队", "That Google/GitHub account is already linked to another Kotoba account." "该 Google / GitHub 账户已关联到另一个 Kotoba 账户。", "That handle is already taken." "该用户标识已被占用。", "The IdP is not a way to sign in. Members first sign in with a passkey or a wallet, then authenticate with the organization's IdP to obtain membership. Roles are admin / member / billing; owner is never granted by an IdP." "IdP 并非登录方式。成员需先使用通行密钥或钱包登录，再通过组织的 IdP 进行认证以获得成员身份。角色分为 admin / member / billing 三种，owner 角色永远不会由 IdP 授予。", "The organization service is not connected yet." "组织服务尚未连接。", "The principal is the stable identifier kotoba.cloud knows you by. It does not change when you replace a passkey or a wallet." "主体标识是 kotoba.cloud 用来识别你的稳定标识符。更换通行密钥或钱包后不会改变。", "The verified free research allowance is never charged. Paid capacity is bought without automatic top-up." "已验证的免费研究额度永不计费。付费额度为一次性购买，不会自动充值。", "Token issuance is not enabled yet. Try again later." "令牌发放功能尚未启用，请稍后重试。", "Unavailable" "无法验证", "Under review or additional checks required." "审核中，或需要进一步核验。", "Unlink" "解除关联", "Unlinked." "已解除关联。", "Unlinking does not affect signing in with a passkey or a wallet." "解除关联不会影响使用通行密钥或钱包登录。", "Use from a CLI / IDE" "从 CLI / IDE 中使用", "Use from an agent" "从代理中使用", "Username" "用户名", "Verification is complete." "身份验证已完成。", "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Try again later." "身份验证服务暂时不可用，请稍后重试。", "Verification service is unavailable. Refresh later." "无法连接身份验证服务，请稍后刷新重试。", "Verified" "已验证", "What is a linked account?" "什么是关联账户？", "What is a principal?" "什么是主体标识？", "What is a scope?" "什么是权限范围？", "What is organization SSO?" "什么是组织 SSO？", "asserted" "已认证", "enforced" "强制", "not required" "无需验证", "optional" "可选", "revoked " "已撤销 "}})
